<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">-Kamano-Kafe</book>
  <para style="h">Jop</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jop</para>
  <para style="mt2">Jopu avontafere</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu avu'ava zamofone fenoma ante'nea zamofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Korapara mago nera Jopu'e nehaza nekino Usi mopafi mani'ne. Agra hazenke'a omne ne' maka zampina mani fatgo huno nemanino, Anumzamofonku korora nehuno kefo avu'ava'zana amefi hunemia ne' mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Jopu'a 7ni'a ne' mofavreraminki 3'a mofa'neraminki huno zamante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>Hagi fenoma ante'neana 7tauseni'a sipisipi afutaminki, 3tauseni'a kemoli afutaminki, hozama eri bulimakao afutamina 500'agi, 500'a a' donki afutaminki huno nenteno, rama'a eri'za vahetamima'a mani'neankino, maka vahe'ma zage hanati kazigama mani'naza vahera Jopu'a zamagatereno tusi'a feno ne' mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Hagi Jopu ne' mofavreramimo'za zamasarahehe'ina kehazage'za e'za, magomofo nompi atru hu'za tusi'a ne'zana kre'za nene'za musenkasea hutere hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Hagi ana'ma hu'za ne'zama kre'za nene'za musenkasema huvagama retazageno'a, mofavre'amo'za ne'zama kre'za nene'za musenkasema hazafina kumima nehu'za Anumzamofoma huhaviza hunte'nesagura, nanterana Jopu'a ana maka mofavreramima'a kehutru huno zmente zmente sipisipi afura aheno tevefi kre fananehu ofa huno zamazeri agru Anumzamofo avurera hutere hu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma knazampima ufre'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Hagi mago zupa Anumzamofo ankero vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamofo avuga atru hunaku neazageno, Sata'a anampina egeno, <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>Ra Anumzamo'a antahigeno, Kagra igati ane? Higeno Sata'a amanage huno kenona hu'ne, Nagra mopafi vano vano nehuregati oe. <verse eid="JOB 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Anage higeno Ra Anumzamo'a amanage huno antahige'ne, Eri'za vahe'ni'a Jopu'a maka zampina mani fatgo huno nemanino, Anumzamo'nagu korera nehuno, kefo avu'ava zana amefi hunemia ne' mani'neanki kagra ke'nano? <verse eid="JOB 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Huno antahigegeno Sata'a amanage huno Ra Anumzamofona kenona hunte'ne, Kagra tamage hananagi, Jopu'a agafa'a me'nere agra Anumzamokagura korora hunegante. <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Kagra vihugna hu'nenka mika kaziga agri'ene a' mofavre'ane mika'zama'anena kegava hunte'nane. Hagi agrama mani'nea mopafina mika zama hiazana asomu hunentankeno afufeno zama'amo'a ome ra huno mika zampina avite'ne. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Hianagi kzama rusutenka mika zama'ama ahe fananema hanankeno'a, kavu negesankeno huhaviza hugantegahie. <verse eid="JOB 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>Higeno Ra Anumzamo'a huno, Nagra hu izo hugantoanki, vunka Jopu'ma ante'nea zantmintera amne avako hunka eri haviza hugahane. Hianagi Jopu avufgarera avakora osutfa huo. Anage higeno Ra Anumzamofo avugatira Sata'a atreno vu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sata'ma reheno Jopuma ke'nea zamofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Hagi mago zupa Jopu ne'mofamo'za nempu'zimimofo nompi ne'zana kre'za nene'za waini tina nene'za musenkase nehu'za mani'nazageno, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>eri'za ne'mo'a Jopunte eno amanage eme hu'ne, Hozama eri bulimakao afutmimo'za hoza enerizageno, donki afutamimo'za trazana ana hoza tavaonte nene'za mani'nazageno, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Sabea kumateti vahe'mo'za e'za ha' eme hurante'za, ana maka eri'za vahetmina bainati kazinteti zamahe hana nehu'za, bulimakao afutamine donki afutaminena maka zamavare hana hu'za vazage'na, nagrake'za mani'nena ana naneke kasminaku fre'na oe. <verse eid="JOB 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Anage huno ana nanekema asmi vagaore'negeno ete mago eri'za ne'mo'a, agareno eno amanage eme hu'ne, Anumzamofo tevemo monafinti eramino mika sipisipi afutaminka'ane mika sipisipi afu kva vahetaminena teno eri hana hige'na anampintira nagrake mani'nena ana naneke kasminaku fre'na oe. <verse eid="JOB 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>Anage huno ana nanekea asmi vagaore'negeno, ete nampa 3 eri'za ne'mo'a agareno eno amanage eme hu'ne, 3'a kevu hu'za e'naza Kaldia vahe'mo'za eri'za vaheka'a mika bainati kazinteti eme zamahe hana nehu'za, mika kemori afuka'aramina musufase'za vazage'na, anampintira nagrake frena ana naneke kasminaku oe. <verse eid="JOB 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Anage huno ana nanekea asmi vagaore'negeno, ete mago eri'za ne'mo'a agareno eno amanage eme hu'ne, Ne'mofaka'amo'za nempu'zmimofo nompi ne'zana kre'za neneza waini tina nene'za musenkase nehu'za mani'nazageno, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>ame huno ka'ma kokampinti tusi'a zaho erino eno, anama mani'naza nomofona mika kaziga asoparega eme amino ahe pasru hutregeno, ana nomo'a pasru huno ana maka ne'mofaka'a zamahe fri vagarege'na, ana knazampintira nagrake atiramina fre'na kasaminaku oe.<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Higeno Jopu'ma ana nanekema nentahino'a, tusi asunku nehuno otino zaza kukena'a tagato nehuno, aseni azokara hareno eri rampage nehuno, mopafi maseno Anumzamofona mono hunenteno, <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>amanage hu'ne, Nenarera arimpafintira kukena osu navufa navapake e'noanki'na, fri'na vanuana navufa navapa vugahue. Agra Ra Anumzamo namiteno, ete Agra'a e'nerie. E'ina hu'neanki'na, Ra Anumzamofo ra agi amue. <verse eid="JOB 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Hagi ama ana mika knazampima Jopu'ma unefreno'a, Ra Anumzamofona kna amino huhaviza hunteno kumira osu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu avufare'ma krima fore hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Hagi mago zupa Anumzamofo ankeromo'za ete Ra Anumzamofo avugama eme atru hunaku'ma neazageno'a, Sata'a anampi e'ne. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'a amanage huno antahige'ne, Kagra igati ane? Higeno Sata'a amanage huno kenona hu'ne, Nagra mopafi vano vano nehureti oe. <verse eid="JOB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Ra Anumzamo'a ete mago'ane Satana antahigeno, Eri'za vaheni'a Jopuna kenampi onke'nane? Mopafina agrikna vahera omani'neankino maka zampina mani fatgo huno nemanino, hazenke'a omanegeno Anumzamo'nagu korera nehuno, kefo avu'ava zana nosia ne' mani'ne. Agra mago hazenkea osu'nea zante, rehe'na kesue hanke'na hugantogenka maka zama'a omeri haviza hu'nananagi, agra ko'ma mani'nea kante mani fatgo huno mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Hianagi Sata'a ana kemofo nona'a amanage huno Ra Anumzamofonkura hu'ne, Avufgare'ma hazenkema fore'ma hinkeno'a, mika zama'a atreno agra'a avufga agura vazigahie. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Hianagi Jopu avufgare'ma krima neminka zaferina'ama eri havizama hanankeno'a negesnankeno huhaviza hugantegahie. <verse eid="JOB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>Anage higeno Ra Anumzamo'a huno, Knareki amne kavesinia zana Jopu avufgarera hugahananagi, asimu'a e'orio. <verse eid="JOB 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Higeno Sata'a Ra Anumzamofo avugatira atreno vuno Jopuna mika avufafina usage namu omeri fore humigeno, aga agusareti'ma vuno asenire'ma uhanati'neana usage namumo'a avite'ne. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Ana higeno Jopu'a tanefapi mani'neno, tako hu'nea mopa kavo atupa'a erino namuma'afina zuke nehateno mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Ana'ma nehigeno'a nenaro'a huno, Amanahu zama nehigenka kagra nagafare fatgo kavukvara hunka neane? Ama atrenka Anumzamofona huhaviza huntegeno kahe frina frio. <verse eid="JOB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Hianagi Jopu'a kenona huno, Kagra negi nagi a'nemo'ma nehiankna ke nehane! Anumzamo'ma knare'zantamima tamisnigeta e'nerisuta'a, na'a hanigeta havi zanena e'origahu'e. Anage nehuno ana maka zama avufgare'ma fore'ma hia kna'afina, Jopu'a mago kumira keaga'afina osu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jopu rone'amo'za eme ke'naza naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Hagi Jopu avufgare'ma hazenkema fore'ma hiankema nentahi'za 3'a arone'amo'za kea hu'za antahi'za hute'za, nozmia atre'za zamasunku'ma hunente'za azeri hanaveti kema asaminagura e'naze. Ana vahe'mokizmi zamagi'a, Temani vahepinti ne' Elifasi'ma, Suhi vahepinti ne' Biltati'ma, Na'ama vahepinti ne' Zofari'e. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Hagi afeteti'ma Jopuma eme nege'za ru vahe mani'ne hu'za kesavri hu'naze. Ana nehu'za erava'oma hu'za nege'za tusi krafa hu'za zavira nete'za tanefara hatregonefi'za tusi zamasunku hunte'naze. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Ana hute'za 7ni'a knafi Jopu'enena mopafina mani'naze. Hagi ana knafina mago'mo'e huno Jopuna kea huomi'ne. Na'ankure Jopu'a tusi'a atazampi mani'neankino kea humigara osu'nege'za anara hu'naze.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma knazampima manino kragima ru'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Ana'ma hutegeno'a Jopu'a agira reaka huno nerera'ma kasente'nea knamofona hu haviza hunteno, <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>amanage huno hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>nenarera'ma kasenante'nea knamo'a omanegeno, ese'ma nenarera arimpafima fore'ma nehugeno ne' fore hugahie hu'nea kenagemo'a omaneasina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Hagi atregeno e'i ana knamo'a hani fore nehigeno, zagemo'a remsa hunontegeno Anumzamo'enema ana knama kegavama osiresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Hagi e'i ana knama kumazu hanimo'ma kintrako nehigeno, hampoma kino refitentegeno hanintirima huno ana knama azeri koroma hiasina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Hagi e'i ana kenage'ma fore'ma hu'noa kenage'ma fore osigeno, mago kafumofo knaramima nehamprizafina ohamprige, ikamofo knama hamprizafina ohamprizaresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Hagi e'i ana kenagera kasefa mofavrea forera osigeno, vahe'mo'za musena osazasina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Hagi kazusima huzante'ma ugotama hu'naza vahe'mo'zama kazusima hazageno, hagerimpima tusizaga krokotairima azeri oneti'za ana knama kazusima huntazaresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Hagi ko'matu hanafimo'a remsa huontegeno, masagura amuhara hugahianagi, amnezampi amuhara nehuno nanterama segeno'ma ko'manetia zana onkeresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Hagi ana knarera nenrerana arimpa erigigeno, kaseonantege'na ama hazenkeramina onkoasina knare hisine.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>Hagi nagra nerera agu'afima fri'nogeno kasenantege, kasemanantea kna zupama fruresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Nahigeno nenrera'a amotera navrentege'na mani'nogeno ami'na nami'ne? <verse eid="JOB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Hagi nenrera'ma kasemanantea knazupama frusina, menina mago knazana onke fri'na knare hu'na mani fru husine. <verse eid="JOB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>Kini vahetamine, mago mago mopare'ma kegavama hu'naza vahetamima frizageno'ma knare nonkumazmimo'ma menima havizama huno me'nea vahetaminema frina umanigasa huresina knare hiresine. <verse eid="JOB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>Ana nehu'na goline silvanema nozmifima antevite'naza ugagota kva vahetmimo'zama fri'naza vahe'enema menina manigasa huresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Hagi nahigeno nenarera'a fri mofavrea kasenantege'na masa onke'na ofri'noe? <verse eid="JOB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Na'ankure kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zane nomani zampima amuhoma nehu'za maraguzamati'za e'naza vahe'mo'zanena fri vahe kumapina mani fru nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Hagi kazokzo eri'zama e'neriza vahe'mo'zama fri'za fri vahe kumapima vazana, kegava huzmante vahera omanizage'za knare hu'za ana kumapina mani fru nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Feno vahe'ene zamunte omne vahe'enena anampi manizageno, kazo kazo eri'za vahetmina kvazmia omani'ne.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>Nagafare knazampima mani'naza vahe'ene hazenkefima nemaniza vahera tavira nezaminka nomanizazmimo'ma amuhoma nehia vahera zamatranke'za zamasimura eri'za nemanize? <verse eid="JOB 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Fri'zanku'ma avega antaza vahe'mo'za nofrize. Hagi knare zama mopa agu'afima me'nege'za keri kafi'za hakazaza hu'za fri'zankura nehakraze. <verse eid="JOB 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>Hagi ana vahe'ma frizage'za asezmantage'za tusi muse nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Nagafare nomani zamo'ma amuhoma huntea vahera remsa hunteno Anumzamo'a asimura amigeno mani'negeno, hazenkezanura azeri kanegie? <verse eid="JOB 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Ra nasimu'ma nente'na kragi'ma neruna zavi'ma atoazamo'a tinkna huno navunumo'a herafiramige'na ne'zana one'noe. <verse eid="JOB 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Koro'ma hunentoa zamo navatera ne-egeno, nagogogu'ma nehua zamo nagritera fore huno nazeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Nagra mani fru hu'na manirava nohe'na manigasa nosuanki, hazenkefi manivava nehue.<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s">Elifasi'ma agra'a antahi'zama eri ama huno Jopuma asami'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Hagi anante Temani mopafinti ne' Elifasi'a amanage huno kenona hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>Mago vahe'mo'ma kagri'enema nanekema hu'zama nehanigenka akohenka mani'nenka ontahigahano? Hagi nagra nagitera aze'ori'na hunaku'ma hanua nanekea amne kasmigahue. <verse eid="JOB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Rama'a vahe antahintahia nezminka, hankavezmi omne vahera zamazeri hankaveti'nane. <verse eid="JOB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Tanafa'ma hu'za mase'zama nehaza vahetmina, nanekeka'amo'a zamazeri hankavenetino, zaferina omne amnema hia vahera hankavea nezamie. <verse eid="JOB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Hianagi menima knazampi nemaninkeno'a krimpamo'a haviza nehie. Hazenke zamo'ma kavate'ma egenka kagogogu nehane. <verse eid="JOB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Anumzamofonku'ma koro hunentenka fatgo hunka nemaninazanku kamentintia nehunka, Anumzamo naza hugahie nehano? <verse eid="JOB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>Kagesa antahigo, hazenke'a omne vahe'mo'a amnea frigahifi? Hagi fatgo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera inantega ahe fri'negenka ke'nane? <verse eid="JOB 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Hagi nagrama ke'na antahi'nama hu'noana, hozama eri'za avimzama hankre'za hamarazankna hu'za kefo avu'avazama nehaza vahe'mo'za hazenke'za nehamaraze. <verse eid="JOB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Anumzamofo rimpa ahezamo'a, zaho'mo'ma maka'zama eri haviza hiaza huno, Agra asimu'ma antea zantetira zamahe fanane nehie. <verse eid="JOB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Zamagra ha' laionimo'ma ha' hunaku nehiaza hu'za krafa nehu'za, rekazigazi hugahazanagi, hanave laionimofona aheno avera rutafrigahie. <verse eid="JOB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Hagi ana ha' laionimo'za ahe'zama nenaza zaga omanisige'za zamagaku nehu'za mofavrezmia atresage'za panini hu'za hazagre'za vu'za e'za hugahaze.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>Hagi tamage nanekea oku'a sumi sumi hu'za eme nasmizage'na antahi'noe. <verse eid="JOB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Vahe'mo'za mase himrenageno, kenage ava'nafi ana nanekea eme nasmizage'na anhintahi hakare nehugeno, <verse eid="JOB 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>tusi nagogo nefegeno, zaferinani'a omne amne nehige'na, tusi nahirahiku hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Mago zaho erino navufi evigeno, navufga nazokamo'a harahara huno oti vagare'ne. <verse eid="JOB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Hagi ana zaho'ma erino'ma evigenama koana, mago zamofo amema'a fore huno oti'neanagi, avufga'a onke'noe. Anama nehigeno agasasama omanenefintira mago agerumo'a anage hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>Anumzamofo avurera mago vahe'mo'a fatgo osu'ne. Tro'ma hurante'nea Anumzamofo avurera magora agru vahera omanifta hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Anumzamo'a eri'za vahe'anena antahi nozmino ankero vahe'amofo havi zamavu'zmava zana refko huno nezamage. <verse eid="JOB 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>Hagi vahera Anumzamo'a mopareti eri kripeno tro hunteneankino (moth) afovage brebrema rehapatiaza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Hagi trazamo'za nantera fore hute'za, kinaga sege'za frizankna hu'za ana fri fanane hazage'za antahi nozamize. <verse eid="JOB 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Seli nozmimofo nofira katufe atrazageno pasru hiankna hu'za knare antahintahi omne vahe nefrize.<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="s">Elifasi'a mago'ene Jopuna keaga asmi'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>Jopuga menina mago'a vahe'mo'za kazama hanagura krafagea hunka ko? Ina ankeromo eme kaza hugahie? <verse eid="JOB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Amne zampima arimpama ahe'zamo neginagi vahera ahenefrigeno, arumofo zanku'ma kenunuma nehuno amefikema hu'zamo antahintahima omne vahera azeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Neginagi vahe'mo'za osi'a knafi feno vahera manizage'na nagra ketogeno, hazenkemo'a ame huno zamazeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Mago'a vahe'mo'za mofavrezimia zamaza hu'za keagafina zamagura ovazizage'za, kuma kafantera zamazeri haviza nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Zamagaku'ma hu'za friza vahe'mo'za ana vahe'mofo hozafintira ne'zana vasage'za nene'za ave'ave trazampinti'enena ne'zana vasage'za nenaze. Ana nehazage'za, tinku'ma zamavesige'za nehazaza hu'za feno zanku'ma nehakaza vahe'mo'za fenozama'a e'nerize. <verse eid="JOB 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Knazamo'a mopafintira hanatino marenorigeno, hazenkezamo'a mopafintira aru hanana huno nohage. <verse eid="JOB 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Tevemo'ma teragareno mareriankna huno, vahe'ma fore'ma hianknaretira agafa huno hazenkezamo'a forera nehie.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>Hianagi Jopuga kagrama hanaza hu'na nagra knazama eruasina, knazani'a Anumzamofo antahigogeno naza hisine. <verse eid="JOB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Agra tusi'a ruzahukna kaguva zantami erifore nehuno, ohampriga'a kaguvazantmina erifore nehiankita, tagra keta antahita osugahune. <verse eid="JOB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Agra higeno mopafina kora runentegeno, hozafinena tina nemie. <verse eid="JOB 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Agra amunte omane vahera zamaza hige'za, mani'zazmifina knarera nehazageno, zavi'ma netaza vahera zamahokeno zamagu nevazie. <verse eid="JOB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Hagi vahe'ma zamazeri havizama hu kazigati'ma knare antahi'za retro nehune nehu'za, havi antahi'zama retro'ma nehaza vahe'mofo antahi'zazmia eri ama higeno, ana antahi'za zamimo'a amane zankna nehie. <verse eid="JOB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Hagi vahe'ma zamazeri havizahu kazigatima knare antahi'za retro nehune nehu'za, havi antahizama retroma nehaza vahe'mofo antahizazmia eriama higeno, ana antahi'za zmimo'a amnezankna nehie. <verse eid="JOB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Hagi ana vahe'mo'za ferura hanimpima vanoma hazankna hu'za vano nehu'za, kinagama omesege'za kenage'ma inkonkima erino'ma viaza hu'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Hianagi ana vahe'mo'zama zamunte omne vahetmima huhavizama hunezmantazageno'a, zamaza nehuno hanave vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehazageno'a zamaza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Hagi zamunte'ma omne vahe'mo'za Anumzamo'ma zamazama hanigu amuhara nehazageno, kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamagira Anumzamo'a ru hamunkige'za kea tagane'za nemanize.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>Anumzamo'ma azeri fatgoma hania vahe'mo'a muse hugahie. E'ina hu'negu kefo avu'ava'ma nehankeno Himamu'ane Anumzamo'ma kazeri fatgoma nehanigenka kavresra hunka kamefira huomio. <verse eid="JOB 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Hagi Anumzamo'a atrenigeno namumo'a kavufgarera fore huno kazeri haviza hugahianagi, ete kazofeno kazeri so'e hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Hagi 6'a zupama hazenkefima ufresankeno'a, Agra kaza hu'neno, 7ni hazenke zama esigeno'a kagu'vazinigeno ana hazenke zamo'a kazeri haviza osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Agra agatonto knama esigeno'a, kazahina nezankura nofrisankeno, ha'ma hu knafina katresigeno bainati kazintetira kahe ofrigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Hagi vahe'mo'zama kefinti'ma kazeri havizama hu'zankura, Anumzamo'a kazeri frakigahianki, hazenke zamo'ma keonke'zama eri havizama huno ne-enigenka korora osuo. <verse eid="JOB 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Ana hanigenka hazenke zamo'ma keonke'zama eri havizama hania zanku'ene agatonto zankura ki'za nerenankeno, afi zagagafamo'za kazeri korora osugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Hagi havege mopamo'a knare hinkenka hoza nentesankeno, afi zagagafamo'za hara reogantegahaze. <verse eid="JOB 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Hagi hazenke zana omnenkeno nonkumaka'amo'a knare huno mesigeno, sipisipi afuzagaka'ama hamprinka kesanana mago'mo'e huno fananea osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Hagi henkama kenka antahinkama hananana mofavreraminka'amo'za rama'a ome hanageno kagehemo'za rama'a ome hu'za ama mopafi tra'zankna hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Hagi witimo'ma kna fatgo'are'ma nenama hige'zama vasagazaza hunka, kagra ozafa omeretenka renteraminka frigahane. <verse eid="JOB 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>Hagi keho, tagra ama ana zana rempi huta keta antahita hu'nonankino, tamage ama ana zana fore hugahianki antahi ani' huo.<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a Elifasi kere kenona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Elifasi'ma anagema hutegeno Jopu'a amanage huno kenona hunte'ne. <verse eid="JOB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>Hagi nasuzampima mani'noa zamofo kna'ane hazenke zani'amofo kna'anema sigerire'ma erinte'za kazasina, <verse eid="JOB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>maka hagerinkenafi kaseparamimofo kna'a agateresine. E'inama hu'nea zankura nagra nagesa antahi so'e osu ame'ama hu'na rama'a kea hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Na'ankure Hihamu'ane Anumzamo'a keve nahetrege'na masenogeno ana keveraminte'ma fre'nea avuatga zamo'a nazeri haviza nehie. Ana nehigeno nazeri koro'ma hu'zantamima Anumzamo'ma huntegeno e'nea zamo'a navuga emanimpi huneno nazeri korora nehie. <verse eid="JOB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Hagi afi donki afu'mo'zane bulimakao afu'mo'za trazama me'nege'zama nene'za krafa nosaze. <verse eid="JOB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Hagi hagema ontegeno'ma hagama osu ne'zana vahe'mo'za amnea negahazafi? Nama amu'amofo efeke'amo'a haga hugahifi? <verse eid="JOB 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Nagra e'inahu' ne'zama avako'ma hu'zankura navresra nehie. E'inahu ne'zama nenogeno'a, amuti nagesa nehige'na ana nezama ne'zankura tusi nagonete. <verse eid="JOB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>E'igu Anumzamo'a nunamuni'a nentahino, nagesama nentahua zana hunantesiegu nave'nesie. <verse eid="JOB 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>Anumzamo'a nare hapati'nige'na fruresina knare nehigeno, Anumzamo'a azana rusuteno nahege'na fruresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Knazampi mani'ne'na natagura nehuanagi, nazeri knare hugahie. Na'ankure knazampima mani'ne'na Ruotge'ma Hu'nemofona kea huhavizana huonte'noe. <verse eid="JOB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>Hankave'ni'a omne'neanki'na hanaveti'na mani'ne'na ama ananknazana eri'na ovugosue. Akohena mani'ne'na ama ana knafima ufre hankaveni'a omnetfa hie. <verse eid="JOB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Hanavenimo'a havegna huno hanavenentake higeno, navufgamo'a bronsimo'ma hiaza hu'nefi? <verse eid="JOB 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Hagi nagra'a naza hugara nosugeno, ama ana knazama agatere kankmuna omnetfa hie.<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>Hagi Hihamu'ane Anumzamofoma korora hunontesnia vahe'mo'agi, rone'amo'ma knafima mani'nenigeno'a knare avu'ava huntegahie. <verse eid="JOB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Hagi nenafugatma tamagra, hagegema hu'nea tinkagomupi ko'ma rigeno tusi tima hageno eteno, ko'ma rusegeno'ma ame huno'ma taneankna vahe mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>Hagi zagemo'ma aisima teze'ze higenoma, tima hageno'ma eviankna vahe mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Hianagi ana timo'a ra zagema regeno'a neranegeno, tusi amuhoma higeno'a, tima eneviretira taneno hagege nehie. <verse eid="JOB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Hagi fenozama zagorema netraza vahe'mo'za (Karivani) hagege ka'ma kokampima enevu'za tinku'ma zamavesige'zama umani fru hu'zama tima nenaku'ma hazana, timo'a tanenege'za tinkura huge'za fri'naze. <verse eid="JOB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Hagi Tema kumateti fenozama zagore'ma netraza vahe'mo'zama enevu'za ana krahopima tinku'ma kazana tina omnene. Hagi Siba kumateti vahe'mo'zanena enevu'za ana tina negahune hu'za amuhara hu'nazanagi onke'naze. <verse eid="JOB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Hagi zamagra ana tina enevifi hu'zama ome kazana ana timo'a tanegeno, ana tima negahunema hu'za amuha'ma hu'za e'naza zamo'a amnezankna hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Hagi menina tamagoana timoma taneaza huta naza hugara osaze. Na'ankure nagri'ma eme nagazana, tusi knaza eri'na mani'nogeta, tusi tamagogogu nehaze.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Nagra mago'mokagura hu'na nagri nagi erinka muse'za amio hu'na huge, magomokagura hu'na fenonka'afintira mago'azana erinka knazampintira atesinka navro hu'na hu'nofi? <verse eid="JOB 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>Hagi ha' vahe'nimofo zamazampintira nagu'vazio hu'na huge, kefo vahetmimofo zamazampintira nagu'vazio hu'na mago'mokagura osu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>Hagi akoheno'ma mani'zana rempi hunaminke'na kea osu' akohe'na mani'neno. Hagi havizama hu'ne'nua zana naveri hiho. <verse eid="JOB 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Tamage nanekema hu'zamo'a tusi katagrigahie. Hianagi keha'ma rezamo'a, nanknare'za erifore hugahie? <verse eid="JOB 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Tamagrama tamagesa antahi'zana, tagrama huna ke antahino amage antegahie huta nehuta, knazampima mani'ne'na nazama huzanku'ma nehakoa vahe'mo'na nanekea eri amne hazageno zahoknara nehio? <verse eid="JOB 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Ana nehutma satu zokago reta negeta, megusa mofavreramine, ronetaminena zagore zamatregahaze. <verse eid="JOB 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>Hianagi menina muse nehuta kama nageho, tamagri tamavufina nagra havige nehufi? <verse eid="JOB 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Tamagra havigea huta kumi hune huta nazeri haviza hu kea osiho. Na'ankure nagra mago hazenkea osu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Tamagrama tamagesama antahi'zana, nagra havige nehufi? Nagra fatgo zane knare zanena ke'na antahi'na osugahufi?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma mani so'ema huno omani'nea zamofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>Vahe'mofo nomani'zamo'a ama mopafina amuho nehie. Hagi nomani zantimo'a, vahe'mo'ma amuhoma huno zago eri'zama eriankna huno tusi amuho nehie. <verse eid="JOB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Nagafare nomani'zantimo'a kazokzo eri'za vahe'mo'za zagefi eri'za e'neri'za tonaku hakrazankna nehigeno, eri'za vahe'mo'za mizazmi e'ori'ne'za miza zimigu avega ante'za manizanknara nehie. <verse eid="JOB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>E'ina hu'negu Anumzamo'a natrege'na rama'a ikampina knare osu nomani'zana mani'na ne-e'na maka kenagera narimpagna nehu'na nasu zampinena mani'na neoe. <verse eid="JOB 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Hagi kenage'ma mase'ne'na, inankna huno ame huno masa hugahie ha hu'na mase rukrahe rukrahe hu'noe. Hianagi ana hanimo'a, ame hunora masa huno kora otu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Hagi navufafina kanimo'a nehigeno namu rifamo'a hantohanto hu'negeno hagege huno hananahanunu hu'ne. Ana nehigeno namumo'a navufafina pro nehigeno avo'mo'a ana namuntamimpintira tusi'za hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>Hagi knama mani'na oanknamo'a ame huno evuevu nehuno, kukenama nehatia nekazamo'ma ame huno'ma kukenafima marerino atiramino'ma nehiaza huno enevige'na, knamaregahue hu'na ontahi'noe.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Anumzamoka kagera okanio, nasimu'ma eri'na mani'zamo'a asimu'ma anteankna higeno knare muse zana mago'ane onkegahue. <verse eid="JOB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Menima nenagaza vahe'mo'za zazakna onagegosaze. Nagrikura hakegahazanagi, nagra omani ko' vugahue. <verse eid="JOB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Hampoma kiteno'ma kiragama hiankna hu'za fri'za fri vahe kumapima vanaza vahe'mo'za ome fanane hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Hagi mago'anena noma'arega ome'nige'za, vahe'mo'za onkegahaze. <verse eid="JOB 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>E'ina hu'negu nagra nagira hamunki'na omanigosuanki, nagu'afima me'nea nata zana huama nehu'na, narimpa haviza hu'zana huama hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Nagra hageri mani'nena, hagerimpi tusi zaga mani'nogenka kegava hunantetenka mani'nano? <verse eid="JOB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Hianagi nagrama antahuana tafe'niare'ma masenua zamo'a nazeri knare nehanigeno, navu'ma mase'zamo narimpa knama hu'na ke hakarema nehuazana eritregahie hu'na nagesa antahi'noe. <verse eid="JOB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>Hianagi ava'nanifina nazeri nagogonefenka, avanagna zampina nazeri koro hane. <verse eid="JOB 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>E'ina higu nata e'ori snuanki nanankena nazeri porari hanage'na fri'neno. <verse eid="JOB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Nasimu'ma eri'na mani'zankura tusiza huno navresra hianki, natrege'na zazatera mani'na ova'neno.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>Vahera nankna zaga mani'nonkenka, hakare zupa vahe'motagura kagesa are'arerara nehane? <verse eid="JOB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>Nagafare Kagra mika nanterane, mika knama enevigenka ame hunka rerahenka ketere nehane? <verse eid="JOB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Kagra amnerega kavua keamne hunka negenka, osi'a kna natresanke'na nagrena nakrigahufi? <verse eid="JOB 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Maka vahete'ma kavuma antenka negana ne'moka, kagri kavure'ma nagra kumi'ma hu'ne'nuana, na'a kumi hu'nogenka ke'nane? Nagafare kagra kavua nagritera antetenka mani'nane? <verse eid="JOB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Nahigenka Kagra kumi'ni'a atre nonantenka, kefo avu'ava zani'a eri notrane? Na'ankure nagra kofa hu'na fri'na kugusopafina mase'nugenka nagrikura hakegahananagi, nagra ko vanugenka onagegosane.<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Sua kumateti ne' Bildati'ma Jopu kenona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Hagi anante Sua kumateti ne' Bildati'a amanage huno Jopuna kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>Hago zazate ama nanekea hane. Kagipinti'ma atiramia nanekemo'a, tusi'a zahokna hie. <verse eid="JOB 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Anumzamo'a fatgo huno refkoma hu avu'ava zana eri arukrahera huno havi avu'ava zana hugahifi? Hihamu'ane Anumzamo'a fatgoma hu'nenia zana, eri arukrahera hugahifi? <verse eid="JOB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Hagi mofavre nagatamimo'zama Anumzamofo avure'ma kumi'ma hazageno'a, ana kumi'zmimofo nona'a ana hazenkefi zamavarenente. <verse eid="JOB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Hianagi kagrama Anumzamofontegama nunamuma hunka Hihamu'ane Anumzamo'ma asunku'ma hugantesigu'ma antahinegenka, <verse eid="JOB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>kavukva zampina fatgo hunka nemaninka, fatgo zanke'ma hanankeno'a, Anumzamo'a tamage huno tra'aretira otino ete kazeri so'e hanigenka, ko'ma mani'nana kante manigahane. <verse eid="JOB 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>E'ina hanigenka ko'ma ante'nanazana agaterenka rama'a zantami antegahane.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>Hagi korapa knafima mani'zama e'naza vahetami zmantahigenka negenka, tagehe'zama mani'zama e'naza nomani'zana negenka rempi hunka antahio. <verse eid="JOB 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Na'ankure tagra meni vahe mani'nonkeno, knatimo'a atupa hu'neankita, mago zana antahita keta osu'none. Ana hu'neankino zagemo'ma rentegeno amema'amo'ma fore huteno ame huno'ma fanenema hiankna huta frigahune. <verse eid="JOB 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Hianagi ko'ma mani'za e'naza vahe'mo'za rempi hugamigahaze. Zamagra korapa vahetmimofo knare antahintahi eri'nazanki'za ana antahintahia rempi hugamigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>Varozamo'a (Papyrus) hapa'ma hu'nesia mopafina knare huno hagegahie. Hagi hapapi uha trazamo'a tima omnenenifina knare huno hagegahio? <verse eid="JOB 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Hagi hapapi varozamo'a zahufama amosrema nehenigeno ana mopafima me'nenia timo'ma hagegema hinkeno'a, ame huno hagege hugahianagi mago'a trazamo'za ame hu'za hagegea osugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Anumzamofoma zamage'nama hunemiza vahe'mokizmire'ma, amuha'ma nehaza zamo'a amane zankna hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Hagi hankave'a omne zante'ma, amuha'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za pamponkemofo nofiteti eri anafru hu'za eramiza haviza hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Nontimo tagu'vazigahie hu'za zamagra azeri akona hugahazanagi, ana zamo'a za'zatera menora ovugahie. <verse eid="JOB 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Hagi Anumzamofoma amagema nontaza vahe'mo'za zagema ohanatinegeno, timo'ma avite'nea mopafi me'nea tra'zamo'ma hozafima agatama reno vuno eno'ma hiaza zamagra nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Hagi ana trazamofo arafu'namo'a hageno havere ome azeri antrako nehie. <verse eid="JOB 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Hianagi ana tra'zama eri vatitresageno'a, ana mopamo'a avresra hunenteno nagra kagrira onkage'noane huno hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Hagi havi avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za osi'a knafi musena hute'za frisageno, ru vahe'mo'za ana mopafina fore hu'za zamagri nona eri'za manigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>Ana nehuno tamage huno Anumzamo'a hazenke'ama omane vahera amefira huomigosie. Hianagi tamagerfa huno kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera aza huno azeri hankavea otigahie. <verse eid="JOB 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Hagi Anumzamo'a kazeri knare hina kagipintira kiza zokago kege nehunka, musenkege hunka manigahane. <verse eid="JOB 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Ha' vahekamo'zama kavresrama hunegantaza vahera zamazeri zamagaze nehuno, kefo vahera zamazeri haviza hugahie.<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a Bildati kere nona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Hagi Jopu'a amanage huno kenona hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>Kagrama hanana tamage hane. Hianagi inankna huno Anumzamofo avurera mago vahe'mo'a fatgo vahera manigahie? <verse eid="JOB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Hagi mago vahe'mo'ma Anumzamofoma tauseni'a zupa keagarera avrenteno keaga huntegahianagi, magore huno keagafina agateoretfa hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Na'ankure Anumzamofona knare antahi'zamo'a avite'nenkino tusi'a hihamu'ane Anumza mani'ne. Hagi Anumzamofoma ha'ma rentaza vahe'mo'za zamagra'a zamavate hazenkea eri'za ketere hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Agra arimpama ahegeno'a, kea osu'neno antri hazaza huno agonaramina zamatufe zamatrege'za haviza nehaza Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Agra mopa eri kaza huno atufetregeno noma'a atreno arufi nevigeno, mopamofo tra'a eri kaza nehia Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Hagi Agrama zagegu'ma huno, hanatinka mareorio huno'ma hanigeno'a, zagemo'a hanatino mareorisnigeno, ofunku'ma remsa osuo huno'ma hinkeno'a, ofumo'a remsa osugosie. <verse eid="JOB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Agrake haroma hiaza huno mona eri rutarenenteno, hagerimo'ma krantonkrantoma hifina agofetura agatre azatre huno vano nehie. <verse eid="JOB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Agrake ofuntamina tro huno kankamunte kankamunte zamantege'za kevure kevure mani'nazankino zamagi'a Beama, Orioma, Pleiadesima, sauti kaziga monafima metruma nehaza hanafitaminena tro hunte'ne. <verse eid="JOB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Agra ruzahu ruzahu zantmi tro huntegeno knare zantfa hu'neankino, ana zantamina hamprigara osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>E'ina hu'neanagi Agrama erava'oma nehige'na nagra nonkogeno, enagatereno'ma eviama'a kena antahi'na nosue. <verse eid="JOB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Hagi Agrama nazanoma erinaku'ma haniazama e'nerisigeno'a, mago vahe'mo'a azeorige, na'a nehane hunora antahi onkegahie.<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Hagi Anumzamo'a rimpa ahe'zana azeorigosiankino Rehapue nehaza osifaveramina hagerimpintira amne zamazerino aganutira zamarehapatigahie. <verse eid="JOB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>E'ina hu'negu nagra iza'na Anumzanena keaga huge, mago'a zamofo nanekea hu'na eri fatgo hugahue? <verse eid="JOB 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Hagi nagrira hazenkeni'a omne'nesianagi nagra iza'na Anumzamofona ke hakarea huntegahue? Hagi magoke'zana Agrama asunku'ma hunantesigu antahigegahue. <verse eid="JOB 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Hagi nagrama keagare'ma avre'na e'na keagama eme huntesuana, nagrama antahuana, tamage huno Agra ke'ni'a antahi onamigahie hu'na nagesa nentahue. <verse eid="JOB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Na'ankure Agra ununko'nu hara renenanteno agafa'a omne zante nazeri havizantfa huno nataza nenamie. <verse eid="JOB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Agra natrege'na nasimura e'noruanki, hazenke namino nasimu kana renkrirege'na natagura nehu'na nasimu ante'zanku nehue.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Hagi nagrama Anumzamofo hanavema rehe'na kenaku'ma hanuanana, nagri hanavea agatereno hanavenentake hu'ne. Hagi keagama erifatgoma hunaku'ma hanuana, keagafina agateregara osu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Nagra hazenkea osu'noanagi, nagra hu'nesua kere anteno hazenke hu'nane huno hunantegahie. Nagra mago havizana osu'noanagi nagrama hu'nesua kemo, kefo avu'ava'ene vahere huno hunantegahie. <verse eid="JOB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>Nagrira mago hazenkeni'a omne'neanagi, nagragura nagesa nontahue. Nagra nasimu'ma eri'na mani'zankura navresra nehie. <verse eid="JOB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Hazenke osu vahero, hazenke vahero, Anumzamofo avurera magozahu vahe mani'none. Agra hazenke osu vahe'ene hazenke vahe'enena zamahe fanane nehie. <verse eid="JOB 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Hagi antrima hazaza huno'ma hazenke zamo'ma hazenke'ama omne vahe'ma ahe frigeno'a Anumzamo'a ana knazankura ki'za nere. <verse eid="JOB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Mago vahe'mo'ompge Anumzamo keagama refkoma nehaza vahera zamavua eri sukigeno, kefo avu'ava'ma hu vahe'mofo azampi mopamo'a nevie. Hagi Anumzamo'ma ana'ma osanigeno'a, iza anara hugahie?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>Zamagama neraza vahe'mo'zama zamagama nerazama'a zamagatereno knanimo'a tusiza huno aganere. Ana hu'neanki'na knare'zana fore hanige'na onkegahue. <verse eid="JOB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Knanimo'a ventemo hagerimpi agasasa oruno agareankna nehuno, tumpamo ne'zaga'a aheno nenaku eri kafagino hareno takaureankna huno knamo'a tusi aganere. <verse eid="JOB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Hagi nagrama knama nehuazama nage'nekani'na, nasunku'ma nehua zana atre'na muse navugosa nehue. <verse eid="JOB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>Hianagi nagra maka nata zankura tusi koro nehue. Na'ankure kagra kefo zani'a nagenka erifore hugahane. <verse eid="JOB 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Ko'ma nageno antahino'ma hige'na kumi vahe' mani'noanki, nagafare nagra amne zampina fatgo vahe'ma mani'zantera maraguzatigahue. <verse eid="JOB 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Hagi sopenutira tina fre'na nazeri agru nehu'na, hankave marasinireti'ma tro'ma hu'naza soperetira nazana sese hugahuanagi, <verse eid="JOB 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>Anumzamo'a hapake kerifi nasaga hutrena, hapake hu'na hi'mnage ha'nenkeno, kukenanimo'enena tusiza huno agote nantegahie. <verse eid="JOB 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>Anumzamo'a mopafi vahe knara osu'neanki'na, nagra Agri'enena fravazige, avre'na keaga huntegera osugahue. <verse eid="JOB 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Hagi amu'nonte vahera magora mani'neresina keagati'a eri fatgo huno tazeri mago hiresine. <verse eid="JOB 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>Agra amu'nonte ne'mo'a Anumzamofona asmigeno kanoma nenamia zana atrege'na ru'enena agrama knazama namino nazeri koro nehia knazankura korora osu'na manusine. <verse eid="JOB 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>Ana hige'na korora osu knazani'amofo keaga Anumzamofona asamusinagi nagra hankaverera e'inara osugahue.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a asimu'ma erino mani'zanku agote'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>Nasimu'ma eri'na mani'zankura tusiza huno nagoteno navresra nehige'na Anumzanimofontega narimpa haviza hu'zana huama hu'na asamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Nagra Anumzamofona asmi'na, Kagra nazeri haviza hu keaga huonanto. Hagi keagama hunanteku'ma nehana ke agafa'a eri ama huo hu'na hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Hanki nazeri havizama nehampintira nankna knare'za erigahane? Kagraka'a kazanuti tro hunante'nana vahe mani'noanki, nagafare kavresra hunenantenka, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama antahintahima retro'ma haza antahintahirera musena nehane? <verse eid="JOB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Hagi kagrama kavuma kanana, vahe'mo'zama zamavuma negazaza hunka nonkane. Hagi vahe'mo'zama keonke'zama kazaza hunka, kagra nonkane. <verse eid="JOB 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Huge mopafi vahe'motama atupa knama nemanunaza hunka atupa kna nemanimpi? Vahe'mota kofa'a kafuma nemanunaza huno, Kagri kafumo'a kofa hu'nefi? <verse eid="JOB 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>E'inama osu'nena nahigenka Kagra kefo navu'navanigu'ene kumi'niagu'enena hanavetinka nehakane? <verse eid="JOB 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Kagra hazenkea osu'nogenka kenka antahinka hu'nananagi, mago'mo'e huno Kagri kazampintira nagura ovazigosie.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>Kagra kazampinti eri kripenka trohunantetenka menina nazeri havizantfa nehane. <verse eid="JOB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Hagi Kagra kageraokaninka antahio, nagrira hapa eri kripenka tro hunante'nane. Hanki Kagra ete ame hunka nazeri kugusopase'za nehano? <verse eid="JOB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Kagra nagrira bulimakaomofo amirima reratiteno, eri kragefeno sisima tro'ma hiankna hunka nenrera arimpafina tro hunante'nane. <verse eid="JOB 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>Hagi kukena ataninanteaza hunka nagu'a navufga amega navufgareti eri ano nevazinka, name'ane zaferinani'anena nagrunanuti hatinka eri rehampri rehampri hunante'nane. <verse eid="JOB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Hagi Kagra nasimu'ma nenaminka mani'zana nenaminka, vagaore kavesi'zana naveri hu'nane. Hagi kagra kegava hunantanke'na ofri'na mani'noe.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>Hianagi Kagrama nazeri havizama nehana zana, kagu'afi eri fraki'nane. Kagra nazeri haviza hunaku, e'inahura hu'nane. <verse eid="JOB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Kagra nenaganke'nama nagrama kumi'ma huasina Kagra kumi'ni'a atre onantasine. <verse eid="JOB 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Nagra kumi'ma huresina havizantfa hisine. Hagi nagri'ma hazenkenima omaneresina, nasenia erisga osu nagazegu nehu'na haviza huresine. <verse eid="JOB 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Hagi nagrama navufga rama hanugenka, laionimo'ma afi'zagama aheno nenaku'ma nevaririankna hunka tusi'a hihamuka'anu hara hunantegahane. <verse eid="JOB 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Hagi maka zupa havizama nehua zana eri ama hunante vava nehunka, Kagra tusi krimpa ahenenantenka sondia vahetmina huzmantanke'za e'za hara eme hunenante'za tusi nata nami'za nazeri haviza nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>Hagi natrankena nenrera agu'afi fruge'za vahe'mo'za onagazanki, nagafare natrankeno nenrera'a kasenante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Nagrira nenarera'ma kaseonantege, narera'ma kasemanenantege'na fruge'za ome asenantazaresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Hagi knanimo'a atupa hianki natrege'na osi'a knafina musena hu'na mani'nena, <verse eid="JOB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>hanintiri huno knare osu kuma'ma, vahe'mo'zama vute'za ete nomaza moparega fri'na va'neno. <verse eid="JOB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>E'i ana mopamo'a kenage hanimo'ma hiaza huno tusi hanintiri huno knarera osu maka zamo'a savri higeno, ana hanimpina tavira re'neanagi ana tavimo'a hanintiri hu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Sofari'ma Jopu kenona hunte'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Hagi anante Na'ama kumati ne' Sofari'a amanage huno Jopuna kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>Rama'a nanekema hana nanekemofona kenona hugante'za hue. Mago vahe'mo'ma rama'a nanekema hania nanekemo'a agrira hazenke'a omne vahere huno aza osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Hagi agafa'a omne nanekema hana nanekegura mago vahe'mo'a kea osugahie hunka nehano? Hagi Anumzamofoma huhavizama hunte'nankeno'a mago vahe'mo'a kazeri kagazea osugosie. <verse eid="JOB 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Kagra hunka, nagrama namentintima nehua zamo'a agru hu'neanki'na, Anumzamofo avurera agru hu'noe hunka nehane. <verse eid="JOB 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'ma nanekema kasamiresina, antahintahi'afima me'nea nanekea kasamisine. <verse eid="JOB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>Agrake'za knare antahi'zane ani antahi'zanena kasamigahie. Na'ankure tamage antahi'zamofona rama'a antahi'zama'a me'ne. E'ina hu'negu ana maka kumi'ma hu'nana avamentera Anumzamo'a knazana nogamianki, osi'a negamie. Na'ankure mago'a kumika'a atreneganteno anara hu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>Hagi kagra Anumzamofona oku'a antahi'zama'a antahi ama' hugahano? Kagra Hihamu'ane Anumzamofo antahintahi'zana, antahi ani' hugahampi? <verse eid="JOB 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Anumzamofo antahi'zamo'a mona agatereno amenametega marerigeno, fri vahe kumara agatereno (Sheol) amefenkame tami'neankinka kagra ana maka antahintahizama'a kenka antahinka osugahane. <verse eid="JOB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Hagi Anumzamofo antahintahi zama'amo'a mopamo'ma ome atre eme atre'ma hu'neama'a agatereno rankrefa nehuno, hagerimo'ma ome atre eme atre'ma hu'neama'a agatereno rankrerfa hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>Hagi Anumzamo'ma eme kavreno kinama hugantege keagafima kavrenteno keagama hugantena iza Anumzamofona i'o huno huntegahie. <verse eid="JOB 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Na'ankure Agra havigema nehaza vahera zamageno antahino nehuno, kumi'zminena antahino keno hu'neankino tamage nanekema erinakura vahera zamantahinoge. <verse eid="JOB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Hianagi afi donki afumo'a vahe anentara kaseontegahie. Ana hukna huno knare antahi'zama omne vahe'mo'a antahi amahu' antahi'zana e'origahie.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>Hagi kagu'ama retrotra'ma nehunka kazama erintesga hunka Anumzamofontegama nunamuna nehunka, <verse eid="JOB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>kazampima kumi'ma me'nesiana atregamu atrenka netrenka, vahe'ma havigema huno azeri haviza hu' avu'ava'zana atro. <verse eid="JOB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>E'inama hanankeno'a kavugosafintira masa nehinkeno, mago hazenkeka'a omnesigenka mago zankura korora osu hankavetinka manigahane. <verse eid="JOB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Hagi hazenke zanka'amo'a tima hageno evu kagatereankna hanigenka, ana hazenkeka'agura kageknigahane. <verse eid="JOB 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>E'ina hanigeno nomizankamo'a rumasa huno zage ferukna nehina, nomanizanka'afima hanima hu'nea zamo'a, nantera zagema hanatino rumsama hiankna hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Ana'ma hanigenka mago zankura korora osugosane, na'ankure knare'zankura amuha nehunka, korora osunka fru hunka manigahane. <verse eid="JOB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Hagi kavu'ma masesanana korora osu nemasesankeno, vahe'mo'za kagesga nehu'za zamazama hanankura kagritega egahaze. <verse eid="JOB 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Hianagi havi zamavu'zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mofo zamavumo'a asu nehinkeno, kama frekazmia omnena frizankuke avega antegahaze.<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma Sofarima azeri fatgo hu nanekema hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Anage higeno Jopu'a amanage huno Sofarina kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>Tamagrama antahi'zana tamagrake maka zana antahita keta hu'nazankino frisageno'a, knare antahi'zamo'a fanane hugahie huta nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Hianagi nagra'enena kagrama hanaza hu'na ama' antahi'zane vahe mani'noe. Iza kagri negi vahera mani'neno, kagrama hanana nanekea nontahie? <verse eid="JOB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>Nagra fatgo vahe mani'nena Anumzamofontega nunamuna nehugeno nunamuni'a antahinenamia vahe mani'noanagi ronenimota hunanteta nagiza neraze. <verse eid="JOB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Hagi knare'ma hu'zama nemaniza, knazampima mani'naza vahera huhaviza huzmante'za, kiza nere'za tanafa'ma haza vahera zamaretufenetraze. <verse eid="JOB 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Hianagi kumzafa vahe'ene Anumzamofoma amage'ma nontaza vahe'mo'za fru hu'za nemani'za, zamagra'a hanavegu antahizageno anumzazmi asenezmanteanagi Anumzamofo Hihamu hanavefi nemanize.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>Hianagi afi zagagafa zmantahigege'za rempi hunegaminagenka, anami kankamumpima hare'za vanoma nehaza namaramina zmantahigege'za kasamiho. <verse eid="JOB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Huge mopamofo antahigegeno rempi hunegamina, atregeno hagerimpi nozamemo'za kasmiho. <verse eid="JOB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Na'ankure nagritegama maka hazenkezama neiana, Anumzamo atregeno neie hu'za ana zagaramimo'za ke'za antahi'za hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Na'ankure mika zagagafamofo asimura Anumzamofo azampi megeno, mika vahe'mofo asimu'mo'enena Agri azampinke me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Hagi ne'zama neneno'ma haga'ama antahiaza huta tagra'a tagesafinti kea nentahita, kea refko huta nentahune. <verse eid="JOB 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Ranra vahepi knare antahi'zana megeno, antahi ama'ma hu' antahi'zana ozafanafafi me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>Hianagi knare antahi'zane hihamunena Anumzamofompi me'negeno Agripinke knare antahi'zane, antahi ama'mahu antahi'zanena me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Anumzamo'ma eri haviza hu'nesia zana mago vahe'mo'a eri so'e hugara osu'ne. Hagi Agrama kinama huntesia vahera mago'mo'a kinafintira katufetregara osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Anumzamo'ma ko'ma neriazama azerinigeno'a, mopamo'a hagage koka megahie. Hagi Agrama tima azerinenireti'ma atresanigeno'a ti hageno mopa refitegahie. <verse eid="JOB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Hagi hihamune knare antahi'zanena Agripi me'neankino, vahe'ma revatgama nehia vahe'ene, anama rezmavatgama nehaza vahe'mo'zanena Agri hanavefi mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Hagi knare antahi'zama vahe'ma nezmiza vahera knare antahi'zazmia erihana nehuno, keagama refkoma nehaza vahera, zamazeri neginagi vahe kna nehie. <verse eid="JOB 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Hagi Agra kini vahe'mokizmia kini kukena'zmia hateno zamafafafi rugagi zmantege'za, kazokzo eri'za vahe kna nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Hagi Agra pristi vahera kukenazmia hatege'za amne vahekna nehazageno, za'za knama kvama mani'za e'naza kva vahe'tmina knare antahizazamia eri netrege'za amne vahekna nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Hagi vahe'mo'zama antahinezmizage'za knare antahi'zama nezmiza vahe'mokizmi zamagira Agra ru hamunenkino, ranra vahe'mokizmi knare antahi'zana erinetre. <verse eid="JOB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Hagi Agra ugagota kva vahetmina zamazeri zamagaze nehuno, hankave vahe'mokizmi ha'zana zamazampintira eri hanarenetre. <verse eid="JOB 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Hagi Agra hanimpima framaki'nea zana eri ama nehuno, hanintirima hu'nea zana remsa higeno rumsa huvaganere. <verse eid="JOB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Hagi Agra vahetamina zamazeri ra hige'za kumara ante'za rama'a vahe fore hutazageno, ete zamahe fanane nehie. Hagi Agra vahera zamazeri ra hige'za, rama'a fore hutazageno, ete zamazeri osira nehie. <verse eid="JOB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Hanki Agra kini vahe'mokizmi antahintahia zamazeri savri hige'za, kana omne ka'ma kokampina neginagi hu'za hazagre'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Hagi ana'ma hige'za hanimpi eri'eri hu'za vano nehaze. Ana nehu'za aka tima nenea vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'za traka truku hu'za vano nehaze.<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Jopuna rune'amo'zama hunte'naza kegu havige nehaze hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>Hagi tamagra antahiho, ama ana maka nanekema tamagrama hazana nagra navufinti'ene nagesafinti antahi'na ke'na hute'na, antahi ama hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Hagi nagra'enena tamagrama hu'nazaza hu'na ama' antahi'zane vahe mani'noankita nagrira nagateore'naze. <verse eid="JOB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Hianagi nagra Hihamu'ane Anumzane nanekea hu'za nehue. Knafima mani'nama nevua zanku Anumzamo'ene keharare'za nehue. <verse eid="JOB 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Tamagra ana maka'mota havige tusa vahe'mota, havi naneke nenasamize. Tamagra knare osu tusa vahe mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Hagi tamagrama tamagi'ma hamunkita manisnuta knare antahi'zana erigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Hagi knama e'nerua zanku'ma ke ha'mareramante'nuana tamagesa anteta antahiho. <verse eid="JOB 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Hagi tamagra havigereti Anumzamofona aza hanune huta keagafina nehazo? Tamagra Anumzamofo kaziga anteta azahunaku kehara nehazo? <verse eid="JOB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Tamagra Anumzamofo kaziga anteta nanekea keagafina aza huta nehuta, Anumzamofo kaziga anteta aza hu'za nehazo? <verse eid="JOB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Hagi amana'ma nehazazama tamageno erifore'ma hanuno'a, Agra knare avu'ava huramantegahifi? Hagi tamagra vahe'ma revatgama nehazaza huta Anumzamofona revatga hugahazo? <verse eid="JOB 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Tamagrama oku'ama havige huta Anumzamofoma azama hunaku'ma hanazana, hazenkefi manigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Agra hihamu masa'anuti tamazeri koro hinketa, tusi tamagogogu hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Hagi knare antahi'zama eri naneketmimo'a, amnezankna huno tanefakna hugahie. Hagi tamagra'a kema eri hanavetiku'ma nehaza kemo'a mopa kavomo'ma tako'ma nehiankna nehie.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a kumi'ma hu'nenigu Anumzamofo antahige'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>Hanki tamagra kea osutma natrenke'na mani'neno. Hagi natrenke'na nagrani'a kea nehu'na anankemofo nona'a nagra'a eri'neno. <verse eid="JOB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Hagi frisuo, manisuana nagri'za me'neanki'na, na'aneoma hunaku'ma hanua nanekea amne hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Anumzamo'a nahe frigahianagi, mago'arega amuha'zani'a omne'neanki Agripinke me'ne. Nagra knazani'a eri'na Agri'ene kehara hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Hianagi ama ana'ma hanua zamo'a nagu'vazigahie. Na'ankure Anumzamofo avuga kumi vahe'mo'za e'za keaga eme osugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Hagi nanekema hanuana antahi so'e hiho. Tamagesa ante so'e huneta nanekema hanuana antahiho. <verse eid="JOB 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Hagi nagrama keagafima hanua keaga hago retrotra hu'noanki'na, nagrani'a hazenkeni'a omne'ne hu'na nazeri ama hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Hagi ama ana nanekema nehanugeno'a iza haviza hu'nane hunora hugahie? Hagi ana nanekema hanugetama havige hanema huta hanage'na, nagra ke osu' mani'ne'na frigahue.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>Hagi Anumzamoka tare zanku kantahigoanki, tare'za hunantege'na nagra kagri kavurera frara oki'neno. <verse eid="JOB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Nagritetira kazana erisga hunka nazeri haviza nosunka, knazana naminka nazeri korora osuo. <verse eid="JOB 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Hagi Kagra keaga nasmige'na kenona huganta'neno. Huge natrege'na keaga kasmi'nena kenona hunka nasamio. <verse eid="JOB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Nagra nama'a hazenke hu'na kumira hu'nofi nasmige'na antahi'neno? Nagra nankna kazigati krimpa eri haviza hu'na kumira hu'nofi naveri huo? <verse eid="JOB 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Nahigenka kamagena hunenaminka, ha' vahe'ka'ama hunentana kavukvara hunenantane? <verse eid="JOB 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Hagi Kagra zaho'mo'ma eri tasinoma via zafa ani'na azeri koro nehunka, hagage trazama zaho'mo'ma eri hareno'ma viana nevaririno? <verse eid="JOB 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Hagi Kagrama hana nanekemo'a natage'za nenamigenka, nehazavema mani'nenama hu'noa kumira eri nagumpina nentane. <verse eid="JOB 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Kagra tarega nagiararena zafafi erintenka kina hunenantenka, kama vanoma nehuankana rezaganenka negenka maka nagaka negane. <verse eid="JOB 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>Hagi vahe'mota tavufgamo'a kasri zankna huge, atafa kukena hakanomo neankna nehie.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a vahe'mo'ma nefria zanku hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>Hagi a'nemo'zama vahe'ma kasezmantege'za osi'a kna nemani'za rama'a knazampina unefraze. <verse eid="JOB 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Trazamo amosre ahenteteno, ame huno friankna vahe'mota nehune. Huge zagemo hanatino remsa higeno amema'amo ame huno fore huteno, ame huno fanane hiankna nehune. <verse eid="JOB 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Hagi Kagra e'inahu vahete kavua antenka ketenka mani'nano? Kagra e'inahu vahe zamavarenka keaga huzmantenka refkoa hunezmantano? <verse eid="JOB 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Hagi agruma osu vahera, iza azeri agru hugara hu'ne? I'o mago'mo'a anara osutfa hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Hagi manita vanuna kna Kagra antahinka kenka hu'nane. Tagra nama'a ika manita vugahune, Kagra antahinka kenka hu'nanankinka, ko e'inahu kna'afi manigahaze hunka hunte'nanankino, mago vahe'mo'a agra'ama manino'ma vania kna'a azeri za'zara huno omanigahie. <verse eid="JOB 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>E'ina hu'negu amnerega kavua antenka negenka, natrege'na mani'ne'na zago eri'za eneri'za vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'na manisua kna'afina eri'zana e'neri'na musenkasea ha'neno.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>Na'ankure zafama antagima atrazage'za, ete hagegahune hu'za amuhara nehazanki'za kasefa agata hage'za azankunatmina omere emere hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Hagi ana zafamofo arafu'namo'a ome ra huno osaparesingeno, agafa'amo'a hagege huno mopafina kasrigahie. <verse eid="JOB 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>Hianagi mopafina tima me'nenigeno'a ana zafamo'a ete agata hageno, kasefa zafagna huno hageno marerigahie. <verse eid="JOB 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Hianagi vahe'ma frigeno'a hankaveamo'a vaganeregeno, atumparega ra asimu'ma anteteno nefrie. <verse eid="JOB 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Hagi hagerimpima zagema rentegeno'ma amuho huno amu'ma mareriankna nehuno, ra zagema regeno'ma tiramo'ma taneankna huno, <verse eid="JOB 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>vahe'mo'a frino manigasa hu'nenigeno monamo'a vagaregahie. <verse eid="JOB 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>Hanki matipima fraki nantenka kagekani nantenankeno karimpa ahe'zamo'ma evunagateresiana knare hisine. Hianagi ete nagri'ma antahi namisana kna, mago kna huhamprinanto.<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Hagi fri'ne'nia vahe'mo'a ete otinora manigahifi? Hagi e'inahu zama me'nenige'na, maraguzamati'na vanua knafina frizampinti'ma nazeri oti'nia zankura amuhara hu'na vugahue. <verse eid="JOB 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Hagi Kagra nagriku'ma kema hananke'na kenona hunegantenugenka, Kagraka'a kazanuti'ma tro'ma hunte'nana vahe'mo'nagura tusiza hunka antahintahia hugahane. <verse eid="JOB 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Na'ankure menina nagama rerakaure'nama kama vanoma nehuazana negananki, kumi'ma huazamofona ohamprio. <verse eid="JOB 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Hagi e'ina nehunka kefo navu'nava zana kupi eririnka anaki nentenka kumi'ni'a refitesane. <verse eid="JOB 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>Hianagi agonamo ankariseno eramianka nehigeno, mehimpinti havemo atamana huramiankna nehigeno, <verse eid="JOB 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>tima hageno havea erino eviankna nehanigeno, tima hageno mopa erino viankna hunka vahe'mo'ma maniso'ema hunaku'ma amuha'ma nehiazana eri haviza nehane. <verse eid="JOB 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Kagra hankavetinka maka knafina zamazeri zamagatere vava nehanke'za fanane nehazagenka, zamavufaga eri ruzahu hutenka huzmantanke'za friza nevaze. <verse eid="JOB 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Hagi ana vahe'mokizmi mofavreramimo'za zamagi me'nea vahe mani'nazanagi, zamagra e'i ana zana antahi'za ke'za osu'naze. Hagi zamazeri fenkamima atresniana antahi'za ke'za osugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Zamagrira zamavufagafintira zamata negrige'za zamatagura nehu'za zamagra zamavufagura zavira netaze.<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s">Elifasi'a agra'a antahi'za huama hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Hagi anante Tema kumateti ne' Elifasi'a amanage huno Jopuna kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>Knare antahi'zane vahe'mo'a e'inara huno agafa'a omne kea ohantagege, zage hanati kazigati amuhonentake zaho'mo eno eme vazi zoreankna huno agi'arina osiresine. <verse eid="JOB 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Hagi knare antahi'zane vahe'mo'a nena'a omne kea huno ke hara regahifi? <verse eid="JOB 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Hianagi kagra Anumzamofona korora huntenka, agesga hunka Agri agorga nomanine. <verse eid="JOB 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Hagi kumika'amo hugasmigenka nanekea nehane. Kagra knare nanekema hunka vahe'ma azeri savri'ma hu'arera knare hu'nane. <verse eid="JOB 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Nagra huhaviza hunogantoanki, kagri kagi'mo huhaviza hunegante. Kagri kagefu'namo maka havizanka'a huama hunegante. <verse eid="JOB 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>Kagra kagesama antahi'nana, vahera fore osu'nege'na nagra esera fore hu'noe hunka nehampi? Hifi kagrama kagesama antahinana, agonaramina fore osu'nege'na nagra fore hutogeno, henka fore hu'ne hunka nehano? <verse eid="JOB 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Anumzamo'ma Agra'a keagama retroma hifina kagra mani'nampi? Hagi kagrake'za knare antahi'zana erinampi? <verse eid="JOB 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Hagi tagrama antahita ketama osu'nona zana, na'a tagaterenka nentahinka, tagrama antahini'ma osu'nona zana, na'a tagaterenka kagra antahinira hu'nane? <verse eid="JOB 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Hagi tagri kazigama mani'naza ranra vahe'ma, efeke zamazoka'ma reana vahe'mo'za kagri negafana agatere'za za'zakna mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Hagi knafima mani'nankeno Anumzamo'ma kazeri so'ema hiazamo'a, osi huno knarera huogantefi? Hagi akoheno'ma fru kema hugamia kemo'a, knarera huoganteo? <verse eid="JOB 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Na'amo higeno antahintahi kamo'a afe'arera nevigeno, kavumo'a ke so'ea nosie? <verse eid="JOB 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>E'ina'ma nehigenka Anumzamofona krimpa ahenentenka, keonke keretira azeri havizana nehane? <verse eid="JOB 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>Hagi ama mopafina magore huno agru vahera omani'neankino, ama mopafina fatgo vahera omanitfa hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Hagi ko, Anumzamo'a ankero vahetmina antahi nozmie. Hagi monafi vahe'mo'enena Anumzamofo avurera agrua osu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>Hagi mopafi vahe'mota agru osuta kumike vahe mani'nonankita, kefo avu'ava'ma hu'zankura tinku'ma ave'nesigeno'ma hiaza huno tusi taga'nete.<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>Hagi Jopuga nagra kaveri hugahuanki, kama antahio. Nagrama ke'na anthi'nama hu'noa zamofona huama hu'na kasamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>Knare antahi'zane vahe'mo'zama zamafahe'mofompinti'ma eri'naza antahintahia eri fraoki, eri ama' hazage'na nagra antahi'noe. <verse eid="JOB 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>Hagi e'inahu antahi'zama eri'naza vahera zamagra mopa agafa vahe mani'naze. Hagi zamagra emani vahera omani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Hagi kefo avu'ava zama nehia vahe'mo'a, mika zupa atazampi manino nevie. <verse eid="JOB 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Ana nehuno azeri agogofe'zamofo agasasankea antahi vava nehuno, musema huno mani knafinena ha' vahekura korora hu vava nehie. <verse eid="JOB 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Hagi agrama amentintima hiana, fegi'ma atirami'na hanizampima vanuana, bainati kazinteti nahe frigahaze huno korora nehie. <verse eid="JOB 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Hagi agra bretigura hakeno vano nehuno, igati bretia erigahueha huno agesa nentahie. Hanizamo'ma retrotra'ma huno'ma tava'oma'are'ma me'neana, ko antahino keno hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Atazamo'ene hazenke zamo'ene azeri koro higeno, hate vunaku trotra nehia kini ne'mo nehiaza huno antahintahi hakare nehie. <verse eid="JOB 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Na'ankure azana anakino mopa nemasagino, Hanavenentake Anumzamofona huhaviza hunte'ne. <verse eid="JOB 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>Hagi agra hanko azampina eri'neno Anumzamofona hara huntenaku agareno vu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>Hanki afovamo'a avugosa eri anonevazigeno afafafina afovamo'a avite'neanagi, <verse eid="JOB 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>agra haviza hu'nea kumapi nemanino, vahe omani zute noma pasru hu'zama hu'nea nompi manigahie. <verse eid="JOB 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Hanki fenozamine zago zmimo'enena zazatera omne fanane huge, keonke zama eri nafa'ama hu'zantmimo'a ruzahera huno mopa atumparera vuno enora osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Hanki agra hanizampintira atreno ofregahie. Hagi zagemofo amuhomo ne'zana te hagege nehanigeno, Anumzamo'ma asimu'ma antesia zaho'mo, ahe fanane hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Hanki negi vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'za nena'a omne fenozantera zamentintia osiho. Na'ankure e'inahu vahe'mo'a agra agu'agesa'ama omne zampintira mago mizana e'origahie. <verse eid="JOB 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Hanki e'inahu vahera kasefa vahe mani'neza ame hu'za frisageno, zagasefage ani'nane zafamo'ma hariri hiaza hu'za fanene hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Hanki agra nena osu'negeno tagi'za tro hu'naza waini tinkna nehuno, olivi zafa amosaremo raga'a fore osu'negeno ame huno tagiramiankna hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Hanki Anumzamofo kema antahino amage'ma onte vahe'mo'a mofavrea kase nontesigeno, havigema huno knare osu kankmunteti'ma zagoma erino feno vahe'ma mani'nesia vahe'mofo seli nomo'a teveregahie. <verse eid="JOB 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Na'ankure ana vahe'mo'a hazenke zamofo amu'ene huno kefo avu'ava'za kasenente. E'ina huno arimpafintira havigema huno vahe'ma revatgama hu'za erifore nehie.<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a rone'aramimofo nanekere ke nona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Hagi Jopu'a anante Elifasine ruga'amokizmia amanage huno kezmirera kenona hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>Rama'a zupa ama ana nanekea antahi'na oanagi, magore huno ama ana nanekema hazazamo'a naza osutfa nehigeta tamasunkura hunonantaze. <verse eid="JOB 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Hanki nazeri amuhoma hu nanekema nehazana taganeta omanigahazo? Na'a nehigeta kea huvava huta nevaze? <verse eid="JOB 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Hanki nagrama huaza huta tamagrama knafima manizasina, tamagrama nehazaza hu'na kefintira tamazeri haviza nehu'na nagena rusine. <verse eid="JOB 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Hianagi nagrama huazama huta tamagra knafima manizasina, nagra tamazeri hanavetikea huneramugetma fru hutma manizasine.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>Hianagi nagra'ama naguvazi kazigati kema huampi, kema osu'ma manuampi, ana avamenteke knazanimo'a vagaore meno nevie. <verse eid="JOB 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Tamagerfa huno Anumzamo'a mika hanaveni'a erinetreno, naga'ni'a mika zamahe vaganere. <verse eid="JOB 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Ana nehuno nazeri havizantfa higeno, navufgamo'a zaferina'nire akamare'ne. E'ina'ma hia zama vahe'mo'zama nege'za kumi hu'nea zamofo nona'a knazana e'nerie hu'za hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Anumzamo'a tusi arimpa ahenenanteno nagrira nazeri haviza hu'ne. Agra tusi rimpagu nehuno avera aninkreki nehuno, avua anteno nenageno nage raponeno nenage. <verse eid="JOB 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Hanki vahe'mo'za zamagira renagate nenamiza, nameragente rupro hunenamiza, huhaviza hunante'za eri mago hu'za ha'rarenante'naze. <verse eid="JOB 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Anumzamo'a kumi vahetmimofo zamazampi navrente'ne. Hanki Agra nazeriteno kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi matevu zami'ne.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Hanki korapara hakare'a zamo'a knare huno me'nege'na knare hu'na mani'noanagi, Anumzamo'a nanankente navazu huno nazeri taganavazi'ne. E'ina nehuno nazeri haviza hunaku hankogna huno nazeri oti'ne. <verse eid="JOB 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>Ana hige'za kevema nahe vahe'mo'za manigaginante'naze. E'ina hu'nazageno Anumzamo'a asunkura huonanteno kevea nenahegeno, navinompafi timo'a mopafina herafi neramie. <verse eid="JOB 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Hanki Anumzamo'a mago zupa natrege'na amnea omani'noanki, sondia vahe'mo'zama ha' vahe'ma nezmahazaza huno maka zupa naheva naheva huno tusi kano nenamie. <verse eid="JOB 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>Hagi nagra nasunku nehu'na kopra beki kukena hati'na nentanina, navufga rama nehua zana atrogeno kugusopafi evurami'ne. <verse eid="JOB 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Hagi zavi'ma netogeno'a, navugosamo'a korankifa nehegeno, navumo'a finigu ahe'ne. <verse eid="JOB 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Hianagi nagra mago hazenkea osu'noanki, fatgo hu'na nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="JOB 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>Hagi mopamoka korani'a refira otenegeno, nagrama knama enerua zankura koranimo'a krafagea huno vino. <verse eid="JOB 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Hagi meninena ko, nagri'ma huama'ma huno tamage nehie huno'ma huama'ma hunantesia vahera monafinka mani'ne. Nagri'ma nahokeno nanekema hu' vahera manisga huno anagamu mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Hagi aronenimo'za huhaviza hunenantazage'na Anumzanimofontega nunamuna hu'na zavira atevava nehue. <verse eid="JOB 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>Hagi nagri'ma navenesiana Anumzane nagri amu'nompina mago vahe mani'neno nagri nagira erino Anumzanena nanekea haniegu nehue. <verse eid="JOB 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>Na'ankure nagrama fri'nama fri vahe kumategama nevuna, ete omesua kafua osi'a me'ne.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a Anumzamofonte mago'ene knazama'a huama hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Hagi hanavenimo'a evuramigeno, knani'amo'a eme upa nehigeno, vahe'ma asente matimo'a navega anteno me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Hagi nagri'ma huhaviza hunenantaza vahe'mo'za nazeri kagi'za mani'ne'za, hunte'za ki'za zokago kea hunenantazage'na mani'ne'na nezmagoe. <verse eid="JOB 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>Hagi nagrira hazenkeni'a omneneanki, Anumzamoka naza huo. Na'ankure mago vahe'mo'a otino naza hugara osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Kagra antahintahizmia eriginke'za ama ana zana antahi amara nosaze. E'ina hu'negu zamatrege'za kefintira nazeri havizana hu'za nagateoreho. <verse eid="JOB 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Zamagra'a knare zanku nentahi'za, aronezmia zamazeri haviza nehaze. E'ina hu'negu mofavrezimia zamatrege'za, zamagaku nehu'za friho. <verse eid="JOB 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>Hagi vahe amu'nompina Anumzamo'a nagrira nazeri kizazokago zankna higeno, vahe'mo'za navugosafina zamavetura ahenante'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Hanki zavi'ma atoa zamo higeno navumo'a zorege'na, nagra oza'oza hu'na vahe amema'agna nehue. <verse eid="JOB 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Hagi fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za ama anazama nege'za, antri hu'za zamagogogu nehazage'za, hazenke'zmima omne vahe'mo'za Anumzamofoma amage'ma nontaza vahera ha' renezmantaze. <verse eid="JOB 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Ana nehu'za fatgo zamavu'zma'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za rukrahera osu, fatgo zamavu'zmavama nehaza vahe'mo'za zamavu'zmavara hu'za nevazageno, zamazampima pehena okamare maka zupa fatgo avu'ava'ma hu'zampina hage'za mareneri'za ome hankaveti'za nevaze. <verse eid="JOB 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>Hianagi mika'mota atreta rukrahe huta eho, tamagri amu'nompina knare antahi'zane vahera hakre'na eri forera osu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Nagrira knani'a vagaregeno amuha zani'a omane. Ana higeno nagesama antahi'na hugahuema hu'na retroma hu'noa zamo'a amare eme vagare. <verse eid="JOB 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Hagi ama vahe'mo'za ferukura eri rukrahe hu'za kenagere nehu'za, kenagekura ferure hu'za nehu'za, hanintirima hiazankura masa hu'ne hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Nagra fri vahe kumapima tafe'ma hu'na hanintirima hu'nefima masoresina knare hisine. Hanki hanimpima tafeni'ama rutare'na masina masogeno'a, knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>Hagi fri vahe matiku'ma hu'na kagra nenfage nehu'na, hagirafagu'ma hu'na, kagra nenrerage hu'na huge, nensarogema huasina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>Hagi amuha zani'a iga me'ne? Iza amuha zani'a hakeno eri fore hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Hagi amuha zanimo'a fri vahe kuma kafante uramigahifi? Tagranena kugusopafi uramigahuno?<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s">Bildati'ma havige antahintahi Jopuma ami'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Hagi anante Suha kumate ne' Bildati'a amanage hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>Jopuga zazate nanekea hunka vane. Kagrama tagriku'ma kenonama hurantesiema hanunka kagesa antahinka nanekea huo. <verse eid="JOB 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Hanki kagrama antahinana, tagra bulimakao afu mani'nompi? Hagi kagrama antahinana tagra kagri kavurera antahi'za omane vahe mani'none. <verse eid="JOB 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Hagi kagrira tusi krimpa ahenigenka kazokara vararegahananagi, e'i ana krimpa ahe'zamo'a, mopa eri rukrahera osugahie. Huge ana krimpa ahe'zamo'a, have agona erinkria osegahie. <verse eid="JOB 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>Tamage huno kefo avu'ava'ma nehaze vahetmimofo tavi'mo'a asu hanigeno, akrukruma huno nerea tevemo'a ru'enena akrukru hunora ontegosie. <verse eid="JOB 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Hanki seli noma'afima neresia tavi'mo'a ome hanintiri nehanigeno, ana nompima hantinte'neni'a tavimo'a asu hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Hanki kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mo'ma ko'ma hanave'a me'negeno'ma afete'ma agiama renakenerea zana osugahianki, tava'onte renakeregahie. Hanki ru vahe'ma zamazeri haviza hu' antahintahima retro'ma nehia antahintahimo, agrira azeri haviza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera kukomo azenerigeno, agri'a agiamo avreno vigeno kerifina uneramie. <verse eid="JOB 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Hagi krifuma anaginte'naza zamo'a, agiamerumparera azeri'neno azeri antrako hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Hanki ana krifuma anaginte'neana zagaruruma hu'neama'a mopafi eri franekino azeri'niama'a, kama vanoma nehifi krifua hunte'ne. <verse eid="JOB 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera korozamo azeri kagintegeno, hazenke zamo'a avaririno nevie. <verse eid="JOB 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Hagi menina zamagate'zamo higeno hanavezmi nomnegeno, hazenke zamo'a zamazeri haviza hunaku, tanafa'ma hanagu zamavega ante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Hagi krimo'a zamavufaga zamazeri haviza nehigeno, zamagia zamazamo'a kasrino nevie. <verse eid="JOB 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera nonkuma zamifintira ame huno zamazeri atresige'za, fri'za fri vahe'ma kegava hu'nea kini ne'mofo kvafi umanigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Hagi ana vahe'mofo nonkumara, Salfae nehaza tevenefa'ane haveramimo tefanane hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Hagi ana vahe'mo'za zafa rafu'namo'ma hagegema hiankna hu'za hagege nehanageno, zafa azanku'namo amagino hagege hiankna hu'za, amagi'za osapa regahaze. <verse eid="JOB 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Hanki ana vahetmina ru'enena zamagesa antahi ozmisage'za fri'za fanane hanageno, ama mopafintira zamagimo'a fanane hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Hagi masafintira zamahe kasopenige'za hanimpi umanigahaze. Hagi ama mopafintira zmahenati atrenige'za ru'enena ama mopafina omanigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Hagi ana mofavrea kaseozmantesage'za, zamagehe'ina kaseozmantegahaze. Huge zamagrama ko'ma nemaniza kumapina mago vahera omanifta hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Hagi ana vahetaminte'ma fore'ma hiazankura zage fre kazigama nemaniza vahe'mo'za antri hu'za zamagogogu nehazageno, zage hanati kazigama nemaniza vahe'mo'za zamagranena antri nehu'za tusi'a zamagogogu nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Ana nehu'za amanage hugahaze, kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mofo nonkuma'mo amanahura hie nehu'za, zamagra Anumzamofona zamefi'ma hunemiza vahetmimofo nonkumakino havizana hie, hu'za hugahaze.<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a Bildati kere ke nona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Hagi anante Jopu'a amanage huno Bildatina kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>Kagra zazate nata naminka ane. Kema hana kemo'a zazate nazeri havizantfa hie. <verse eid="JOB 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Hago kagra 10ni'a zupa kefintira nazeri haviza nehunka, kefinti'ma nazeri havizama hanazankura kagazegura osane. <verse eid="JOB 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Hagi nagrama tamagema hu'na kumi'ma hu'nesuana, kagri zana omne'neankinka e'inahu kea eme huonantegahane. <verse eid="JOB 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Kagrama kagesama antahinana, nagra knare hu'noe hunka kavufga rana nehunka, nagrama knafima ufroa zankura kumi hu'nea nona'a knazana e'nerie hunka nagrikura nehane. <verse eid="JOB 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>Hianagi Anumzamo Agra'a nazeri haviza nehuno, kukompina navrenente. <verse eid="JOB 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>Hanki naza hiho hu'na kezama atuana, mago vahe'mo'a ana kezankeni'a antahi onami'ne. Naza hihogu'ma nanekea huanagi, mago vahe'mo'a antahinamino nagri kaziga anteno nazahu kea osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Hagi kama vunaku'ma huankana Anumzamo maninkanirege'na kama vu'zankura huge'na, akohe'na mani'noe. Ana nehuno kana rehanintiri huno rehiza hige'na novue. <verse eid="JOB 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Hanki vahe'mo'zama ra nagima nenamizageno nasenire'ma kini fetori'ma anteanknama hu'neana, hagitenetreno nagaze erinami'ne. <verse eid="JOB 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Hagi Agra maka kaziga hazenkea namino nevige'na ome haviza hugeno, arafu'na aga'ma zafa eri tasagima hiaza huno amuha zani'a eri atrene. <verse eid="JOB 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Ana nehuno ha' vahe'amofoma hiaza huno nagri'ma arimpa ahenante'nea zamo'a teve rukru hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Hagi sondia vahe'amo'za eritru hu'za hahunante'naku kana nevarize. Ana nehu'za ana maka sondia vahe'amo'za seli noni'a avazagi kanegize.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>Anumzamo'a naga'ni'a zamavare afete'are nezmanteno, roneni'aramina zamazeri ha' vahe'ni'a sege'za hara renenantaze. <verse eid="JOB 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Hagi naga'nimo'za nenatrazageno, navate aronenimo'za zamage'akaninantaze. <verse eid="JOB 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Hagi nagri nompima nemaniza vahe'mo'zane, eri'za a'nemo'zanena kasefa vahe'ma zamagazankna hu'za nenagaze. Nagra zamagri zamavurera ruregati vahekna hue. <verse eid="JOB 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Hanki eri'za vahe'nigu'ma kema nehugeno'a, ke'ni'a antahinonamie. E'ina hige'na eri'za vahe'nimo'ma ke'nima antahinogura mago'ane kea hu agesa nehuanagi, eme onage'ne. <verse eid="JOB 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Nagi'ma aka hu'na kema nehugeno evia himnagura a'nimofona amuti agesa higeno, tusi avresra hunenantegeno, nafuhe'za tusi zamavesra hunantaze. <verse eid="JOB 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Ne'one mofavreramimo'zanena tusi zamavaresra hunante'za huhaviza hunenantaze. Ana nehu'za kema huzmi'zama nehuge'za zamefi hunenamize. <verse eid="JOB 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Hanki navate aronenimo'za zamagote'za zamavesra hunenantazageno, nagrama navesi nezmantoa vahe'mo'za zamefi hunenamize. <verse eid="JOB 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Na'ankure navufgamo'a zaferinanire akamarege'na, fri' avamente e'noanagi ofri'noe. <verse eid="JOB 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>Hanki aronenimota tamasunku hunanteho. Na'ankure Anumzamo'a Agra'a azanu knazana namino, nazeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Hagi tamagra nagafare Anumzamo'ma hiazana huta, nazeri havizana nehaze? Nahigeta nazeri haviza huvava huta nevaze? <verse eid="JOB 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>Hagi nagrama nagesama antahuana, nanekeni'a avontafepi krentege, mago'a zante'ma hanagati'za krentege, <verse eid="JOB 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>havere'ma eri vakiki'za krentege'ma hazageno meno viresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Hianagi nagra antahi'noe, nagu'vazino ete Navre Nera mani'neankino, magokna nagri kaziga eme anteno keagani'a naza huno eri fatgo hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Hanki fri'nugeno navufgamo'a kasrigahianagi, ama ana navufgare mani'ne'na Anumzani'a kegahue. <verse eid="JOB 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Nagra navufinti Anumzanimofona kegahue. Nagra navufinti'ma kesua zankura tusiza huno nave'nesie. <verse eid="JOB 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>Hanki nagafare nazeri havizahu kea hunka, agra hu'nea kefo avu'ava'mo higeno hazenkefina nemanie hunka nehane. <verse eid="JOB 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>Hianagi ana nanekekamo'ma hazenkema avreno'ma kagrite'ma esia zankura korora nosane. Na'ankure bainati kazinteti kagrira hazenkea kaminigenka kagrama kenka antahinka hanana, fatgo huno refko nehie hunka antahigahane.<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s">Sofari'ma Jopu kere kenona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Hagi anante Na'ama kumateti ne' Sofari'a amanage huno Jopuna kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>Nanekema hana nanekemo'a, antahintahinifina knarera osutfa hige'na keka'arera ke nona'a hu'zahue. <verse eid="JOB 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Kagrama nazeri havizahu nanekema hana nanekemo'a, tusiza huno nagaze eri namige'na, nagu'areti hu'na keka'arera kenona hugante'za hue. <verse eid="JOB 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>Hanki ese agafare'ma vahe'ma zamazeri fore hige'za ama mopafima mani'za e'za, amare'ma ehanati'naza vahete'ma fore hu'nea zana kagra ontahi'nano, <verse eid="JOB 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za zazatera musena nosage'za, Anumzamofo avu'ava'ma nosaza vahe'mo'za musena nehazanagi, zazatera menora novie. <verse eid="JOB 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Zamavufga rama hu'zazmimo'ene hihamu zmimo'a amename monarega marenerigeno, zamasenimo'a hampo avako hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>Hianagi rifama retrageno'ma fananema hiaza hu'za fanane hugahaze. Hanki zamage'za antahi'zama hu'naza vahe'mo'za anage hugahaze, zamagra iga mani'naze? hu'za hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Zamagra ava'nafi vahekna hu'za hare'za fanane hugahaze. Hagi vahe'mo'za avanagnaza ke'naza zamo fanane hiankna hu'za ana vahe'mo'za fanane hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Hanki ko'ma zamage'naza vahe'mo'za ru'enena nozmagesageno, naga'zmimozanena ozmagegahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Hanki ana vahe'mofo mofavrezmimo'za, zamunte omne vahe'ma zamazama hanagura memea hugahaze. Na'ankure zmafahe'zama zamunte omne vahe'mokizmi fenoma musufama eri'naza zantamina, zamagra'a zamazampinti ete zami'za vano hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Hihamu'a me'nenigeno kasefa vahe manigahianagi, ana hihamu hankave'ane frino kugusopafi masegahie.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>Zamagra kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza zamo'a tusi haga zamavesige'za tima'a aru'za nene'za, zamagefunaretira hune hane nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>Ana kefo avu'ava zana notrazanki zamagipi haninkofite'za nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>Hianagi ana ne'zamo'a aka ome hanigeno, zamarimpafina ha osifavemofo avu'ataga zankna ome hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>E'ina hinke'za fenoma asagahu nakri'naza zana Anumzamo'a atre'nigeno zamarimpafina omnegosianki, amu'ma atitreaza huno eri atregahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Hanki ana vahe'mo'za osifa'vemofo avuatga zama'a anivazu hu'za nenesageno, ha' osifavemo zamaprisige'za frigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Ana hanige'za ru'enena olivi masavena nege, bulimakamofo amirine, tume rima'anena nene'za musena osugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Hanki eri'zama maraguzati'za eri'za erifore'ma hu'naza zantamina zamunte omne vahe zaminageno maraguzati'za eri'zama eri'naza zamo'a amnezankna hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Na'ankure zamagra zamunte omne vahetmina, rezmatga hu'za zamagra onki'naza none fenozmine eri'naze. <verse eid="JOB 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>Zamagragukema antahi vahe'mo'za maka'zana ante'nazanagi, ru'enema maka'zama erisaza zankuke nehaze. Hanki rama'a zantmima antesaza zanku antahintahi hugahazanagi, ana zantamina ontegahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Hagi ne'zama neneno'a magore huno negenora notreankino, fenozamimo'a zazatera omneno haviza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Hanki rama'a fenoza antegahazanagi, hazenkefi ufre'za knazampina maniza vugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Hanki e'inahukna vahera Anumzamo'a arimpafina hazenkeza eri avitenenteno tusi arimpa ahenteno hazenkea amigahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Hanki ainireti'ma tro'ma hu'nesaza ha'zanku koro hu'za fregahazanagi, bronsire kevenuti zamahegahaze. <verse eid="JOB 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Hanki ana kevenu'ma ahe taponesigeno amagenafinti'ma ruraponenkeno'a, keve agonare'ma koramo'ma hanigeno kesuno'a tusi agogogu hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>Hanki maka zago fenozmia hanimpi fanene hanigeno, mago'ama mesia fenozmine seli nozmi'nena tusi'a tevemo hagana hagana huno te fanene hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Monamo'a kefozazmia eriama nehinkeno, mopamo'a maka zama hu'naza zana huama huzmantegahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Hanki ana vahe'mokizmi none fenozazminena tihageno erino nevanigeno, Anumzamofo arimpahe zamo'a tihageankna huno zamavareno vugahie. <verse eid="JOB 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Anumzamo'a kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera e'ina huno zamahe fanane hugahie. Hagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahetmimofo mizama Anumzamo'ma havi miza erigahazema huno'ma huhampri zmante'nea mizana e'ina hu'za erigahaze.<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a Sofa ke nona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Hagi anante Jopu'a kenona amanage hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>Kagesa ante so'e hu'nenka nagrama hanuankea antahio. Hagi kagesama antenka antahi'nana zamo nagrira naza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Akohenka mani'nenka nagrama hanua nanekea antahitenka, henka kagra kiza zokago kea hunantegahane. <verse eid="JOB 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>Nagra Anumzamofontega narimpa haviza hu'zana eri ama nehuanki, vahetega narimpa haviza hu'zana eri ama nosue. E'i ana agafare narimpa fru hu'na nomanue. <verse eid="JOB 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Hanki nagrira nenageta antri huta tamazana tamagipi anteta anikafriho. <verse eid="JOB 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Hagi kema huankemofo nagesa nentahi'na tusi koro nehugeno, nahirahi nere. <verse eid="JOB 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Nagafare kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za maka zampina knarera nehu'za, mani'za vu'za ozafa omere'za himamu'ane vahera maniza feno vahera nemanize? <verse eid="JOB 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Zamagra ana mani'ne'za negazageno mofavrezmimo'za ra hu'za nomani'zana trohu'za nemanize. Ana nehu'za mofavrea kasentazageno kase anante anantera hu'za nevaze. <verse eid="JOB 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Hagi ana vahe'mo'za nonkumazmifima mani'zana mago'zankura korora osu nemanizageno, Anumzamo'enena knazana nozmige'za, knare hu'za nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Hanki ve bulimakao afuzmimo'a mofavrea eri fore huvava nehigeno, a' bulimakao afutamimo'za anentara kase kuntrara nosaze. <verse eid="JOB 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Hanki mofavrezmimo'za sipisipi afumo'za kevure kevure vanoma nehazaza hu'za magopi kiza zokagora hu'za nemanizageno, neonse mofavreramimo'za musenkasea hu'za avoa hage'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Zamagra tambarini nehe'za hapue nehaza zavenane nehe'za zagamera nehaze. Ana nehu'za konkena nere'za, musenkasena hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Nomani'zazmifina knare hu'za manime nevu'za zamarimpa frune fri'za nevaze.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>Hagi havi avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za Anumzamofonkura amanage hu'za nehaze, Kagri kavukva'ma huzankura, tavesra nehianki tatrenka vuo hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>Marerirfa Anumza nera Agra iza mani'nenigeta ke'a antahigahune. Hanki Agritegama nunumuma hanunana, Agra na'a knare zana hurantegahie? <verse eid="JOB 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Hagi zamagrama antahi'zana tagra'a hankavere maka zana nehune hu'za zamagesa nentahize. Hianagi e'inahu antahintahima havi vahe'mo'zama namiza antahi'zana amagera onte'na, afete manigahue. <verse eid="JOB 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>Hagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera Anumzamo'a ame hunora zamahe ofri zamatrege'za mani'ne'za ozafare'za nefrize. Hagi zamagra mago hazenke e'ori amne nemanize. Hanki Anumzamo'a ana kefo vahe'mokizmigura arimpa ahezmanteno knazana nozamie. <verse eid="JOB 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Hagi zamagrira zaho'mo'ma hagage tra'zama erianknara huge, hanave zahomo witi hona eri hareno vianknara nosio? <verse eid="JOB 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Hagi tamagra huta, Anumzamo kumima nehaza vahe'mokizmi mofavreramina knazana zamigahie huta nehaze. Hianagi nagrama nehuana kumi'ma hu'ne'nia vahe knazana Anumzamo zami'nige'za fatgoma huno refkoma hania zana antahi ani hanaze hu'na nentahue. <verse eid="JOB 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Ana vahetamina zamatrenke'za Hihamu'ane Anumzamo'ma zamazeri havizama hania zana zamagra zamavufinti nege'za, arimpama ahezmantenia zana zamagra zamavate keho. <verse eid="JOB 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Na'ankure zamagrama fri'zama vanu'za, naga'zmire'ma fore'ma hania zankura zamagesa ontahigahaze.<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>Hianagi mago vahe'mo'a Anumzamofona rempi humigara osu'ne. Na'ankure Agra marerirfa vahe'enena refko hunezmante. <verse eid="JOB 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Hanki mago'a vahe'mo'za miko zama nehaza zamo'a knare nehige'za muse hu'za mani'neza nefrize. <verse eid="JOB 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>Hagi mago'a vahe'mofona zamavufagamo'a knare hige'za hankave vahe mani'ne'za nefrize. <verse eid="JOB 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Hagi mago'a vahera zamunte omanege'za nomani'za zmimo'a amuho hige'za knare osu nomani'zampi mani'ne'za nefrize. <verse eid="JOB 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Hianagi knare nomani'zampima mani'neno fria vahe'ene, amunte omne nomani'zante'ma mani'neno fria vahe'enena mago zahu huno mopafi asezmantegeno hagirafamo zamavufaga nene. <verse eid="JOB 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>Hanki kagrama nentahina antahintahia nagra antahi'noe. Nagri'ma nazeri haviza hunaku'ma oku'ama retro'ma nehana antahintahia nagra antahi'noe. <verse eid="JOB 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Na'ankure kagra hunka, inantega ugagota kva vahe'mofo nona me'ne hunka nehunka, inantega kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'ma nemaniza seli nona me'ne? hunka nehane. <verse eid="JOB 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Hianagi karankama vanoma nehaza vahe zamantahigege'za tamage nanekea kasamiho. <verse eid="JOB 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza veamo'za hazenke zama ne-ege'za hazenkea e'norizanki amne nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Hagi mago vahe'mo'a amatera huhaviza huzmanteno havi avu'ava'zama nehaza zantera nona hunozmante. <verse eid="JOB 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Hagi ana vahe'ma frizage'zama eri'za ome asezmantage'za sondia vahe'mo'za matimati zamirera kegava hute'za nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Hagi ana vahe'ma asentenaku'ma eri'za nevazageno'a, tusi'a vahekrerfamo'za zamavariri'za matitega nevaze. Rama'a vahe'mo'za antahinemi'za negazageno vogisi'amo'a kerifina uneramigeno, mopa ragana atrazageno uneramie. <verse eid="JOB 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>Hanki inankna huno kagesama ontahi kema nehana kemo'a naza huno nazeri knarera hugahie? Mika nanekema hana kemo'a amnezankna hie!<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s">Jopuma hu'nea kere Elifasi'a nona huno agra'a antahintahi asami'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Hanki anante Temani kumateti ne' Elifasi'a amanage huno Jopuna kenona hunte'ne. <verse eid="JOB 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>Magore huno ama mopafi vahe'mo'a Anumzamofona aza osugahie. Ana nehanigeno, knare antahi'zane vahe'mo'a agra'a aza hugahianagi, Anumzamofona aza osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Kagrama fatgo kavukva'ma hanana zamo'a Hankavenentake Anumzamofo avurera amne zankna nehanigeno, knare kavukva'ma hnana zamo'a, Anumzamofona aza osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>Hagi kagrama Anumzamofo agorga nemaninka, mono'ma hunentanana amanahu knazana atregeno kazeri havizana nehuno keaga huganteresino? <verse eid="JOB 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>I'o kagra rama'a kumi hunka nevankeno kumikamo'a hihi huno mareri'nea agafare Anumzamo'a keaga hunegante. <verse eid="JOB 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Hagi roneka'amo'za kagripinti'ma zagoma nofi hunaku'ma hazagenka, zagoni'ma eme nenamita ete erisaze nehunka kukena'zamia erintanke'za zamavufaga zamavapako vu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Ana nehunka tinku'ma nehaza vahera tina nozaminka, zamagaku'ma nehaza vahera ne'zana ozami'nane. <verse eid="JOB 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>Kagrama kagesa antahi'nana, hankave vahe'mo'zage'za mopa eri nafa'a nehazage'za, mopama eriga vahe'mo'zage enerize hunka kagesa nentahine. <verse eid="JOB 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Kento a'nanemo'zama zamazama hananegu'ma kagrite'ma ne-azana zamatranke'za amne nevazagenka, megusa mofavre nagazmia zamazeri haviza nehane. <verse eid="JOB 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>E'ina hu'negu menina hazenke zamo'a kukomo hiaza huno, maka asoparega kazeri kagigenka mani'nankeno antri hanaza huno koro'zamo'a kagrite ne-e. <verse eid="JOB 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>E'ina agafare hanizamo'a kavua rehani higenka nonkankeno, ti hageno refiteaza huno knazamo'a, kagrira rufitenegante.<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>Hianagi menina Jopuga antahio, Anumzana rankrerfa hu'nea Anumzankino amunagamuma me'nea hanafitamina zamagatereno amenagame monafi nemanie. <verse eid="JOB 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Hianagi kagra amanage hunka nehane, nagrama nehua navu'nava zana inankna huno Anumzamo'a keno antahino nehie? Agra haninentake hampompi mani'neankino inankna huno tage amara huno nerageno, refkora huno tagegahie? <verse eid="JOB 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Tapa hampomo Anumzamofo avurera anteso higeno norage. Ana nehigeno agra monamofona agatereno onaga'a vano nehuno norage. <verse eid="JOB 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>Hanki Jopuga antahio, ko'ma kumi vahe'mo'zama hu'naza zamavu'zmava nehunka zamage ante'za nehampi? <verse eid="JOB 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Nozamima azeri oti'zama ki'naza tra'ma timo hageno erino viankna huno ana kumi'ma nehaza vahera tavava ozafa ore'ne'za kasefa vahe mani'neza frigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Anage nehu'za Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a na'a hurantegahie. Tatarenka vuo hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Anage nehazanagi e'i ana Anumzamoke nozamifina knare'nare fenozana eri antevi tezmante'ne. E'ina hu'negu kefo zamavu'zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama nentahi'za antahintahia nagra ovaririgahue. <verse eid="JOB 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'ma Anumzamo'ma zamazeri havizama hige'zama, fatgo avu'ava'zama nehaza vahe'mo'za nezamage'za muse nehaze. Ana nehanage'za ke'zami omne vahe'mo'zama nezamage'za zamagiza regahaze. <verse eid="JOB 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>Ana nehu'za, anage hugahaze, ha' vahetimofona tamagerfa hu'za zamazeri haviza nehazageno, tevemo fenozamia tefanane hie hu'za hugahaze.<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>Hagi Jopuga menina Anumzamofonte kagraka'a anteraminka nemaninka, kasunku hunka Agrane kea eri fatgo nehunka krimpa fru hunka manio. E'inama hanankeno'a, nomani zanka'afina maka zamo'a knare hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Amama kavumaro'ma antekema kasamuana antahiso'e nehunka, kagu'afi erintegeno meno. <verse eid="JOB 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Hanki kagrama ete rukrahe hunka Hankavenentake Anumzamofonte'ma esnankeno'a, maka knazanka'a eri netreno ete nomani'zanka'a eri so'e hugantegahie. E'ina hu'negu menina nomanizankafima kefo kavukva zama me'neniana eri atro. <verse eid="JOB 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>Ana nehunka goligu'ma kavesikavesi'ma nehana zana netrenka, knare zantfama hu'nea golima Ofiri mopafinti'ma eri'nana golia atregeno havemoke'ma hu'nea tinkagomupi vino. <verse eid="JOB 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>Ana nehunka atregeno Hankavenentake Anumzamo goli ka'agnara huno nemanino, knare zantfama hu'nea silvagnara huno manino. <verse eid="JOB 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Anama hanigenka kagra Hankavenentake Anumzamofona tusi muse hunentenka, kesga hunka Anumzamofona antahimigahane. <verse eid="JOB 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Kagra Anumzamofontega nunamuna hanankeno, nunamunka'a antahi kamigahie. Ana nehanigenka kagrama huvempama hu'nana keka'a amage antegahane. <verse eid="JOB 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Kagrama nazano hunaku'ma kagesama nentahinka anazama tro'ma hnana zamo'a knare zanke nehanigeno, kama vanana kampina tavi'mo remsa huganteno vugahie. <verse eid="JOB 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Hanki mago'a vahe'mo'zama knafima mani'nesnagenka kagrama hunka, zamaza huo hunkama hanankeno'a, Anumzamo'a zamagu'vazigahie. <verse eid="JOB 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Kumi'ma nehaza vahe'enena Anumzamo'a zamagu vazigahie. Na'ankure kagrama Anumzamofo avure'ma agruma hunka mani'nana zanku huno zamagura vazigahie.<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma Elifasi kere'ma kenona hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Hanki Jopu'a amanage huno kenona hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>Nagrira menina mani'zanimo'a amuho nehige'na keha regahuanki'na, rentarako hune'na karagira orugahue. <verse eid="JOB 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Anumzamo'ma mani'nea kuma'ma nagrama ke'noresina, Agrama mani'nea kumapi menina vusine. <verse eid="JOB 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>Anama hute'na kegagani'a Agri avure eri'na vute'na, nazama huno keagani'ma refko huno antahinogura kehara ome husine. <verse eid="JOB 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Anama hute'na keaganire'ma nonama huno keagama nasamisnia nanekea antahi ama' huresine. <verse eid="JOB 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Anumzamo'a Agra tusi'a hankave'areti hara renanteno, nazeri havizana hugahifi? I'o anara osu nagri nanekerera agesa ante'neno antahi so'e hisine. <verse eid="JOB 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Hagi nagrama fatgo vahe'ma mani'nenugeno refko huno nenageno, Agrama hazenkea omane'ne hanige'na mani vava hu'na vusine. <verse eid="JOB 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>Zage hanati kaziga hake'na vuanagi onke'noe. Zage fre kaziga hake'na vuanagi Anumzamofona onke'noe. <verse eid="JOB 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Noti kaziga hake'na vu'noanagi, Anumzamo'a fraki'nege'na onke'noe. Sauti kaziga hake'na vu'noanagi navumo'a onketfa hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Hianagi nagrama kama vanoma huana, nageno antahino hu'ne. Ana hu'neankino renaheno'ma kesanige'na, tevefima golima krazageno avusesema hiaza hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Na'ankure maka zupa nagra Anumzamofo kante nagia rente'na vano nehu'na, Agri avu'ava'za amage nente'na, ru kantera vugantigma nosue. <verse eid="JOB 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Anumzamofo kasegea namefira huomi'na amage ante'noe. Ana nehu'na ne'zama hiaza hu'na naneke'a erintogeno nagu'afi me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>Hianagi Agrake Anumzana mani'neankino nazano hunaku'ma haniazana amne hanigeno, mago vahe'mo'a retro'ma hania antahintahi'a eri otregahie. <verse eid="JOB 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Ana hu'neankino nazano nagrite'ma tro hugahue huno antahintahima hu'nesniazana amne hugahie. Na'ankure nagri'ma hunantesiazana rama'a zantami retro hunte'neankino, Agrake keno antahino hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Ana hu'neanki'na menina Agri avurera tusi nahirahi nerege'na, Agri hankavegu'ma nagesama nentahi'na tusi koro nehue. <verse eid="JOB 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Anumzamo'a maka hankaveni'a eri netreno, Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a Agra nazeri koro nagesa hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Hanizamo eme nazeri kagige'na hanizampi havizantfa hu'na mani'noanagi, kea tagane'na omanigahue.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma Anumzamofo antahige'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>Nahigeno Hanavenentake Anumzamo'a keagama refko hukna huhampri onte'nesniane? Ana hu'nege'za Agri'ma amage'manentaza vahe'mo'za ana knama kesagura amnefina avega ante'za mani'nazageno amne zanknara nehie? <verse eid="JOB 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Kefo avu'ava'zama nehaza vahe'mo'za havige hu'za vahe mopa hanarenakura, kanagi kana eri kasi ogantu'a nente'za, sipisipi afutamina musufase'za zamagra afu kevufi eri havia nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Megusa mofavreramina rezmatga hu'za donki afuzamia nevre'za, nofi'ma hu'nazana vahe'mo'za eme neramita erisaze nehu'za, kento a'nemokizmi bulimakao afura avre'za nevaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Ana nehu'za zamunte omane vahera kama nevazafintira amanefi zamaretufe netraze. Ana hazage'za zamunte omne ana vahe'mokizmi zamagoro hu'za ome fra'nekize. <verse eid="JOB 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Ka'ma kokampi afi donki afu'mo hiaza hu'za, zamunte omane vahe'mo'za makazupa ne'zankura hakevava nehu'za, mofavre'zamimofoma zamisaza ne'zanku'enena nehakaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Vahe hozafinti ne'zana ome nehamre'za, havi avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi waini hozafinti waini raga neragi'za, mago'ama atre'nazama'a ome tagi vagare'naze. <verse eid="JOB 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Hagi zamavufagarera kukena omnege'za zasiku nehu'za kenagera mase'za vano nehu'za, mago'zana erigonofize. <verse eid="JOB 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Agonaregati'ma runo eanko'mo eme zamahe nefarige'za, noma manisaza zanku huge'za havegampi mani'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Kento a'nemokizmi zamasumpinti megusa mofavre nagara, eme zamavaresga hu'za nevu'za, nofi'ma hu'nazana ome paneseta ete ome zamavareta eho nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Hagi zamunte omne kukena zamavatera omnenege'za zamavapako vano nehu'za, vu'za hozafintira vahe ne'zana ome hamare'za eri nezamizanagi, zamagra'a zamagaku nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Zamagra olivimofo raga'ane, wainimofo raga'a regatiti hu'za tima'a e'nerizanagi, magore hu'za tima'a ne'za onkazageno zmanankemo'a tusiza huno hagage nehie. <verse eid="JOB 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Frinaku'ma karagi'ma neraza vahe'mokizmi zamageru'mo ran kumapintira ome ra hu'ne. Ana nehazage'za zamahe kuzafa'ma ante'naza vahe'mo'za zamazama hanaza vaheku zavira netaze. Hianagi Anumzamo'a zavi'ma netazazana antahizamino rukrahera huno nozamage.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>Kefo zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za masazamofona ha'renente'za, masazamofo kante'ma vu'zankura zamavesra nehige'za afete nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Nanterama zahufama masama osu'negeno'a, vahe'ma zamahe fri vahe'mo'za oti'za vu'za zamunte omne vahe'ene keonke zanku'ma atupa'ma nehaza vahera ome zamahe nefri'za, musufa vahekna hu'za kenagera vano nehu'za ke'onke'zana musufa nesaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Vere a'nanema zamazeri savari'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za avega ante'nazageno, zagemo'a tami nefarege'za amanage nehaze. Tavugosarera refite'nesnunke'za vahe'mo'za oragegahaze nehu'za, tavaravereti zamavugosarera ana'nekize. <verse eid="JOB 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Kumazafa vahe'mo'za kenage vano nehu'za, vahe'mokizmi nona anafe hu'za kumazafa nesaze. Ana nehu'za ferura zamavu nemase'za, masama hiama'a ke'za antahi'za nosaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Kenage'ma hanima kintrakoma hiana e'i zamagritera nantera nese. Ana nehige'za kenage'ma amanovazi'zama fore'ma huno vahe'ma zamazeri koro'ma nehia zana ke'za antahi'za hu'nazanki'za korora nosaze.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>Hianagi timofo agremo'ma ame huno vagareaza hu'za fanane nehaze. Maka zama zamagrama ante'naza zamo'a kazusifi mesnige'za, zamagra'a ante'naza waini hozafinagi novaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Zagemo'ma aisima te ze'zema higeno kekokako'ma hu'nea mopafima ufreankna hu'za kumi'ma nehaza vahera fri vahe kuma'mo zamazeri nakrinige'za frigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Ana hina kasema zamante'naza vahera anta'zmimo'za antahi ozamigahaze. Ana nehanageno zamavufagamo'a haganentake hanige'za kanintamimo'za nenesage'za, vahe'mo'za mago'enena antahi ozamigahaze. Kumi'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za zahoko tuno zafa eri hantagiankna hu'za tami'za masegahaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Kumi'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za mofavrema kase onte'naza naravo a'nea rezmatga hu'za keonke'zazmia eneri'za, kento a'nenenema zamazama hu'zankura zamavesra nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Hianagi zago vahe'ma mani'za vahe'mo'za ra zamagima e'neri'za vahera Anumzamo'a Agra'a hankave'areti zamazeri netre. Ana vahe'mo'za maka zampina knare hu'za vugahazanagi, henka'a ome haviza hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Anumzamo'a zamatrenigeno mago zamo'a hazenkea ozamisnige'za, knare hu'za manigahaze. Hianagi Anumzamo'a maka'zama hazazampina avua anteno nezamage. <verse eid="JOB 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Hagi zamagra atupa knafi ra zamagia eri'za mani so'e hute'za, ruga'a vahe'ma fri'za nevazaza hu'za frigahaze. Ana hugahazankino witi ragamo'ma afu re'nege'zama kazinteti rukafari zankna hu'za frigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>Nagrama havigema nehanugeno'a, iza nagrikura huno havige nehane hunora nazeri kori'sigeno, nagri nanekemo'a amne zanknara hugahie?<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s">Bildati'ma nampa 3mofonte'ma Jopu kenona hunte'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Hagi anante Suha mopareti ne' Bildati'a amanage huno Jopuna kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>Anumzamo'a hankavenentake hu'neanki'za maka vahe'mo'za Agrikuke korora hugahaze. Ana hu'neankino maka zama monafima me'nea zantamina Agrake kegava hu'nege'za Agri avesi amage ante'za, mani fru hu'za nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Iza amuhara hu'nesnia vahe'mo monafima mani'naza sondia vahe'a hamparigara hu'ne? Hagi ama mopafintira ina vahe'moka hunka nagritera Agri masamo'a remsa hunonante hunka hugahane? <verse eid="JOB 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Inankna huno mopafi vahe'mo'a Anumzamofo avurera fatgoa huno nemanino, agrua huno manigahie? <verse eid="JOB 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Ikamo'ene hanafimo'za remsa hutfa hu'nazanagi, Anumzamofo avurera ana masamo'a rumsa osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>Tagra mopafi vahe'mota kaninkna huta hagirafagna hu'none.<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s">Bildati kere'ma Jopu'ma kenona hunte'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Hagi anante Bildati'ma hia nanekerera Jopu'a amanage huno kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>Inankna hunka hankavezamima omne'nea vahera zamaza nehunka, zamagra'ama zamaza osuga vahera zamagura vazi'nane. <verse eid="JOB 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Kagra inankna hunka knare antahi'zama omne'nea vahe'mofona antahintahia neminka, oku'ma me'nea knare antahi'zanka'a erinte ama hane? <verse eid="JOB 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Ama ana knare antahintahi zanka'a igati eri'nane? Ana hu'nankeno iza avamu'mo kagri kagipina huvazino ama'na nanekea huamara nehie?<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo so'e zama'ama Jopu'ma erinte ama hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>Fri'naza vahe'mokizmi hankro'ma hagerimofo agu'afima nemaniza naga'mo'za Anumzamofonkura tusi koro nehazageno zamahirahi nere. <verse eid="JOB 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Fri vahe kumapima nemaniza vahe'mo'za Anumzamofo avurera frara oki amate mani'naze. Vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehia kumapima me'nea zantamima Anumzamo'ma kenaku'ma hiana, mago zamo'a avurera anteso osu amate me'negeno nege. <verse eid="JOB 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Hanki noti kaziga me'nea mona anami kankamumpi tro huntegeno me'negeno, Anumzamo'a anami kankamumpi tro huntegeno mago'zamo'a azeoriaza me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Hanintirima huno antarakoma hu'nea hampompi Anumzamo'a ko tina eri ano vazintegeno me'ne. Hianagi knagura huno ana timo'a rufuragu vazinora evunoramie. <verse eid="JOB 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Ana nehuno hamponteti kini tra'a erirefitegeta nonkone. <verse eid="JOB 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Hagerimofo agofetura Anumzamo'a mago avame'zanteti isagana ante'ne. Ana hu'neankino ana isagamo hanine masanena refko hunezanante. <verse eid="JOB 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Anumzamo'ma monamofoma azeri konerigeno'a, monama tro huno regarinte'nea tra'mo'a torevare nehie. <verse eid="JOB 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Anumzamo'a hankave'areti higeno avunemanentea hagerimo'a, ome rurava nehe. Agra knare antahi'zanteti, hagerimofo agu'afima Rehapu'e nehazageno'ma nemania afi'zaga rehapanetie. <verse eid="JOB 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Anumzamo'ma asimu'ma antegeno'a, anamima me'nea monamo'a rumsa hutfaza nehie. Ana nehuno hagerimpima mani'neno vanoma nehia osifavea Agra azanuti ahe fri'ne. <verse eid="JOB 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Ama ana maka zama fore'ma hiana, Anumzamo'a hankave'areti tro'ma hu'nea zamofona, amne agema'a fore higeta kone. Hagi Agra menina sumi ke huno kea nehigeta nentahunanki, monagefinti'ma rankema huno'ma keagama hanigeta, inankna huta tagra antahi amara hugahune?<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a fatgo navu'nava hu'noe huno hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Jopu'a mago'ene keaga'a amanage huno hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>tamagerfa huanki kasefa'ma huno mani'nea Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a, kankamuna onamino knare avu'avara hunonanteno, natrege'na tusi natazampi manue. <verse eid="JOB 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>Menima kasefa'ma hu'na mani'ne'nama nasimu'ma nentoana, Anumzamo nasimura namige'na mani'noe. <verse eid="JOB 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>Nagra havige nanekea nosu'na, havigea hu'na vahera revatga osugahue. <verse eid="JOB 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Hagi tamagrama nehaza nanekegura, tamage nehaze hu'na osugahue. Ana nehu'na kefo avu'ava zana osu'na, mani fatgo hu'na mani'nena frigahue. <verse eid="JOB 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Nagra fatgo navu'nava'ma nehua zana kegava hu'ne'na, ana avamenteke mani'na vugahue. Nagrama kasefa'ma hu'na mani'na vanuanknafina, kumi hu'noe hu'na antahintahi hakarea osugahue. <verse eid="JOB 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>Nagri'ma ha'ma renenantaza vahera, kefo avu'ava'zama nehaza vahe'ma Anumzamo'ma zamazeri havizama nehiaza huno zamazeri haviza nehuno, nagri'ma zamefi hunenamiza vahera, kumi'ma nehaza vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehiaza huno zamazeri haviza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Hagi Anumzamofoma amage'ma nontaza vahera, amuha zazamia omanegahie. Ana hanigeno Anumzamo'a ana vahera zamahe fananehu vagaregahie. <verse eid="JOB 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Ana vahe'mofo avate'ma knazamo'ma esanigeno zavi'ma atesniana, Anumzamo'a antahi omigahifi? <verse eid="JOB 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>E'i ana Hankavenentake Anumzamofona musena hunonte'za, Anumzamofontega nunamuna osugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>Nagra menima rempima huramisuana, mago'zana eri frara okigahuanki, Anumzamofo hankave'a erinte ama hu'na tamasamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Ana hankave'a tamagra'a ko ke'naze. Hianagi na'a higeta amunte omane nanekea hantageta eri hakarea nehaze?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>Kefo avu'ava'zama nehu'za, vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera, Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a miza zamia huhampri zamante'neanki'za erigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Ana rama'a mofavrea antegahazanagi, ana mofavre naga'zmia hapi zamahege, zamagaku hu'za frige hugahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Hagi mago'ama ofri'ma manisaza vahera, ruzahu ruzahu krimo zamahe frisnige'za, kento a'nane nagazmimo'za ana vahekura zamasunkura hu'za zavira otegahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Kefo zamavu'zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za rama'a zago eri atru nehu'za, kukenanena rama'a eri tru hanageno hihi huno marerigahianagi, <verse eid="JOB 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za ana kukena eri nehankresnage'za, ke'zami omne vahe'mo'za ana vahe'mokizmi zagoa refko hu'za erigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama noma kisazana, pamponkemofo nomo'ma hiaza huno hankave'a omane no negi'za, mani'ne'za hozama kvama hanazana tona no kizankna hu'za nona kigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Kumi'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama nozamifima masazana zago vahekna hu'za nemasaze. Hianagi mase'nafinti'ma oti'zama kazana, maka fenozamimo'a igafi freno omnetfa nehie. <verse eid="JOB 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Timo'ma hageno eaza huno, hazenke zamo'a eno eme zamavareno fregahie. <verse eid="JOB 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Zage fre kazigati zaho'mo eme zamazeri komenkame huno zamavaresga huno fresnige'za, ko'ma mani'naza nonkumatera omanigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Ana zahomo'a ana vahekura asunkura huozmanteno zamazeri haviza hanige'za, ana zahomofo hankavegu koro nehu'za zamagare'za fregahaze. <verse eid="JOB 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Hianagi maka vahe'mo'zama ana zama fore haniaza nege'za, zamaza rupro nehu'za tusi zamagiza regahaze.<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a ama mopafi feno zanku keaga hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>Vahe'mo'za mopafinti silva kafi'za e'neri'za, golia tevefi kre'za erigru hu'za e'nerize. <verse eid="JOB 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Ainia mopafinti kafi'za eneri'za, have krefrage'za kopa e'nerize. <verse eid="JOB 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Mopa agu'ama golima me'nea havegu'ma nehakaza vahe'mo'za ofenkame hanintirima hu'neama'afi tavi tagizageno remasa hu'nege'za, tavi masare ana haveramina hake'za e'nerize. <verse eid="JOB 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Ana vahe'mo'za mopa agu'afina vahe'ma ovu'are keria kafi'za ufrete'za, ana kerifina nofite urami'za ihimareaza hu'za vute ete nehu'za eri'zana e'nerize. <verse eid="JOB 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Hagi mopamofo agofetura vahe'mo'za hoza eri'za nentaze. Hianagi mopamofo agu'afina goligu'ma nehakraza, tusi teve hanavazi'za haveramina kre nefragazageno tevemo'a tusi amuho huno mopa temara'mra nehie. <verse eid="JOB 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>Anampinti'ma e'nerizana zago'amo'ma marerisa havema safaema nehaza have e'neri'za, golima me'nea mopanena kafi'za e'nerize. <verse eid="JOB 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Goligu'ma nehakraza vahe'mo'zama ana kerifima unefraza kana oku'a me'nege'za, namamo'zane tumpamo'zanena zamavua onke'naze. <verse eid="JOB 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Ana nehazage'za zamavufaga rama nehaza afi zaga kfamo'za anankerifina zamagia rente'za vano nosazage'za, laioni mo'zanena anankerifina zamagaka renontaze. <verse eid="JOB 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Goli eri'zama e'neriza vahe'mo'za kazinkazima hu'nea haveramina ru frage mafrage hunetre'za, agona kafi'za eri ankrinesaze. <verse eid="JOB 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Ana vahe'mo'za haveramimpina kafi'za ufre'za, zago'amo'ma marerisa haveramina ke'za e'nerize. <verse eid="JOB 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Anama nehu'za ana vahe'mo'za mopa kafi'za tima agafama huno'ma ne-eama'a renkaninere'za marerisa zantamima oku'ama fraki'nea zana erinte ama' nehaze.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Knare antahi'zama hakeno eri'zanku hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>Hianagi vahe'mo'za knare antahi'zana igati ome e'neri'za, ama' antahi'zana igati ome e'nerize? <verse eid="JOB 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Mago vahe'mo'e huno knare antahi'zane, ama' antahi'zama eri kumara keno antahinora osu'ne. Na'ankure ama mopafima nemaniza vahe amu'nompina knare antahi'zane, ama' antahi'zana onketfa hugahane. <verse eid="JOB 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Ra hagerimo'a huno, nagranena omani'ne nehanigeno, amefenkame mopa agu'afima me'nea tirumo'enena huno nagranena omani'ne huno hugahie <verse eid="JOB 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Knare antahi'zane, ama' antahi'zamofo mizama'amo'a rugatere'neankita, golireti'ene silvaretira miza osugahune. <verse eid="JOB 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Ofiri mopafinti'ma eri'naza golimofo mizama'ane, zago'amo'ma marerisa haverarena, Oniksine Safaema nehaza havemofo mizama'a agatere'ne. <verse eid="JOB 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Knare antahi'zamo'a golimofo mizane kritoraisie nehaza havemofo mizama'a agatere'ne. Ana hu'neankino goliretike'ma tro'ma hu'nesnia zanteti'enena, knare antahi'zana miza osegahie. <verse eid="JOB 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Hagi hagerimpima kororiema nehaza zama me'nea zanteti'ene, zago'amo'ma marerisa havema Jaspema nehaza haveretira miza osegahane. E'ina hu'neankino knare antahi'zamo'a periema nehaza zamofo mizanena agatere'ne. <verse eid="JOB 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Hagi zago'amo'ma marerisa havema topasiema nehaza havema Itiopia mopareti'ma eri'naza havemofona, knare antahi'zamo'a agatere'ne. E'ina hu'neankino knare antahi'zamo'a hentofaza huno agruma hu'nea golia agatere'ne. <verse eid="JOB 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>E'ina hu'neankita, knare antahi'zamo'a igati ne-e? Hagi ama' antahi'zana inantega me'nesnigeta kegahune? <verse eid="JOB 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Mika zagamofo avurera knare antahi'zamo'a frakino me'neankino, knare avurgama hunte'negenoma anamifima hareno vanoma nehania namamo'enena onkegahie. <verse eid="JOB 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Fri vahe kumamo'ene vahe'ma zamazeri havizama hu kumamokea huke, knare antahi'zama hakeno ke kumara me'ne hazageta zaho kea antahino'e. <verse eid="JOB 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Knare antahi'zama eri kana Anumzamo Agrake keno antahino hu'ne. Ana hu'neankinka igati knare antahi'zana erighane. Anumzamo agrake antahi'ne. <verse eid="JOB 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>Na'ankure maka zama ama mopamofo agofetu'ma me'nea zantamina Anumzamo'a keharu huno negeno, monamofo fenka kazigama me'nea zantamina nege. <verse eid="JOB 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Anumzamo'a zaho'mofona zaho'ma erisnia hankave'a avamente refko huno nemino, hampompima me'neno ko'ma arania zana tina, avamente refko huno Anumzamo'a ante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>Ko'ene kopsi'nanena e'ikante megaha'e huno Anumzamo'a kasege retro hunte'negene ana kante amage nenta'e. <verse eid="JOB 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>Hagi ana'ma huteno'a Anumzamo'a knare antahi'zama rezagane so'e huno keno erinte fatgo nehuno, knare huno me'ne huno nehie. <verse eid="JOB 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Ana nehuno Anumzamo'a amanage huno vahe'motagura hu'ne, Ra Anumzamofoma koro'ma huntezana, knare antahi'zana megeno, havi avu'ava zamofoma amefi'ma humisnanana, ama' antahi'zana erigahane hu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma ko'ma knare nomani'zama mani'nea zanku hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Jopu'a mago'ene keaga'a amanage huno hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>Ko'ma evia kafuramimpine ikampinema Anumzamo'ma knare huno kegavama hunantege'nama mani'na e'noaza hu'na, manisuegu antahintahia nehue. <verse eid="JOB 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>Anumzamo agra nasenirera tavira remsa hunentege'na, mago zankura nagesa ontahi knare hu'na vu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>Hagi ko'ma maka zamo'ma knare'ma higenama mani'noa knafina, nagrite'ene naga'ni'arera Anumzamo'a taragoteno knare aroneni'a mani'nege'na ke'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>Hankavenentake Anumzamo'ma nagranema taragotenoma mani'nea knafina, mofavre naganimo'za nagri tava'onte mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>Ana nehazage'na bulimakao afu zaga'nifintira ami rina rama'a nerati'na, olivi hozanifintira rama'a olivi raga tagite'na, masavena reratina rama'a erugeno viteno tima eviaza hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>Hagi korapara nagra ugota kva vahe mani'ne'na, rankumamofo kafante'ma keagama refkohu knazupa, zamagima me'nea vahe'mo'zama trate'ma unemanizage'na nagranena tra'nire umani'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>Kasefa vahe'ma nagrama neoge'zama nenage'za, mani kantugma nehu'za kankamuna nami'naze. Ana nehazage'za ozafanafa naga'mo'za, antahinenami'za oti'ne'za nenagazage'na vu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>Kva vahe'mo'zama keagama nehazaretira nagrama neoge'zama nenage'za, kea osu mani'ne'za zamazanteti zamagitera rehamunki'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>Ran kumate'ma ugagota hu'za kegavama hu'naza kva vahera, zamagefunamo'a marerino zmavagunafare akamrege'za kea osu zamagira hamunki'za mani'naze.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Hagi nagrama keagama nehuge'zama antahi'za vahe'mo'za hu muse hunenantage'za, keagama nehuge'za nagaza vahe'mo'zanena knare keaga hunami'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>Na'ankure zamunte omane vahe'ene megusa mofavre naga'mo'zama, taza huo hu'za kema hazage'na, nagra zamaza hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Amuha zazamima omanea vahera zamaza nehuge'za, nagrira husga hunante'naze. Ana nehu'na kento a'nanea zamaza nehuge'za tusi muse hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Maka zama hu'noana fatgo kazigatike hu'noe. Ana nehugeno fatgo navu'nava zamo'a za'za kukenama antaninogeno'ma hiaza huno rufitenante'ne. Hagi fatgoma huno refkohu avu'ava'zamo'a, pristi vahe'mo'zama nentani'za kankrikna huno nasenirera me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Zamavuma asuhu'nea vahera kana zamaveri nehu'na, zamagiama haviza hu'nea vahera zamaza huge'za kana vu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Zamunte omane vahe'mokizmia nafa zamigna nehu'na, ke'na antahi'nama osu'noa vahe'ma keagafima otizage'na, zamaza hu'na keaga eri ante fatgo hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Anumzamofoma amage onte vahe'mo'zama vahe'ma zamazeri havizama hazage'na, ana vahera zamagemazampa ru tavegri'na, zamagipintira eri vari'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>Nagrama antahuana, tamagerfa hu'na ama mopafina zazate musenkasea hu'na mani'na vute'na ome ozafa re'na frigahue hu'na nagesa antahi'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Hagi zafamofo rafu'namo ofenkame uramino mopa agu'afinti ti anivazu higeno ani'namo tretre hiaza nehigeno atako'mo aninare runteankna hige'na nagra korapara mani'noane. <verse eid="JOB 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Nagri'ma ko'ma knare nagima nami'naza zamo'a nagripina amne kasefa huno me'ne. Ana nehige'na maka zupa kasefa hankavea erivava hu'na nevue. <verse eid="JOB 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>Nagrama antahintahima vahe'mokizmima nezamuge'za, maka vahe'mo'za akohe'za mani'neza, nagri nanekea antahi'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Hagi nagrama keagama huvagama retogeno'a, mago'mo'e huno nagri kerera antemino keaga osu'ne. Na'ankure nagrama hua nanekea antahiso'e hu'nagu anara hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Vahe'mo'za komaranigu'ma avegama ante'nazageno koma rige'zama musema nehazankna hu'za, nagri nanekema antahi'zankura tusiza huno zamavesi'ne. Ana hige'za za'za knama ko'ma oru'nereti'ma ko'ma rigeno'ma maka zamofo ani'namo'ma muse nehuno ani'na eri mareankna hu'za nagri nanekea muse hu'za eri'naze. <verse eid="JOB 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Hagi vahe'mo'zama antahintahi hakarema nehu'za mani'nazage'na, kiza renezami'na knare navugosa huzami'noe. E'inama hua kazigati zamarimpa zamazeri hankaveti'noe. <verse eid="JOB 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Nagra kva vahezmi mani'ne'na, e'ina hiho, amana hiho hu'na vahera zamazeri ante fatgo nehu'na, mago kini ne'mo sondia vahe'amofo amu'nompi nemaniaza nehu'na, zavi'ma ataza vahera zamazeri tagane vahekna hu'noe.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a azeri agazema hu'naza zanku hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>Hianagi menina kasefa vahe'mo'za kiza zokago ke hunenante'za huhaviza hunante'naze. Ana kasefa vahe'mokizmi zamafahe'za nagri sipisipima kegavama nehaza kraramina zamagra kegava hugara osu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Hagi nagrama zamagoana hankave'zamia omane'neanki'za nagrira e'za eme naza hugara osu'naze. Na'ankure hankavezmimo'a hago zamagripintira vagare'ne. <verse eid="JOB 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Ana vahe'mokizmia zamunte omanege'za, zamagaku nehu'za atre'za vu'za vahe omani ka'ma kokampi umani'ne'za, kenagera ne'zankura hake'za vano hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Ana nehu'za trazampintira aka tra'zana hu'za nene'za, brumu zafamofo rafu'na'anena eri tasagi hu'za ne'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Ana vahera kumapintira zamahe kasopenetre'za, kumzufa vaheku'ma nehazaza hu'za kezatizmante'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Ana'ma hazage'za vu'za, tinkagomupine muri kampine, have kampine umani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Anantegama umani'ne'za trazampi vano nehu'za, donki afu'mo'zama nehazaza hu'za ana trazampina eri tru hu'za mani'ne'za krafage hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Hagi ana vahera zamagia omaneno neginagi vahe mani'nazanki'za zamahe kasopazage'za fre'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>Hagi ana vahe'mokizmi mofavre naga'mo'za, nagirevare zagamera nehu'za, huhaviza hunante'naze. Ana nehu'za nagrikura kiza zokago ke hunante'za, nazeri nagaze hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Nagra zamagri zamavurera mago havi zaga manuge'za zamefi hunenami'za, nagritera erava'o nosu'za, navufi zamavetu ahenante'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Ati karima reragareaza huno Anumzamo'a knaza namino nazeri ante ravahege'za, nazano hunante'naku'ma haza zana amne hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Hazenke zama nehaza kasefa vahe'mo'za nazantmaga kazigatira oti'za, narotago hazage'na fre'na vano nehuge'za, kama vanufina krifu eme anaginte'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Nagri'ma nazeri haviza nehu'za keonke'zama eri kazigati maka zana nehu'za, kama nevufina eme rehiza nehu'za, zamagrama antahi'zana agri'ma azahu vahera omani'ne hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Nagri'ma ha'ma hunantenaku'ma e'nazana vahe'mo'za, maka kazigati ankariserami'za e'za eme nazeri haviza hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Ana hige'na menina tusi koro nehugeno, zaho'mo hampo erino viaza huno knare nagima e'neruazane fenozaninena erino vu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>Hagi nagra menina hago fri'za nehugeno, natazamo'a maka zupa nazeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 30:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Kenagera zaferinanimo'a tusi nata negrigeno, ana natazamo'a naterenora novie. <verse eid="JOB 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Anumzamo'a hankavenentake azantetira kukenagna huno rufitenante'ne. Ana hu'neno azantetira za'za kukenama antaninoa kenamofo nananke kama'are azerino nanankena nazeri pro hu'za nehie. <verse eid="JOB 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Ana huteno hapapi matevuno natrege'na, kugusopagna nehu'na tanefakna hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>Ana hige'na naza hananegu Anumzamoka kagritega krafagea hu'noanagi, keni'arera nona osu'nane. Ana nehunka kagri kavure oti'noanagi, nagrira kamefi hunami'nane. <verse eid="JOB 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Kagra karimpa ahenenantenka, hankavenentake kazanteti nazeri haviza nehane. <verse eid="JOB 30:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Kagra kagigagi zaho atrankeno eno eme nazeri sga huno nefregenka, kagra ununko atrankeno eno eme nazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Ana'ma nehanke'na nagrama antahuana, kagra nahe fritenka hunantesnanke'na maka vahe'mo'zama fri'za nevaza kumatega vugahue hu'na nagesa antahi'noe. <verse eid="JOB 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>Hagi mago vahe'mo'ma knafima mani'neno'ma azahu zanku'ma krafama nehanigeno'a, tamagerfa huno mago'mo azana anteno aza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 30:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Nagrama ko'ma knare hu'na mani'ne'na, knazampima mani'za vahekura zavira atenezmante'na, zamunte omane vahekura nagu'afina tusiza hu'na keke huzmante'noe. <verse eid="JOB 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Hianagi nagritera knare'za fore hanie hu'nama amuha'ma hu'noa zana forera osigeno, kefo zamo nagritera ne-egeno, tavi masagu'ma avegama ante'noana omegeno hanizamo e'ne. <verse eid="JOB 30:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Nagu'amo'a hazenkefi manino ne-eno mani frua osu'ne. Ana higeno maka zupa natazamo nazeri havizantfa hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Nagrira knazamo rentrako higena hanizampi vano nehu'na, tavira onke'noe. Ana nehu'na kuma amu'nompima vahe'ma vano nehazafi mani'ne'na, iza naza hugahieha nehu'na zavira ate'noe. <verse eid="JOB 30:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Ana nehu'na zavi'matoa nagerumo'a, afi kramo'ene za'za agempunane namagu'ma ostritiema nehaza namamo'enema krafama neha'aza hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Navufgamo'a ru ko'nagifa nehegeno, zaferinanifintira tusi amuho nehuno teve rukaru hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 30:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Nagra hapue nehaza zavena nehe'na, nasunku zagamera nehu'na, konkena nere'na zavi zagamera hu'noe.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'a fatgoma huno mani'nea zanku huama hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>Hanki nagrama navuma kezani'afima mago huvempa kema hu'noana, mago mofa'ma negesuna havi antahintahia e'orisnue hu'na huvempa hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>E'inahu havi avu'ava'zama hanugeno'a, manisgama hu'nea Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a ana havi avu'ava zanirera havi mizana namigahie. <verse eid="JOB 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Havizama hu'za refkoma hu so'ema nosaza vahera Anumzamo'a knaza nezamino, kumi'ma haza vahetera hazenkeza atregeno ne-e. <verse eid="JOB 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Ana nehuno maka zama hua zampina Anumzamo'a avua anteno nenageno, nagama rerakaure'na vuana nenage. <verse eid="JOB 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>Nagra mago vahera havigea hu'na revataga nosu'na, havige zantera nagia re'na ovu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>Atrenkeno Anumzamo'a navu'navazania erinteno, fatgoma huno refko'ma nehia sigerire negeno refko huno nageno. Na'ankure nagrama fatgo navu'nava zama nehuana Agrake keno antahino hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Hagi Anumzamofo kama atre'na hazama negre'na, navumo kea zante'ma havi antahintahima hu'na kumi'ma hu'nesnua kumiro, mago'a kumi'enema hu'nesnuana, <verse eid="JOB 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>atrenkeno nagrama hankre'nesnua ne'zana, ru vahe'mo'za vasage'za neho. Hagi nagrama hankre'nesnua avimzana eri tasagi hutreho. <verse eid="JOB 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>Hagi mago a'ma nege'na havi antahintahima eri'nesnuano, tvaonire'ma nemanisnia ne'mofo a'ma nege'na kenunuma hu'nesanuana, <verse eid="JOB 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>atrenkeno nagri a'mo'a ru vemofo a' nemanina, ru venenemo'za a'ni'a ante'za maseho. <verse eid="JOB 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Hagi nagra mago vemofo a'enema hazenkema hu'nesanuana, nagra'a tusi nagaze eri nami'noanki'na, ana kumi'ma hu'nesua zantera mizama'a nagra'a erigahue. <verse eid="JOB 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>E'i ana kumi'mo'a, mago tevegna hu'neankino, tevava huno nevuno, teve kumapi vugahie. Ana hu'neankino ana maka'zama ante'noa zana, tevemo te fanene hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>Hagi ko'ma nagri eri'za venenemozane a'nemo'zanema, knazamima eri'za neazage'nama, knazazamima e'orinesnuana, <verse eid="JOB 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>inankna hu'na Anumzamofo avurera nagra keagafina otigahue? Inankna hunka eri'za vaheka'a kegava hu'nane huno Anumzamo'ma nagenokama hanige'na, na'ane hu'na kenona huntegahue? <verse eid="JOB 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a Agrake nagri'ene eri'za vahe'ni'anena, antatimofo arimpafina tro hurante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>Hagi zamunte omane vahe'mo'zama mago'a zanku'ma kema nehazage'na, i'ora osu'na amne nezami'na, kento a'nanemo'zama zamazama hanuegu'ma nagrite'ma zamavuma nentazage'na amne zamaza nehu'na, <verse eid="JOB 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>nagragukera ontahi'noanki megusa mofavreramina, ne'zana refko hu'na zami'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>Nagra osi'ma mani'noregati'ma eno meninte'ma e'neana, megusa mofavre nagara nafa zamigna hu'na kegava hunezmante'na, kento a'nane nagara zamaza hu'na e'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Hagi nonkumazmima omne vahe'ma kukenagu'ma atupa'ma nehazage'na, kukena nezami'na, mago'a zanku'ma atupa'ma nehaza vahera kukenane nakreku'enena zami'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>Ana nehu'na zamazeri amuhoma hanigu sipisipi azokateti'ma trohu'naza nakre kura zamuge'za antani'za amuhogu'ma nehu'za musema nehu'za, nagrira husga hunante'naze. <verse eid="JOB 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>Hagi keaga refkohu ne'mo'a, nagri kaziga antegahie nehu'na, nagra keagafina oti'na megusa mofavre naga'ma keagama huzmantesnuana, <verse eid="JOB 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>nazamo'a nazo'nafinti rutasagi huramigahie. <verse eid="JOB 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Na'ankure nagrama koro'ma nehuana, Anumzamo'a knazana atreni'geno eme nazeri haviza hugahie hu'na nentahue. Hagi Anumzamo'ma hankaveareti'ma nazeri havizama nehaniana, nagrira amuhazani'a omane'ne. <verse eid="JOB 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>Hagi nagra zagofina amuha zani'a nonte'na, golimo'a naza hugahie hu'na namentintia nosue. <verse eid="JOB 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>Nagra'a nazapinti'ma erifore hu'na ante'noa zago fenokura navufga erisga nosu'na, <verse eid="JOB 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>monare'ma me'neno nerea zagere'ene ikamo'ma knare zantfama huno remsama nehige'na monora huonte'na, <verse eid="JOB 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>e'i ana zantera mago narimpa hu'na monora hunonte'na, nzantetira zanahe'na antakora osu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>Hanki nagrama anama hu'nesanuana kumi hu'noankino, kema refko'ma hunantesnia nemo'a knaza namigahie. Na'ankure onagamu monafinkama nemania Anumzamofontera havige hu'na eri fraki'nogu anara hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>Hagi ha' vahe'nimo'zama knazampima mani'nazage'na nezamage'na, nagra musena nehu'na zamagizana ore'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>Ana nehu'na magore hu'na zamazeri haviza hu nanekea hu'na kumira nosu'na, havizama hunante'nazarera nona osu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Hagi nagri nompima nemaniza eri'za vahe'nimo'za hu'za, maka eri'za vahe'a ne'zana nezamino magore huno zamatrege'za amnea novaza ne' mani'ne hu'za nagrikura nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Nagra ozamageno'a vahe'ma nonire'ma azage'na magore hu'na zamatroge'za megira omase'nazanki, kahana anagi hagaro nehu'na, zamavare nompi antoge'za maka zupa mase'naze. <verse eid="JOB 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Mago'a vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'na kumi'ni'a nagu'afina eri frakinaku hu'noanagi, anara osu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>Hagi rama'a vahe'mo'zama nenage'za, kiza zokago kema hunenantesage'za, naga'nimo'zama eme nasami'zankura korera hu'na nompina omani'noe. <verse eid="JOB 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>Hagi nagra nagesama antahuana, nagrama nehuankema mago vahe'mo'ma agesama anteno antahiresina knare hisine. Nagra nazanko avona ama antoanki atre'nenkeno Hankavenentake Anumzamo negeno kenona hunanteno. Hagi mago vahe'mo'ma nagri'ma keagama hunantenaku'ma hanuno'a avompi krenteno. <verse eid="JOB 31:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Anama hanige'na muse nehu'na ana avona nazo'nare erigofi'na vano nehu'na, kini fetori'ma hiaza hu'na nasenire antanigahue. <verse eid="JOB 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Ana nehu'na kini vahe'mofo mofavremo'ma hiaza hu'na, Anumzamofo avuga uoti'na nagra'ama maka navu'nava zama hu'nesanuana ome eri ama hu'na asamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>Hagi mopa'nimo'ma haviza hu'nane huno'ma keagama hunantenigeno, hoza tinkamo'a tusi zavi'netenigeno, <verse eid="JOB 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>mago vahe'mofo hozafinti ne'za musufa sege, ana hozamofo nefa ahe frige'ma hu'nesanuana, <verse eid="JOB 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>anama eri nafa'ama hu'nesanua mopafina witimo'a ohesianki ave've trazamoke hageno marenerisanigeno, amne tra'zamo balimofo nona erino hageno marerigahie. Ama ana nanekema huvagareteno'a, Jopua kea osu'ne.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma hiankere Elihu'a rimpa neheno kenona hunte'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Jopuna 3'a rone'amo'za agri kere'ma ru'enema kenona hunte'zankura zamavaresra hu'naze. Na'ankure Jopu'ma agra'agu'ma huama huno, hazenkeni'a omane'neanki fatgo hu'na mani'noe huno'ma hu'nea zanku anara hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Hianagi mago nehazave nera, Barakeli nemofokino agi'a Elihu'e. Ana hu'neankino agra Rami nagapinti nekino, Jopuna tusi arimpa ahente'ne. Na'ankure agrama agesama antahiana Anumzamo'a agri kumiku huno knazana nemianagi, nagafare Jopu'a huamara huno tamage hago kumi hu'nogeno Anumzamo'a knazana nenamie hunora nosie nehuno, Jopuna arimpa ahente'ne. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Ana nehuno Jopuna 3'a rone'a raminku'ene tusi arimpa ahezamante'ne. Na'ankure Jopu nanekere'ma kenona hunte so'ema nosu'za, Jopu'a hazenke hu'negeno Anumzamo'a knazana nemie hu'zama, hazenke'amofo agafama ke'za eri fore'ma osaza zanku anara hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Elihu'a agra nehazave mani'negu huno kea osu mani'nege'za, Jopuna 3'a rone'amo'za zamagra ranra vaheki'za, Jopu'enena keaga vugote'za hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Hianagi ana ranra naga'mo'zama Jopu nanekere'ma mago'enema kenona huontaza zankura, tusi arimpa ahe'ne. <verse eid="JOB 32:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Ana higeno Buzi kumateti ne' Barakeli nemofo Elihu'a amanage hu'ne, Nagra kasefa vahe manugeta tamagra ranra vahe mani'nazagu nagazegu nehu'na koro hu'na ke'nima huama huzankura ete azeri'noe. <verse eid="JOB 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Nagrama antahuana rama'a kafuma hu'naza vahe'mota knare antahi'zana huama hugahaze hu'noane. Na'ankure knare antahi'zamo'a e'inahu vahepinti ne-e. <verse eid="JOB 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a avamu'a huhu huvazigeno vahepina avamu'a mani'neankino, ana avamumo hige'za ama' antahi'zane vahera mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Mago'a zupa ranra vahe'mo'za knare antahi'zana e'norizage'za, mago'a zupa kafuzmimo'ma rama'a hu'nea vahe'mo'za fatgo huno'ma refakohu avu'ava'zana antahi amara osu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>E'ina hu'negu nagranena antahintahini'a Jopuga menina kasami'za huanki antahio. <verse eid="JOB 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Tamagrama keagama nehuta knare'nare antahintahima erinteta kema hugantugama hazankea, akohe'na mani'ne'na antahi'noe. <verse eid="JOB 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>Nagra nagesama ante so'ema hune'na keagatamima antahufina, magomo'e huno Jopunkura havige hie hunora huama huonte'ne. Ana nehutma Jopu'ma hia nanekerera kenona huonte'naze. <verse eid="JOB 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Hagi tamagra amanage huta osiho, Jopuna agri knare antahi'zamo'a tagri antahi'zana agatereankino, agri kerera vahe'mo'a kenona huontesnianki, Anumzamoke kenona huntesie. <verse eid="JOB 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Jopu'a nagranena keaga osu'neanki tamagranenke keaga hu'ne. Hagi nagranema keagama hiresina, tamagrama kenonama huntazankna hu'na kenona huontosine. <verse eid="JOB 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>Hagi tamagrira keagatamia omanegetma antahintahi hakare nehuta, Jopu'ma hia nanekerera kenona huonte'naze. <verse eid="JOB 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Hianagi tamagrama kenona osu, akoheta zazate'ma manizaza hu'na nagranena akohe'na manigahufi? I'o. <verse eid="JOB 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Nagranena antahintahini'a huama hu'na Jopuga kasamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Na'ankure rama'a naneke nagu'afina avite'neanki'na nagu'amo'ma huama huo huno'ma nazeri otisanige'na huama hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Hagi nagri nagu'afina mememofo avufgareti'ma tro'ma hu'naza tintafepima kasefa waini tima ante'nazageno'ma me'neno ruhavahavu huno rupro hunaku'ma hiaza nagu'amo'a hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Hanki nagra menima kasaminaku'ma hanua nanekema kasamisnugeno'a narimpamo'a fru hugahie. Hagi menina nagu'afima avi'mate'nea nanekea hugaho hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Nagra mago vahe'mofo kazigagera antene'na agrikera azana nosu'na, mago vahera havigea hu'na husga huontegahue. <verse eid="JOB 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Hagi nagrama havigema nagiteti'ma hu'na vahe'ma husga hunte'zante'ma knare'ma hu'noresi'na, nagri'ma tro'ma hunante'nea Anumzamo'a nagrira nazeri fanane hiresine.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma hu'nea nanekere Elihu'a mago'ene hunte'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>Hianagi menina Jopuga kagesa antenka mani'nenka nagrama maka nanekema hanuana antahio. <verse eid="JOB 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Nagra menina ete nagira reaka hu'na nanekea agafa hu'za hue. <verse eid="JOB 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Nagrama hanua nanekea fatgo nagu'areti hugahuanki'na, tamage naneke hugahue. <verse eid="JOB 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Anumzamofo Avamu'mo nagrira tro hunantegeno, Hankavenentake Anumzamo nasimura namige'na kasefara hu'na mani'noe. <verse eid="JOB 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Kagra Jopugama knare'ma hu'nesunka, nagrama keagama nehanugenka, kagra kazigatira antahintahia hutenka, nagri kerera kenona hunanto. <verse eid="JOB 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Kama antahio, kagrane nagranena Anumzamofo suza mani'no'ankino, nagri'enena higo mopa erino tro hunante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>E'ina hu'negu nagrikura korora osuo. Na'ankure nagrama hanua nanekemo'a tusi knazana kamino kazeri korora osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>Nagra nentahugenka maka nanekema hu'nampina hankavetinka kehara re'nane. <verse eid="JOB 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>Kagra Jopuga hunka, nagra agru hugeno kumi'ni'ane hazenke'ni'anena omnegena ke'ni'a omne vahe mani'noe hunka hu'nane. <verse eid="JOB 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a ha' vahe'arema nehiaza hunenanteno, kefo zamavu'ava'zama nehaza vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehiaza huno nazeri haviza nehie hunka hu'nane. <verse eid="JOB 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Hagi vahe'ma kinama hunezmantaza zafafi nagia erinteno Anumzamo'a kina hunante'neno, kama vanoma hufina avua anteno nenage hu'nane. <verse eid="JOB 33:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>Hianagi Jopuga havige hu'nananki'na kaveri hugahue. Na'ankure maka ama mopafi vahera Anumzamo'a zamagatere'ne. <verse eid="JOB 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Ana hu'neanki kagra nagafare Anumzanena kehara renka, na'a higeno vahe'ma zamaza hinogu'ma kema nehazageno'a, kenona'a Anumzamo'a hunozmante hunka nehane. <verse eid="JOB 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a ruzahu ruzahu kampinti vahera keaga huneramianagi, Agri kea tagra keta antahita nosune. <verse eid="JOB 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Kenage'ma nompi masenonkeno, ava'nafine ava'nagna zampine Anumzamo'a nanekea eme nerasamie. <verse eid="JOB 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>Hagi mago'a kenagera zmagesafi sumi huno koro kema zmasamiazamo, zamazeri korora nehie. <verse eid="JOB 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>Anumzamo'ma e'inahu'ma nehiana, kefo avu'ava'zane avufgama erisgahu zane atreta tamagu'a rukrahe hiho huno anara nehie. <verse eid="JOB 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>Hagi zamagra friza fri vahe kumatega ovanaze huno Anumzamo'a kegava hunezmante. <verse eid="JOB 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>Hagi mago'a zupa zamagrama hu'naza kumite Anumzamo'a knazana zamige'za kri tafetera mase'nazageno, zaferina zamifintira zamata kri vava nehie. <verse eid="JOB 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>Ana hu'neankino ne'zana one agesa higeno, knare'nare ne'zama kre'za e'naza ne'zanena none. <verse eid="JOB 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Hanki ana vahe'mofo zamavufagamo'a zaferinare akamaregeno, zaferina zamimo'a amate fore nehie. <verse eid="JOB 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Ana vahe'mokizmi fri'zamo'a tavaonte megeno, vahe'ma ahefri ankeromo'a zamavega anteno mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>Hianagi 1tauseni'a ankero vahepinti mago ankeromo agri'ma azama hanigu amu'nonte otino mani'neno agri avu'avazama huama huno, agra fatgo hu'ne huno'ma hiresina knare hisine. <verse eid="JOB 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>Hanki ana ankeromo'ma ana vaheku'ma asunku'ma hunenteno'a amanage hiresine. Fri vahe kumapintira agu vazio. Na'ankure ana vahe'ma mizama seno ete zamavare kana ko ke'na erifore hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>Hagi ana ne'mofo avufgamo'a knare zantfa huno osi mofavre'mofo avufgamo'ma hiaza nehanigeno, ko'ma kasefa vahe'ma mani'negeno'ma avufgamo'ma knare'ma huno me'neaza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Ana nehanigeno ana ne'mo'ma Anumzamofonte'ma nunamu hanigeno'a, Anumzamo'a muse huno nevre'nigeno agra Anumzamofo avufi negeno musena hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 33:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Ana'ma hanigeno'a ana nemo'a rone'amokizmia huama'ma huno zamasamisniana, nagra tamage kemofona eri rukrahe hu'na havige nehu'na kumi hu'noe. Hianagi Anumzamo'a nahe frigaragi kumini'a atrenanteno nahe ofri'ne. <verse eid="JOB 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Ana nehuno fri vahe kumapinti Anumzamo'a ete nagu'vazino navre'ne. Ana hu'negu hu'na menina ofri kasefa hu'na mani'nena masa negoe. <verse eid="JOB 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>Tamagerfa huno maka zupa e'inahu avu'ava'zana Anumzamo'a vahe'mokizmia huzmanteneno, anahu avu'avara huno nevie. <verse eid="JOB 33:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>Fri vahe kumapinti ete zamagu vazino zamavare'negu hu'za, ofri kasefa hu'za mani'ne'za asimu erino mani'zamofo masarera mani'za nevaze. <verse eid="JOB 33:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>E'ina hu'negu mago'ene keaga kasamigahuanki Jopuga akohenka mani'nenka kagesa antenka antahi so'e huo. <verse eid="JOB 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Hianagi kagrama mago'a nanekema hunaku'ma hanunka, amne hananke'na antahigahue. Na'ankure nagri'ma nave'nesiana, vahe'mo'za kagri'ma ke'za antahi'zama hanazana ke'a omne'nea ne' mani'ne hu'za hanazegu nave'nesie. <verse eid="JOB 33:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Hianagi kagripima mago'a nanekema omane'nesiana, kagra akohenka mani'nenka, nagrama knare antahi'zama rempi hugamisuana antahio.<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma hu'nea nanekere Elihu'a mago'ene kenona hunteno vu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Hagi Elihu'a mago'ene amanage hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>Knare antahi'zama eri'nana ne'moka nagrama hanua nanekere kagesa antenka nentahinka, ama' antahi'zama eri'nana ne'moka nagrama hanua nanekea akohenka mani'nenka antahio. <verse eid="JOB 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Hagi ne'zama tagite erinteta haga'ama neta konaza huno, maka nanekema tagesamo'ma antahia nanekea, tagesamo'a rezagane so'e huno nentahie. <verse eid="JOB 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>E'ina hu'negu inagemo fatgo huno knare hu'nefi tagra'a rezaganeta negeta, rempi huta antahisune. <verse eid="JOB 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>Hagi Jopu'ma kema hifina anage hu'ne, nagrira ke'ni'a omane'neanagi, Anumzamo'a kema hu kankamuni'a eri atrege'na mago zana osu'noe huno hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Nagrira mago hazenke'ni'a omanegeno keni'a omane'ne. Hianagi vahe'mo'za nagrikura havige ne' mani'ne hu'za nehaze. Nagrira kumini'a omane'neanagi natama namino nevia natazamo'a vagaoresnia avamente nevie. <verse eid="JOB 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Hagi magora Jopukna nera iza mani'ne. Agra kizazokago ke huno vahe'ma zamaveri hu kege nehia ne' mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Ana nehuno Jopu'a kumi'ma nehaza vahe'ene eri mago huno nemanino, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'ene kna ahefrino nemanie. <verse eid="JOB 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Na'ankure Jopu'a huno, Anumzamofoma musema huntesnampintira mago zana e'origahane huno hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>E'ina hu'negu ama' antahi'zama eri'naza vahe'mota nagri naneke antahiho. Maka vahe'mo'zama antahi'nazana Anumzamo'a havi avu'avara nosia ne' mani'ne hu'za antahi'naze. Ana hu'neankino Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a mago hazenkea osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Vahe'mo'zama hu'naza avu'avate anteno rezaganeno negeno, mizana zamitere nehia Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="JOB 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Tamagerfa huno Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a mago hazenke zana osugahie. Ana hu'neankino Hanavenentake Anumzamo'a fatgo huno refkoa hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Iza ama mopa tro huteno, kegava huo huno Anumzamofonkura hunte'ne? <verse eid="JOB 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Hagi Anumzamo'ma Agra'a avamu'ene, asimu'anema ete eriresina, <verse eid="JOB 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>maka asimu'ma enerino kasefa'ma huno nemania zagamo'a fri vaganeregeno, maka vahe'mo'za fri'za ete mopasazaresine. <verse eid="JOB 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>E'ina hu'negu Jopuga ama' antahi'zane vahe mani'noema hunka hanunka, nagrama nehua nanekere kagesa ante'nenka antahio. <verse eid="JOB 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Kagrama antahinana fatgo avu'ava zanku'ma avesrama hiresina, Anumzamo'a ama mopa kegava hunora viresimpi? E'ina hu'negu Hankave nentake huno fatgoma hu'nea Anumzamo'ma refko'ma hania zantera, mago hazenke hu'ne hunka huamara huntegahampi? <verse eid="JOB 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Anumzamo'a kini vahekura huno, mago zana huga vahera omani'naze nehuno, zamagima me'nea vahekura huno havi avu'avaza nehaza vahe mani'naze huno nehie. <verse eid="JOB 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Anumzamo maka vahera Agra'a tro huzmante'neankino, agi me'nea vahe'ene zago vahekukera nehuno, zamagi omne vahe'ene zamunte omne vahera zamage amne zanknara nosianki, Agri avurera mago avamenteke mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Vahe'mo'za osi'a knafi ame hu'za nefrize. Kenage amu'nompi friza nevazageno, hankave vahera Anumzamo'a zamahe nefrie. <verse eid="JOB 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>Na'ankure maka vahe'mo'zama haza zana Anumzamo'a negeno, maka avu'ava zama hazana nege. <verse eid="JOB 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Hanima nehia zamo'a Anumzamofo avua resoa osanigeno, maka kumira amate kegahie. <verse eid="JOB 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>E'ina hu'negu tagra kna huhampri'neta ana knarera esanunkeno, Anumzamo'a refkoa huorantegahie. <verse eid="JOB 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Anumzamo'a mago hankave vahe'ma azeri havizama hunakura, vahera antahigeteno anara nosie. Ana'ma nehuno'a ana vahe nontera ruvahe azeri o'netie. <verse eid="JOB 34:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Ana vahe'mo'za nehaza zamavu zmavara keno antahino hu'ne. Ana hu'neankino kenageke'za ana vahera zamahe fanane nehie. <verse eid="JOB 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Hagi havi vahe'mo'zama zamavu'zmava zama hu'naza zamofo nona'a, amate zamazeri haviza nehige'za vahe'mo'za nezamagaze. <verse eid="JOB 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>Anama nehiana na'ankure Anumzamo'ma hihoma huno hiazana nosu'za, Agri kasegema amage'ma nontaza zanku anara nehie. <verse eid="JOB 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Ana zamunte omne vahera zamazeri havizama hazage'zama Anumzamofontega zavi'ma nete'zama, zavi krafama nehazageno'a Anumzamo'a antahi'ne. <verse eid="JOB 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Hianagi ana zante'ma Anumzamo'ma nona huno havi avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nosanigeno'a, iza huno Anumzamo'a havi avu'ava nehie? hunora hugahie. Hagi avugosama eri fra'ma nekisanigeno'a, mago vahe'mo'a keno eri forera osugahie. Hianagi Agrake mago'mago vahete'ene ama mopafima me'nea kumatamina kegava hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 34:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>Hagi Anumzamoke kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama kva vahe'ma mani'ne'za vahe'ma zamavare'za havi kampima atresnage'za, kumi'ma hu'zanku huno anara nehie. <verse eid="JOB 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>Hagi izaga antahi'nankeno Jopu'a Anumzamofonkura huno, nagrama hu'noa kumi'mofo nona hunka nazeri haviza nehananki, mago'enena kumira osugahue hunora hu'ne? <verse eid="JOB 34:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Nagrama hu'nesnua kumira eri ama hunka nasamio. Hagi nagrama havi navu'navama hu'nesnuana henka'anena anazana osugahue. <verse eid="JOB 34:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>Anumzamo'ma Jopugama hugantea zankura kave'nosie. Ana hu'negu kagri'ma kave'nesiaza Anumzamo'a hunantesie hunka kagesa ontahio. Hianagi nagri zana omane'neanki, kagripi antahintahia me'ne. Ana hu'negu menina knare antahi'zanka'a huama hugeta antahi'maneno. <verse eid="JOB 34:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>Hagi ama' antahi'zama eri'naza vahe'mo'zane, knare antahi'zama eri'naza vahe'mo'zama nagrama hua nanekema nentahi'za amanage hu'za nagrikura hazaresine. <verse eid="JOB 34:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>Jopu'a agafa'a omane'nea naneke nehantageno, antahintahia osu neginagi naneke nehie hu'za hazaresine. <verse eid="JOB 34:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Jopugama kefo nanekema hu'nana zantera, Anumzamo'a tusi'a knaza kamigahie. <verse eid="JOB 34:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Jopu'a kumi'ma hu'nea agofetu'ma, mago'ene kumi'ma hu'neana, azante rupro huno Anumzamofona kiza zokago ke hunenteno, tagri'enena keha'nereno, Anumzamofonkura huno fatgo hunora refkoa hunonante huno keharente'ne.<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="s">Elihu'a mago'ene Jopuna azeri kori'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Anante Elihu'a mago'ene amanage huno hu'ne, <verse eid="JOB 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>Jopuga Anumzamofo avurera fatgo hu'noema hunkama nehanana, kagrama antahinana tamage naneke nehue hunka nehampi? <verse eid="JOB 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Hagi kagra Jopuga Anumzamofonku hunka, nagrama kumi'ma osu mani'ne'nama fatgo navu'nava'ma hanuana, anampintira na'a knare'zana erigahue? hunka nehane. <verse eid="JOB 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>Hanki menina Jopuga kenona hunegante'na ana maka 3'a roneka'a raminena, kenona huzamantegahue. <verse eid="JOB 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Jopuga menina kesga hunka onagamu monare'ma me'nea hamporamina ko. <verse eid="JOB 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Hanki kagrama kumi'ma hanana zamo'a inankna huno Anumzamofona azeri havizana hugahie? Kagra kumira mago'ene huvava hunka vugahananagi, e'i ana zamo'enena azeri havizana osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Kagrama mani fatgoma hunka manina zamo'a, magore huno Anumzamofona aza nehifi? Na'a mago knare'za Anumzamo'a kagripintira erigahie? <verse eid="JOB 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Hanki kagrama hana hazenke zamo'a, vaheke'za zamazeri havizana nehuno, knare kavukva'zama hana zamo'a vaheke'za zamazeri so'ea nehie. <verse eid="JOB 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>Hankave'zami me'nea vahe'mo'zama vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehazage'za, mago'a vahe'mo'zama eme zamazama hanagura zavi krafage nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Hianagi mago'mo'a amanage hunora nosie, nagri'ma nazeri fore'ma hu'neno, hani zampima mani'nogeno'ma muse zagame'ma namige'nama nehua Anumzana iga manie? <verse eid="JOB 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>Anage nehuno afi zaga kafane, nama ramimofo antahi'zama rugatereno knare antahi'zama tami'nea Anumzana iga mani'ne hu'za nosaze? <verse eid="JOB 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Ana'ma nehige'za Anumzamo taza hanie nehu'za zavi krafagea nehaze. Hianagi Anumzamo'a ke'zamia antahino nona hunozmante. Na'ankure zamagra zamavufaga erisga nehu'za, kumi nehaza vahe mani'naze. <verse eid="JOB 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Hianagi zamunte omane vahe'mo'zama zavi krafagema nehaza zankura Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a antahi nozamie hu'zama nehazana havige nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Hanki kagra Jopuga ko'ma hunka, Anumzamofona onkegahue nehunka, Agrake'za eno nagrama hu'nesua kefo zantera mizana eme namigahie hunka avega antenka mani'nananagi, Anumzamo'a ana keka'a antahiogami'ne. <verse eid="JOB 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Hagi kumi'ma nehaza vahera Anumzamo'a arimpa ahezamanteno zamazeri haviza nosie hunka nehunka, kefo zamavu zamava'ma nehaza zankura agesa nontahie hunka hu'nane. <verse eid="JOB 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Hianagi Jopugama hana nanekea amunte omane naneke nehunka, kagesa ontahi negi vahe'mo'zama nehazankna naneke hunka eri hakare nehane.<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="s">Elihu'a mago'ene keaga'a huno vu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Hagi Elihu'a mago'ene amanage huno hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>Jopuga akohenka mani'nenka antahi'nege'na antahintahia kami'neno. Na'ankure nagra mago'ene keaga hu'na Anumzamofo nanekea eri hankaveti'za nehue. <verse eid="JOB 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Nagrama rempi hu'na antahi'zama antahi'noa antahi'zanteti menima kasamisuana, nagri'ma tro'ma hu'nea Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'ava'za nehia ne' mani'ne hu'na kasamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Nagrama negasamuana havigea nogasamuanki, tamage naneke negasamue. Na'ankure nagra hentofa antahi'zane neki'na, menina kagrane mani'noe. <verse eid="JOB 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>Anumzana hankavenentake Anumza mani'ne. Hianagi mago vahera kefenkamia note. Agra hihamufine, ama' antahi'zampina hankavenentake hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Havi avu'ava'zama nehaza vahera Anumzamo'a zamatrege'za kasefara hu'za nomanize. Hianagi knafima mani'naza vahera fatgo huno refko hunezmante. <verse eid="JOB 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Ke'zamima omne vahetera avua anteteno nemanie. Hianagi zamatrege'za kini vahe'ene kini trate nemanizageno, maka zupa zamazeri antesga huvava nehie. <verse eid="JOB 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Hianagi vahe'ma kina huzmantesage'za mani'nenageno tusi'a knazamo'ma zamazeri anakinige'zama mani'nesaza vahera, <verse eid="JOB 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>na'a agafare anara hu'nefi Anumzamo'a eri zamaveri nehie. Ana nehuno zamavufaga erisga nehu'za kumi'ma hu'naza kumira eri zamaveri nehie. <verse eid="JOB 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Antahi'zazmia eri hagaro hige'za kefo avu'ava'ma hu'naza zana keama nehazageno, hanavenentake naneke hige'za kumi zamavu'zmava zana atre'za rukrahera nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Hanki zamagrama Anumzamofo nanekema nentahi'za, amage'ma antesnageno'a, nama'a kafuma kasefa'ma hu'za manisaza kna'afina Anumzamo'a asomu huzmantesigeno no mani'zazmimo'a knare hanige'za, muse hu'za manigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Hianagi zamagrama Agri kema ontahisnazana, ha' vahe'mo'za e'za bainati kazinteti eme zamahe frisnage'za, e'i anazana na'a agafare fore nehie keamara osu'za neginagi vahe frigahaze. <verse eid="JOB 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>Anumzamofoma zamefi'ma hunemiza vahe'mo'za, Anumzamo'ma zamuvro'ma antea zankura zamarimpa ahenentaze. Ana nehu'za Anumzamo'ma zamazama hanigura zavi krafa hu'za antahi'nogaze. <verse eid="JOB 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Ana monko avu'avaza hume nevu'za, ozafa orene'za kasefa vahe nefrize. <verse eid="JOB 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'ma zamatrege'za knazampima unefrazana, na'ankure ana knazamo'ma hanige'za zmatafima mani'ne'za Agrite rukrahe hu'za esnageno zamagu vazino zamavaresnigu anara nehie. <verse eid="JOB 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>Jopuga amama mani'nana knazampintira Anumzamo'a kavre atreteno, knaza omane kumate kavrenteno knare'nare ne'za tratera retro hugante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Hianagi kagra kefo avu'ava'za nehana ne' mani'nanankino Anumzamo'a refko huno negeno, fatgo huno kazeri havizana nehie. <verse eid="JOB 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Hianagi mago vahe'mo'ma feno zanteti'ma regvatagama hu'zankura kva huo. Ana nehunka zamatrege'za zagoreti masavea hu'za kumipina kavre onteho. <verse eid="JOB 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Kagrama antesnana fenozamo'ene, maka hankaveka'amo'a ama knazampintira kaza osutfa hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 36:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Ana hu'negu ame huno haninkisie hunka haninkura avega onto. Na'ankure knazamo'a kenagera ame huno eno, kumazamifintira vahera eme zamazeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Kagra kegava hu'nenka havi kavukva zampintira atrenka rukrahe huo. Na'ankure havi kavukva zampinti atrenka rukrahe hunka esane huno Anumzamo'a knazana kagritera atregeno ne-e. <verse eid="JOB 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>Antahiho! Anumzana hankavenentake hu'neankino, ina ne'mo Agrama rempima hunezamiankna nera mani'ne? <verse eid="JOB 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Mago vahe'mo'a Anumzamofonkura, e'ina huo hunora osamige, Kagra mago zana eri haviza hu'nane hunora huontegahie. <verse eid="JOB 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Hagi Agrama hankave eri'zama eri'nea zanku Agrira agi'a husga nehu'za, zagamera hu'za humuse huntegahaze. Ana hu'negu kagranena zagame hunka humuse hunto. <verse eid="JOB 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Maka vahe'mo'za Agrama tro hu'nea zana, ko ke'naze. Hianagi Anumzamo'ma so'e antahi'zanteti'ma eri'zama eri'nea zana afeteti ke'nazanki'za, keso'ea osu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Tamage, Anumzamo'a tagri antahi'zana agatereno rankrerfa hu'ne. Ana hu'neankita Agrira kafu'amo'a nama'a hu'nefi keta eri forera hugara osu'none. <verse eid="JOB 36:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>Agra higeno mopafinti timo'a amu huno marerino, hampo ome seteno tina fore huno kora nerie. <verse eid="JOB 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>Ana ko'mo'ma hampompinti'ma eramiana knare huno maka vahete runente. <verse eid="JOB 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Anami monafima hampoma eritama rente'nea zana, iza keno antahinora nehanigeno, Anumzamo'ma nemanifinti'ma monagema nehia zana, inankna huta keta antahitara hugahune? <verse eid="JOB 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Anumzamo'a higeno Agrama mani'nea tavaontera kopsi'namo'a marave huno azeri kanegigeno, masa'amo'ma amefenkame'ma hagerimofo ro'are'ma uneramia zana ko. <verse eid="JOB 36:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>E'inahu hankave'areti Anumzamo'a maka vahera kegava hunezmanteno, ne'zana rama'a zamige'za atupara nosaze. <verse eid="JOB 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Agra kevema hiaza huno kopasi'na azampi eri'neno, inantego ahetresuema huno hirega ahenetre. <verse eid="JOB 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Hagi Anumzamo'ma higeno monagema hiazamo'a, ununko atugahie huno hunerasamigeno, bulimakao afutamimo'za zamagranena anazanke hu'za nentahize.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="s">Elihu'a mago'ene ununko'ma tania zanku hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>Ama anazama fore'ma nehigeno'a nagu'amo'a antari nehigeno, tumo'nimo'a fakrofakro nehie. <verse eid="JOB 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Anumzamo'ma kema nehigeno agerumo'ma monagemo'ma nehiazama huno atineramiana tamagesa ante'netma antahi so'e hiho. <verse eid="JOB 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Ana monagemofo agasasa anami monafina atregeno vuno eno huvaga neregeno, kopasi'namofo masa'a atregeno mopamo'ma umetre eme atrema hu'nerega vuno eno nehie. <verse eid="JOB 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Hagi kopasi'nama erigetama ketonkeno anantera, Anumzamofona hankavenentake agerumo'a monagemo'ma hiaza higeta nentahune. Anumzamo'ma kema nehigeno'a, kopasi'namo'ma nehiaza huno masa'amo'a rumarave huno vuno eno nehie. <verse eid="JOB 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Anumzamofo agerumo'a monagemo'ma nehiaza hu'neankino, so'e zantfa huno knare hu'ne. Agra tusi'a hankave'areti, tagri antahi'zana agatereno ranra eri'zana e'neriankita, anazana tagra keta antahita osugahune. <verse eid="JOB 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Agra higeno ko'mopa komo'a moparera runentegeno, rankora huntegeno tusiza huno mopafina nerie <verse eid="JOB 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Ana'ma nehige'za maka vahe'mo'za eri'zana e'ori atre'za amne mani'ne'za, Agri hankave'a negaze. <verse eid="JOB 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Hagi ana knafina afi zagagafamo'za koro fre'za vu'za, fra'makiza nemaniza havegampino, kerigampi ome fra'nekize. <verse eid="JOB 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Hagi kagigagi zahomo'a agrama nemaniregati ne-egeno, ra zahomo'a zasi avareno ne-e. <verse eid="JOB 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Anumzamo'ma asimu'ma nentegeno'a tusi zasi nehigeno, tintamimo'a fonupareno kragenefe. <verse eid="JOB 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Anumzamo'a hampompina tina eri atru huno erivineteno, kopasi'na atregeno ana hampompina ruganani huno vuno eno nehie. <verse eid="JOB 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Anumzamo'a vuo huno'ma hunterega vuno hampomo'a ome eri tru hutere huno neme. E'ina hihoma huno huzmanteaza hu'za maka kaziga ama mopamofo agofetura vano nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Mago'a zupa Anumzamo'a vagaore avesizama'a zamaveri huge knazama zamige, hunaku kora atregeno nerie. <verse eid="JOB 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>Jopuga kagesa ante'nenka ama nanekea antahio, Anumzamo'ma ruzahu ruzahu zantamima eri fore'ma nehia zantamina negenka antahintahia erio. <verse eid="JOB 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Anumzamo'a hakare zana kegava hu'neankino, kopsi'nama huntegeno hampompinti'ma ruganani huno'ma vuno eno'ma nehia zana kagra kenka antahinka nosampi? <verse eid="JOB 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Maka zama tro'ma hu'zana Anumzamo'a antahi ani' hu'neankino, hampoma ante agofetu agofetu huno antegeno anami kankamumpima me'nea zana kagra kenka antahinka nosampi? <verse eid="JOB 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Hagi sauti kazigati'ma zaho'ma ne-ea zahomo'a omegeno, anante maka zamo'a kazara osuno oti fatgo higeno'a, kamu'namo'a kukenaka'a pasunekie. <verse eid="JOB 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>Anumzamo'a higeno bronsireti'ma tro'ma hu'naza kapoteti'ma masamo'ma rumarave nehiaza huno, amuho zamo'a hamponteti ome antegeno eneramie. Ana hu'neanki, kagra e'ina hu'zana hugara hu'nampi? <verse eid="JOB 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>E'ina hu'negu tagra na'ane huta Anumzamofonkura hugahumpi rempi huramio. Tagripina mago antahi'zana omane'neankita, mago knare nanekea huta tagra'a tagura ovazigahune. <verse eid="JOB 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Nagrama mago nanekema hunaku'ma nehanugeno'a, mago'a Anumzamofona asami'nageno agesa ante'neno keagani'a antahi so'ea hugahifi? I'o anara osuno nagrira nazeri haviza hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Monafima me'nea hampoma zahomo'ma eri papama hutrenigeno, zagemo'ma tusiza huno amuhoma hanigeta, zagefina tavua onketfa hugahune. <verse eid="JOB 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>E'ina avamente noti kazigati'ma tusi'a tavi'ma ne-ea tavimofo masa'amo'a goligna nehie. E'i Anumzankino avasase zama'amo azeri kaginte'negeno, hankavenentake masa zama'afi ne-e. <verse eid="JOB 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Hankavenentake Anumzamofona tusi'a hihamu'a me'neankita, Agri avatera erava'oa osugahune. Hianagi Agra fatgo huno refko nehia Anumza mani'neankino, tazeri havizana nosie. <verse eid="JOB 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Anama hiazamo hige'za vahe'mo'za Agrira koro hunentaze. Hagi ama' antahi'zane vahe mani'nonema hu'zama nehaza vahera antahi nozamie.<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a agafa huno Jopuma keaga asami'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Hagi tusi'a kagigagi zaho erino efi Anumzamo'a mani'neno, Jopuna amanage huno kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>Jopuga kagrira knare antahi'zana omane'ne. Ana hu'neankinka Nagrama eri'zama erinaku'ma retro'ma hua zankura neginagi nanekea nehane. <verse eid="JOB 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Nagra menina kagenoka hu'za huanki, vene'ne antahi'za erinka oti hankavetio. Ana nehunka Nagri kere'ma kenonama hananku trotra huo. <verse eid="JOB 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>Kagra iga mani'nankena ama mopamofona tra'a eri agafa hu'na trora hu'noe? Kagra e'i anazama antahi ama'ma hu'nesunka nasamio. <verse eid="JOB 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Ama mopamofo za'za'ane atupa'ane amu'noma'anema nofi'ma (measurement) avazu huno ke nofira iza tro hunte'ne? E'i ana zana kagra ko kenka antahinka hu'nampi? <verse eid="JOB 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Ama mopamo'ma agofetu'ma me'nea trara na'amo azeri hanavenetigeno, ome renage eme renage huntete'ma me'nea haveramina, ome regari eme regari hunte'ne? <verse eid="JOB 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>Hagi kotu ofumo'za anazama nege'za magoka zamagira ante'za zagamera nehazage'za, ankero ramimo'zanena ranke hu'za kezati'za musenkasea hu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>Hagerimo'ma ruvarehiramino mopafima ezankura ama anante megahane huno iza huntegeno me'ne? <verse eid="JOB 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>Hagerimofona hamponteti Nagra kukenama hiaza hu'na eri ano vazinente'na, hagerina kumazu haninu eri anakinte'noe. <verse eid="JOB 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>Ana nehu'na hagerimoka agaterenka ovunka, amare megahane nehu'na, hagerimo'ma ome atre eme atrema hu'nea ankina ankina, kafa erigi'na rentarako hunte'noe. <verse eid="JOB 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>Ana nehu'na amanage hu'na asami'noe. Kavufgama erisgama nehana hagerimoka amare marenka eme netrenka, mago'enena agatarenka ovuo hu'na asami'noe. <verse eid="JOB 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>Hagi Jopuga mago zupa masa huo hunka hankeno nanterana rumsa nehigenka, kotu masagura hunka remasa hunka marerio hunka hankeno anara hu'nefi? <verse eid="JOB 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>Hagi kagra mago zupa huntankeno nanterama remasama hia masazamo'a, ama mopama ometre eme trema hu'nerega vuno eno huvaga nereno, havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamazeri ama hige'za tavimofo korora hu'za fre'nazafi? <verse eid="JOB 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Zagema marerino rumasama higeno'a, kokamo'a ruzahe huno ama tfaza higeno, avonkrenankre tvaravemo'ma nehiaza huno avasese'amo'a so'e zantfa nehie. <verse eid="JOB 38:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Hagi zagema marerino remsama hige'za, kefo zamavu'zmava zama nehaza vahe'mo'zama hanimpima vano nehu'za, vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mo'za zamazana ruhantgi trege'za anara nosaze. <verse eid="JOB 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>Kagra Jopuga hagerimpina uraminka hagerimo'ma agafa huno ne-ea kampuira ome negenka, hagerimo'ma amefenkame'ma urami'neama'a ome keme vunka kevaga re'nampi? <verse eid="JOB 38:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Fri vahe'mokizmi kuma kafaramima me'neama'a ko negenka, hanintirima hu'nea hanizamofo kafantamina ko ke'nampi? <verse eid="JOB 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Ama mopamo'ma ra huno vuno eno'ma hu'neana kagra kenka antahinka hu'nampi? Kagrama ana maka zantamima ko'ma antahi vagare'nesunka nasamio. <verse eid="JOB 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>Masamo'ma mani'neno'ma ne-ea kumara kagra kenampi? Hanimo'ma nemania kumara iga me'ne? <verse eid="JOB 38:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Kagra kana ke'nana zanaveri hanankeke masamo'ene, hanimokea zanagrama nemani'a nonkumatega vuke eke hugahapi? <verse eid="JOB 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Kagra ko antahi'nane, na'ankure maka zana forera osu'negenka kagra ko fore hugota hu'nanankino, kafukamo'a rama'a hu'negahie! <verse eid="JOB 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>Aisimo'ma aviteno me'neno eneramia nona ome negenka, ko'mopa ko'mo'ma aviteno me'neno eneramia nona ke'nano? <verse eid="JOB 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>E'i ana zantamima retro huntogeno'ma me'neana, hazenke knama esanige'nama ha'ma hanuaza retro huntogeno me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 38:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Kopsinamo'ma ruganini huno vuno eno'ma nehia kana iga me'ne? Zage hanati kazigati zaho'ma erino vuno enoma nehia nonkuma'a iga me'ne? <verse eid="JOB 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Monafinti'ma avune ko'mo'ma herafi ramino'ma eneramia tinkana iza tro hunte'ne? Monamo'ma monagema huteno agasasama runo'ma vuno eno'ma hania kana iza varinte'ne? <verse eid="JOB 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>Vahe'ma omani hagege ka'ma kokampina, iza kora atregeno runente? <verse eid="JOB 38:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>Ana mopafina kora, zafane trazanena omanenegeno mago zana omanetfa hu'neane. Hianagi iza kora atregeno eno mopa eme rufru higeno, trazamo'a ete hageno marenerie? <verse eid="JOB 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Ko'mofona nafa'a mani'nefi? Iza ata komofona nafa'a mani'neno atregeno eneramie? <verse eid="JOB 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Aisimofona iza anta'a mani'ne? Hagi iza monafintira aisi atakora kase atregeno eneramie? <verse eid="JOB 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Zasi ko'matia knafina, tintamimo'a hankavetino havegna nehigeno, hagerimofo agofetu'ma aisima neramino'a azeri karagenefe. <verse eid="JOB 38:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>Hagi Pleiadesie nehaza hanafitamima, monare'ma me'nea zana Jopuga seni nofitetira magopi anaki nezmantenka, Orioniema nehaza hnafitamima anaki zmante'nea nofira ahekanora hugahampi? <verse eid="JOB 38:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Ana nehunka kagra ana hanafitamina hananke'za, mago kafufina kna'zamire efore hutere nehanagenka, Beane mofavre naga'anema hu'za nehaza hanafitamina kagra kegava huzmantegahampi? <verse eid="JOB 38:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>Monafima ruzahu ruzahu zantamima me'naza zamo'za amage'ma nentaza kasegea kagra antahi'nampi? Ana'ma hu'nesnunka kagra hananke'za ama mopafi maka zantamimo'zanena ana kasegea amage antegahazafi? <verse eid="JOB 38:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>Kagra monafima me'nea hampona kezati misankeno, kora atrenigeno eramino kora kahegahifi? <verse eid="JOB 38:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Kopasi'nagu'ma hunka mago kaziga vuo hunka'ma huntesnankeno'ma nevuno'a, e'ina huoma hunka hunantana zana hugahue hunora hugahifi? <verse eid="JOB 38:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Iza knare antahi'zana, vahe agu'afina nenteno, ama' antahi'zana vahe'mofo antahi'zampina ante'ne? <verse eid="JOB 38:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Iza knare antahi'zampina avite'nesnimo maka hampontamina hamprigara hu'ne? Ana nehuno monafima me'negeno anampinti'ma ko'ma neria mopa kavoa eriragisigeno ko'mo'a herafiramigahie? <verse eid="JOB 38:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>Anama higeno'a kugusopamo'a ome runtrako huno eme hanavetigeno, hihi huno magopi marenerie. <verse eid="JOB 38:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>Zamagama netegenka Laioni anenta'a ramine, laioniraminena zagagafa ahezminke'za nenazafi? <verse eid="JOB 38:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>Ana laioniramimo'za havegampine, kafoma ante'za nemaniza trazampinti etirami'za zamagra'a anara nosazafi? <verse eid="JOB 38:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Kotkotiema nehaza namaramimo'za ne'zanku'ma hake'za vano vanoma nehazageno, anenta'arimo'za ne'zama nesaza zanku'ma Anumzamo'naregama krafama nehazageno'a, iza ne'zana nezamie?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma mago'ene Jopuma asamino vu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>Hagi agonafima nemaniza afi meme afutamimo'za anenta'ma nentaza kna fatgoa kagra antahi'nampi? Kagra nezmaganke'za afi dia afu'mo'za anentara nentazafi? <verse eid="JOB 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Memene dia afumofo anentamo'zama nezmarera arimpafima nemaniza ikama'a antahi'nano? Nezamarera'ma kase zamantesnia kna kagra kenka antahinka hu'nampi? <verse eid="JOB 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Memene dia afumo'zama anenta'ma antenakura, zamaga renamagi'za mopare manine'za anentara antazageno zamatazamo'a amne nehie. <verse eid="JOB 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Ana hutazage'za ana anentatamimo'za ta'nopafi mani'ne'za nena hute'za, nezamarerana atre'zama nevu'za ete rukrahera hu'za nomaze. <verse eid="JOB 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>Afi donki afu'ma rente'naza nofira iza katufegeno fru huno vano nehie? <verse eid="JOB 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Hagege huno tra'zama omane'nea ka'ma koka zamuge'za nemanizage'na, hagemoke'ma hu'nea mopa Nagra zamuge'za nonkuma zamia ante'za nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Ana donki afutamimo'za ran kumapima nemaniza vahe'mofo zamagasasankegura zamavaresra nehu'za, vahe'mo'zama zamazeri agazonema hunaku'ma kema nehazage'za, kezmia nontahize. <verse eid="JOB 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Ana donki afutamimo'za agonaramimpina vano nehu'za, tra'zama nesnagura hake'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="JOB 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>Afi bulimakaomo'a fru huno mani'neno kagri eri'zana erigahifi? Ana nehuno hanima hanigeno'a bulimakao afu nompina emasegahifi? <verse eid="JOB 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Afi bulimakao afu'mofona kare namare zafare nofira rentetenka, hanankeno kamagera nevuno, hozafina mopa rekorino vugahifi? <verse eid="JOB 39:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Kagra ana bulimakao afu'mofo hankavegura antahineminka, atresnankeno amuhoma hu'nesia eri'zanka'a eri kantegahifi? <verse eid="JOB 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Kagra ana afi bulimakao afumofo hankavegu nentahinka atresnankeno, hozakafintira witia erino witi honama neharafina vugahifi? <verse eid="JOB 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>Mananinkna za'za anankene namama Ostritsie nehaza namamo'a, muse nehuno agekona rutafra tafra nehie. Hianagi azokamo'a za'za aginkunane afi patomofo azoka knara osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Ostriti namamo'za mopamofo agofetu amura antete'za zamatre'za vazageno mopamofo amuhomo zamazeri amuho hige'za nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>Hagi vahe'mo'o, mago afi zagamo'o agiareti amu'ama rempoke zankura Ostritsimo'a agesa nontahie. <verse eid="JOB 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Zamagri'ma zamatama krige'zama kase zamante'naza zankura ontahi'za, ru namamo'ma kase zamante'nea anenta'ma hiaza hu'za kegavahu so'e nosaze. <verse eid="JOB 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a knare antahi'zana nomino, antahi ama'ma hu'zana agripintira eri atre'negu huno anara nehie. <verse eid="JOB 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Hianagi ana Ostritsi namamo'ma otino agama nereana, tusi avune anteno agama nerea hosi afu'ene agumpima mani'nea vahera agatereno nevie. <verse eid="JOB 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>Kagra Jopuga hosi afu'mofona hankavea neminka, anankempima me'nea azokara kagra hankeno fore huno me'nefi? <verse eid="JOB 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Kagra hosi afu'mofona hankavea aminkeno ranra kenumo'zama nehazaza huno takaunerefi? Hosi afu'mo'zama zamageru'ma nerazazamo'a vahera zamazeri koro nehie. <verse eid="JOB 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Ana hosi afu'mo'za zamagra'a hankavegu nentahi'za, haru hu'za mareri'za tami'za nehu'za zamagareti mopa rentrako nehu'za, hatera zamagare'za nevaze. <verse eid="JOB 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Hosi afumo'za korora hu'za antahintahi hakarea osu, bainati kazinteti'ma ha'ma nehazage'za hapintira atre'za korora nofraze. <verse eid="JOB 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Ana hosi afumo'za hapima nevazageno kevegumo'a vagare vagare nehigeno, karugaru kevereti'ene keveretira zagemofo masamo'a rumarave nehie. <verse eid="JOB 39:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Ha'ma agafa hunaku nehigeno, paziveteti'ma ufema regeno'a, hosi afumo'a haru huno marerino tamino nehuno manirava oheno, aga zanteti hankavetino mopa nemasagie. Ana nehuno agareno ha'pina unefre. <verse eid="JOB 39:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Paziveteti'ma ufema neraza krafagema hosimo'ma nentahino'a, oho huno nehuno ha'ma afete ne-egeno'a, ha'mofo mna nentahie. Ana nehuno hate'ma ugotama hu'naza sondia vahe'mokizmi zamagerura nentahino, sondia vahe'mo'zama ivigema hu'za aza zamagasasankea nentahie. <verse eid="JOB 39:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>Jopuga kagri antahi'za amage anteno, tumpamo'a ageko'na rutarerino sauti kaziga enevifi? <verse eid="JOB 39:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Hagi kagra hankeno tumpamo'a haresga huno marerino vahe'mo'ma mareoriga'afina nona negifi? <verse eid="JOB 39:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Ana tumpamo'a have ra'nafi manino vano nehuno, kenagera anampinka nemase. Hagi nozamimo'a hankave kuma'zami me'neanki'za knare hu'za nemanize. <verse eid="JOB 39:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Ana kumate'ma manine'za, ahe'zama nenaza zaga afete mani'nazanagi, amne nezamagaze. <verse eid="JOB 39:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Hagi tumpamo'ma mago zagama aheteno'a, ana zaga erino eno anenta'amofona eme amigeno, korama'a anivazu huno nene. Frino kasri'nesia zagamofo avufgama me'nesirega, tumpamo'za ome atru nehanagenka zamagegahane.<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma Jopuma kenona hunte'nea zamofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Anante Ra Anumzamo'a amanage huno Jopuna asami'ne, <verse eid="JOB 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>Kagra hankavenentake Anumzamofona keha' rentenka nevunka, Agrira azeri fatgo hunaku nehampi? Ana hugahue hunka hanananagi, Nagrama kagenokama hanugenka, Nagri kerera, kenona hugahampi? <verse eid="JOB 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Anante Jopu'a amanage huno kenona Ra Anumzamofona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>Nagra amne zaga mani'noanki, inankna hu'na kagri kerera kenona hugahue? Nagra nzanteti nagira ruhamunki'na manigahue. <verse eid="JOB 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Nagra ko rama'a nanekea hu'noanki'na, mago'enena keaga osugahue.<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Hagi kagigagi zahomo'ene komo'ene huno efi Ra Anumzamo'a mani'neno, Jopuna amanage huno asami'ne, <verse eid="JOB 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>Kagra vene'ne antahintahi erinka oti hankavetio. Na'ankure mago'a kagenoka hugahuanki, eri ama hunka kagra kenona hunanto. <verse eid="JOB 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>Kagra hanavetinka keaga hunka, nagri navu'navamo'a knare hu'ne hunka nehane. Hianagi nagrira huhaviza nehunka, Jopuga kagra'agura mani fatgo hu'na mani'noe hunka nehane. <verse eid="JOB 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Kagri hankavemo'a Anumzamo'na hankavegna hu'nefi? Kagrama kageru'ma nerankeno'a, Anumzamo'nama nageru'ma nerugeno monagema hianknara huno, kagri kagerumo'a monagea nehifi? <verse eid="JOB 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Hagi kagra knare'ma hu'nesanunka, kukena hiaza hunka hihamu hanaveka'afi mani'nege'za, vahe'mo'za negage'za rankagi negami'za husga huganteho. <verse eid="JOB 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Kagra krimpa ahe'zana atregeno eama nehaningenka, zamavufaga rama nehaza vahera zamazeri fenkami atro. <verse eid="JOB 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza vahera krimpa ahenezamantenka, uruha zamagege'za zamavufaga anteramiza maniho. <verse eid="JOB 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Ana nehunka ana vahera kugusopafi asene zamantenka, fri vahe kumapi kina huzmanto. <verse eid="JOB 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Jopuga anama hananke'na knare'za hane hu'na kagri kagia husga hugahue. Na'ankure kagrika'a hankavemo kaguvazigahie.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>Hagi kagri'ma tro hu'noa zama hu'na hanavenentake tusizaga hipopotamosiema nehaza afi zaga tro huntogeno mani'neno bulimakao afu'mo'ma trazama nenea zama huno trazama neneana ko. <verse eid="JOB 40:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Ana zagamofo amagenafima me'neno hihamuma nemia ame'a negenka, amurugufima me'neno hankavema nemia ame'a ko. <verse eid="JOB 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Ana zagamofo risonamo'a sida zafamo'ma hiaza huno hankavenentake hu'ne. Hagi agia zampima me'nea ame'amo'a magopi eri tru hutere hu'neankino tusi hankaveti'ne. <verse eid="JOB 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Ana hipopotamosimofo zaferinamo'a bronsireti'ma tro'ma hu'naza paipugna higeno, agia zampi zaferinamo'a aini zafagna hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Anumzamo'na mago'a zaga kfama tro'ma huzmante'nofintira hipopotamosimo'a maka ruzamagatere'ne. Ana hu'neankino tro'ma hunte'nesimoke, ahesnigeno frigahie. <verse eid="JOB 40:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Hagi agona ramimpima afi zaga kfamo'zama zokago'ma nerazafi, hipopotamosimo'ma nenea trazamo'a hageno marenerie. <verse eid="JOB 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Nerga asinagna traza lotusine, uha'enema tirupima nehaga'a trazamofo agafafi frakino nemase. <verse eid="JOB 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Tinkenare'ma hageno mareneria trazanku'ma lotusiema nehaza trazampi freno mase'negeno, tona'mo reso huntegeno nemanie. <verse eid="JOB 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Hagi tusi avunema anteno hageno ea tinkura korora nosuno, Jodani timo'enema hageno ankena regama varehiramino ea zanku'enena korora nosie. <verse eid="JOB 40:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Hagi avunteno mani'neno kvama hu'nesnia vahe'mo'a aze'origahie. Ana nehuno agonagampina nofitetira renteno avazu huno ovugahie.<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma mago'ene Jopuma keaga asamino vu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>Hagi agaza hunte tusizankna osifavema Leviataniema nehaza osifavekrerfa, hagerimpima nemaniana Jopuga hukuretira avazu nehunka, nofitetira agefu'narera anakigahampi? <verse eid="JOB 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Agonagampina nofira rentetenka, avazu hunka nevunka, ameragempina reraponentenka nofira rentegahampi? <verse eid="JOB 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Ana'ma hanankeno'a kasunku hunantenka natro hunora fru kea hugahifi? <verse eid="JOB 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Ana nehuno nagra mago narimpa huanki'na kagri eri'za vahe manine'na, kazokazo eri'za erigante vava hu'na vugahue hunora hugahifi? <verse eid="JOB 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Namama avrenka kegavama nehana zana hunka kegava nehunka, nofitera rentetenka ne'one mofaneka'a zaminanke'za zokagora rentegahazafi? <verse eid="JOB 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Hagi zago vahe'mo'za ana zagama mizasenakura, mizama'agura keha rete'za, ana zaga ahe'za akafari osi osi hu'za eri'za maketifina zagorera ome atregahazafi? <verse eid="JOB 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Hagi ana zaga, nozamema nehaza keveretira asenifine avufgafinena ahegresogreso hugahampi? <verse eid="JOB 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Hagi ana zagamofo avufgare'ma kazama antenka kesanunka, henka'anena anara osugahue hunka hugahane. Na'ankure ana'ma hanugeno'ma henka'ama ha'ma hunantesniana, havizantfa hugahie hunka kagesa antahigahane. <verse eid="JOB 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Hagi antahio, kagrama hunka ana zagama azerisanue hunka'ma kagesama nentahisanunka anara osuo. Na'ankure ana zagama azerisanuema huno hania vahera ana zagamo'a refaki hutregahie. <verse eid="JOB 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Mago vahe'mo'a ana leviatani'ema nehaza zaga azeri oraotigahie. Ana'ma haniana iza oti hankaveti'neno hara hunantegahie? <verse eid="JOB 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Iza mago zana nami'nesanigu hu'na, ete nona hu'na amigahue? Na'ankure ama mopafima maka zama me'nea zantamina, Nagri zanke me'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>Hagi leviataniema nehaza zagama hage rimpima nemania zagamofo hankavene, avufgane agia azankrefagura eri ama hu'na kasamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Ana zagamofo avufagare'ma me'nea irira iza eri kanope netreno, agofetu agofetu'ma huno'ma hankave avufgama me'neana iza reraponegahie? <verse eid="JOB 41:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Ana zagamofona ave krerfa hunte'neanki'za, vahe'mo'za koro nehaze. E'ina hu'neankino, iza ana zaga aheno agemzampa atavegrigahie? <verse eid="JOB 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Ana zagamofo amagenafina iri'amo'a, magopi rukamaretere huno evuevu hu'neankino hankavetino hankogna hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>Ana zagamofo iri'amo'a, magopi akamareno hantohanto hu'neankino, zahomo'ma ufrega kana omane'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Mago mago irimo'a agu'afinka, mago irite rukamaretere huno azeri hankaveti'ne. Ana hu'neankino eri kanopeno eri rure'rurera hugara osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Hagi ana zagamo'ma kasi'ma haniana, agonagampintira teve ruganani huno vuno eno nehigeno, avurgafintira nantera zagema marerino zagemo'ma remsama hiaza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Ana zagamofo agipintira teve ruganani huno vuno eno nehigeno, agipintira tevemo'a hagna hagna huno atineramie. <verse eid="JOB 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Ana nehigeno kavofima tima tagino, tevere kre'negeno krakra hiaza huno, agonagampintira amu'mo'a rugasu huno enevie. <verse eid="JOB 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Hagi agipinti'ma evia zahomo'a tanknu'zafima tevema nerea tevea hukru higeno rukaru nehigeno, teve nefamo'a agipintira hagna hagna huno nere. <verse eid="JOB 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Ana zagamofo anankempina tusi'a hankave me'neankino, inantego vanoma hiana, tusiza huno vahera zamazeri koro nehie. <verse eid="JOB 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Ana zagamofo avufgamo'ma marerino tamino'ma hu'nea ma'amo'a, magopi ruhampri ruhampri huno antrako huno hankaveti'neankino, eri pahesi rure rure'ma hu'amo'a amuho hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Ana zagamofo tumo'amo'a havegna huno hanavetineankino, witima refuzafunepaza havegna hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Ana zagamo'ma o'manetige'za hankave vahe'mo'za koro nehu'za, na'a hugahune hu'za kanku nehakaze. <verse eid="JOB 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Ana hu'neankino bainati kazintetiro, keveretiro, karugru keveretiro, osi have kazintetira mago vahe'mo'a ana zaga ahegara osu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>Hagi ainireti'ma tro'ma hu'naza ha' zantamima ana zagamo'ma keana, trazankna huno keamne zankna nehuno, bronsireti'ma tro'ma hu'naza ha' zantamima keana, kasari'nea zafagna hu'ne. <verse eid="JOB 41:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Vahe'mo'za kevea ahe tresnageno mani'nesnirega vugahianagi, korora ofregahie. Gumi atifina havea erinte'za ahegahazanagi ana havemo'a hagege trazamo'ma avufgare'ma avako'ma hiankna hugahie. <verse eid="JOB 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Kumpa kanoma kesaniana, trazankna huno ke amnezaneseno, karugru kevema matrevuno atresigeno esania zamofo agasasama nentahino'a kiza regahie. <verse eid="JOB 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Ana zagamofo asagufima me'nea irimo'a, mopa kavomo'ma rupararo vazigeno asane'neankna hu'ne. Ana hu'neankino, mopafima regararo heno'ma nevigeno'a, mopa vazikekurino nevie. <verse eid="JOB 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Hagi hagerimpima nevigeno'a, kavofima tima afino tevefi kre'negeno timo'ma krakra hiaza huno, hagerimo'a krakra huteno masavemo'ma ze'ze'ma nehiaza nehie. <verse eid="JOB 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Ana zagamo'ma hagerimpima nevigeno'ma, amefi'ma timo'ma agrege'ma huno nevia zamo'a rumsa huno efeke hu'neankino, mago kavrinteaza nehie. Ana nehigeno ana zamo'a tavava ozafamofo efeke azoka kna huno efeke nehie. <verse eid="JOB 41:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>Ama mopafina mago agrikna zaga omani'neankino, mago zagagura korora nosie. <verse eid="JOB 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>Maka zagama mani'naza zagafina, agra zamagatereno avufga ra nehie. Ana hu'neankino maka afi zagama mani'nazana zamagatereno kini mani'ne.<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s">Jopu'ma kugusopafi mase'neno asunku'ma hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Hagi anante Jopu'a amanage huno Ra Anumzamofona kenona hunte'ne, <verse eid="JOB 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>Nagrama antahi'noana nazano hunaku'ma hanana zana amne nehanankeno, mago vahe'mo'a e'ina hu'zana osuo huno osugahie. <verse eid="JOB 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Kagra nantahigenka, iza antahintahi'a omane vahe'mo Nagri knare antahi'zankura nagenoka hu'ne hunkama hu'nanana? E'i ana vahera nagragi'na, ke'na antahi'na osugeno nagri antahi'zampinena omaneanagi, knare zantfama hu'nea zanku amne keaga hu'noe. <verse eid="JOB 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>Anumzamoka hunka, Jopuga kagesa naminege'na keaga nehu'na, mago'a kagenoka hugahuanki kenirera nona hunanto hunka hu'nane. <verse eid="JOB 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Kora vahe'mo'za kagri kagenkea nehazage'na antahi'noe. Hianagi menina nagra'a navufinti kagoe. <verse eid="JOB 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Maka nanekema hu'noana ete erue. Ana nehu'na menina nasunku'ma huazana ama tanefapine kugusopafi mani'ne'na erinte ama hue.<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jopuna roneamokizmigu Anumzamo'a mago rimpa huozmante'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Hagi Jopu'enema keagama Ra Anumzamo'ma huvagamareteno'a, amanage huno Temani kumateti ne' Elifasinkura hu'ne, Kagri'ene tare ronekagu'enena tusi narimpa aheramante'noe. Na'ankure Nagri eri'za ne' Jopu'ma nagriku'ma tamagema huno huamama hiaza huta, Nagri navu'nava zankura tamagra tamage huta huamara osu'naze. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>E'ina hu'negu tamagra 7ni'a ve bulimakao afu'ene 7ni'a ve sipisipi afu'ene avreta Nagri eri'za ne' Jopunte vuta, tamagra'agu huta tevefi kre fanane hu' ofa ome hiho. Ana nehinkeno, Nagri eri'za ne' Jopu'ma tamagriku huno, nunamuma hanige'na, tamagra neginagi kema huta Nagri navu'nava zanku'ma tamage huta huama'ma osu'naza zantera, Jopu nunamuna antahi'na knazana ontamigahue. <verse eid="JOB 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Anagema hutege'za Temani kumateti ne' Elifasiki, Suha kumateti ne' Bildatiki, Nama kumateti ne' Zofariki hu'za Ra Anumzamo'ma hihoma huno huzmantea zana amage ante'za tro hu'naze. Ana hazageno Jopu'ma hia nunamuna Ra Anumzamo'a antahimi'ne.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a Jopuna mikazama'a ete ami'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Hagi rone'araminku'ma huno Jopu'ma nunamuma hutegeno'a, Ra Anumzamo'a knare nomani'za ete Jopuna ami'ne. Ko'ma Jopu'ma ante'nea fenozama havizama hu'nerera, tamagerfa huno Ra Anumzamo'a ana mika fenozana ete ami'neno, ana agofetura mago'ene ante agofetu huno amigeno rama'a fenoza ante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Anama hutege'za afu aganahe'zane asarehe'zane korapa rone'amo'zanena e'za noma'afina ne'zana eme ne'naze. Ana nehu'za Ra Anumzamo'ma knazama atregeno agrite'ma e'nea zankura, Jopuna eme zamasunku hunente'za, azeri hankaveti nanekea hu'naze. Ana nehu'za mago mago vahe'mo'a muse zana, zagone golireti'ma tro'ma hu'naza rini eritere hu'za eme ami'naze. <verse eid="JOB 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Ana higeno henka nomani'zama Jopu'ma manino vu'nea nomani zama'afina Ra Anumzamo'a asomu huntegeno ko'ma mani'nea nomanizana rugatere'ne. Higeno Jopu'a menina 14tauseni'a sipisipi afutami anteno, kemoli afutamina 6tauseni'a anteno, hozama e'neria bulimaka'ama zanazeri tragoteno rezmante'nea bulimakao afutamina 2tauseni'a anteno, a' tonki afutamina 1tauseni'a ante'ne. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Ana nehuno Ra Anumzamo'a ru'ene Jopuma ami'neana, 7ni'a ne' mofavre nemino, 3'a mofa'ne ami'ne. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Hagi ese mofa'mofona Jemima'e huno agia antenemino, anante mofa'mofona Kesia'e huno agia antenemino, nampa 3 mofakura Keren-Hapuku'e huno agia antemi'ne. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Hagi anama mani'naza mopa'afina, Jopu mofa'nemo'zama hiranto hu'za knare zantfama hu'nazankna mofa'nea omani'naze. Ana hu'neankino Jopu'ma fenone mopanema refko huno ne' mofavre naga'ama nezamino'a, ana mofane nagara ana zanke huno refko huno zami'ne. <verse eid="JOB 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Ana'ma huteno'a Jopu'a 140'a kafu mani'neno, agehone agigone azankonena ke'ne. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Ana'ma huteno'a Jopu'a knare'za huno za'zate maniteno, ozafa reno fri'ne.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
